
# game/end_game2.rpy:2
translate latin end_game2_2467797a:

    # "All this talk of Drusus, of his and [mc]'s apparently fixed destinies."
    "Totus hic sermo de Druso, de fatis Amici atque [mc] quae, ut videtur, fixa sunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:3
translate latin end_game2_a8e38200:

    # "That decision that wolves fawned over for generations, no matter what opinion they held about Drusus himself."
    "Illud consilium quod Lupi per aetates admirati sunt, quidquid de Druso ipso putarent."

# game/end_game2.rpy:4
translate latin end_game2_335bc4c2:

    # "The choice offered by the parents to either save his empire, or save his lover."
    "Electio a Parentibus oblata: aut imperium suum servare aut amantem suum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:5
translate latin end_game2_1f4af96c:

    # "Icy, cold fear and dread blooms in the pit of Amicus's stomach and slowly spreads throughout the rest of his body, seeming to leak like a frigid liquid down his groin and into his legs."
    "Gelidus frigidusque metus et horror in imo ventre Amici oriuntur et lente per reliquum corpus diffunduntur, quasi liquidum frigidum per inguen in crura fluat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:6
translate latin end_game2_e4fe1db4:

    # "The wolf feels his limbs tremble as he pulls the human closer to his chest, lips drawing back as instinct kicks in to protect his mate."
    "Lupus membra sua tremere sentit dum hominem pectori propius trahit, labris retractis cum instinctus eum socium suum protegere iubet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:7
translate latin end_game2_1e7e6ce8:

    # "For a long while, a length of time that's hard to discern, the wolf simply stares into the abyss."
    "Diu, per tempus quod difficile discernitur, lupus tantum in abyssum spectat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:8
translate latin end_game2_1539cf66:

    # "He looks up into the swirling stars, clouds, and planets, trying to see..."
    "Ad stellas, nubes planetasque volventes suspicit, videre conatus..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:9
translate latin end_game2_4087f70d:

    # "...trying to see these things that are controlling and manipulating him and his lover."
    "...videre conatus illas res quae Amicum atque amantem eius regunt et tractant."

# game/end_game2.rpy:10
translate latin end_game2_a35df207:

    # "Trembling, Amicus shakes his head, taking another step back, away, even though the presence of the parents is all-encompassing."
    "Tremens Amicus caput quatit, alium passum retro faciens, recedens, quamquam praesentia Parentum omnia circumdat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:11
translate latin end_game2_f767c1d6:

    # a "\"N—no...\""
    a "\"N—non...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:12
translate latin end_game2_8aa97d67:

    # "Amicus's jaw clenches, hating himself for sounding so weak and afraid."
    "Maxilla Amici contrahitur; se odit quod tam infirmus et territus sonet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:13
translate latin end_game2_eca45a64:

    # "Remembering who he is, the wolf squares his shoulders, glaring up into space."
    "Memor quis sit, lupus umeros firmat, iratus ad spatium siderale suspiciens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:14
translate latin end_game2_905e84c5:

    # a "\"No! I won't make such a decision!\""
    a "\"Non! Tale consilium non capiam!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:15
translate latin end_game2_06583084:

    # "For once, the unseen place in which the parents reside is silent, but clearly observant; Amicus can feel the prickle of their all-seeing eyes on the nape of his neck."
    "Semel locus invisibilis in quo Parentes habitant tacet, sed clare observat; Amicus oculorum omnia videntium aculeos in cervice sentit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:16
translate latin end_game2_d5f69205:

    # a "\"Y—you hear me!? I won't do it! I'll...I'll stay here forever if I have to! You can't involve us in this foolishness!\""
    a "\"A—auditisne me!? Non faciam! Hic...hic in perpetuum manebo si necesse est! Nos in hanc stultitiam implicare non potestis!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:17
translate latin end_game2_25051fcd:

    # "[mc] suddenly shifts in his grasp, his head turning awkwardly, leaning up in a strange way that seems unnatural, as if pulled up by strings."
    "[mc] subito in manibus eius movetur, capite inepte verso, mira atque innaturali ratione sursum inclinans, quasi filis sublatus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:18
translate latin end_game2_328ea982:

    # "Amicus flinches back, feeling a chill run up his spine as he tries to stop himself from dropping the human he knows so well."
    "Amicus retro horrescit, frigorem per spinam surgere sentiens dum conatur ne hominem quem tam bene novit demittat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:19
translate latin end_game2_a84279dd:

    # m "\"Foolishness?\""
    m "\"Stultitiam?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:20
translate latin end_game2_fc310673:

    # "[mc] stares at him with an expression that Amicus has never seen him make before."
    "[mc] eum vultu spectat qualem Amicus eum numquam antea facere vidit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:21
translate latin end_game2_e375dbbf:

    # "It's cold and almost dismissive, an expression Amicus has never seen him make before."
    "Frigidus est et paene contemnens, vultus quem Amicus eum numquam antea facere vidit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:22
translate latin end_game2_ead3c94d:

    # m "\"How does this situation, in which the lives of a trillion sapients teeter on the brink of annihilation, call for such childish statements? Tell us, in what universe would attempts to avoid such a catastrophic outcome be considered 'foolishness'?\""
    m "\"Quomodo haec condicio, in qua vitae mille miliardorum Sapientum in limite interitus pendent, tales pueriles voces postulat? Dic nobis: in quo universo conatus exitum tam calamitosum vitandi 'stultitia' habeantur?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:23
translate latin end_game2_043dc8da:

    # "The human suddenly tilts his head in an unnatural way, leaning in closer to the wolf and Amicus gasps, setting a large paw against [mc]'s face, trying to stop the strange, {i}inhuman{/i} movements."
    "Homo subito caput innaturali modo inclinat, ad lupum propius accedens; Amicus spiritum ducit et magnam manum faciei [mc] admovet, miros {i}inhumanos{/i} motus sistere conatus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:24
translate latin end_game2_d7725d11:

    # a "\"S—stop that. Don't hurt him!\""
    a "\"D—desine. Eum noli laedere!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:25
translate latin end_game2_72c20b66:

    # "The human holds the position for a moment, then seems to slowly relax back into the wolf's arms."
    "Homo paulisper situm tenet, deinde lente rursus in bracchiis lupi relaxari videtur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:26
translate latin end_game2_a299c627:

    # "Amicus feels his heart pounding in his chest."
    "Amicus cor in pectore vehementer pulsare sentit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:27
translate latin end_game2_07ada019:

    # "He'd provoked...well, not even anger from the parents, maybe just annoyance, yet the experience had been terrifying."
    "Excitaverat...bene, ne iram quidem Parentum, fortasse tantum taedium; tamen experientia terrifica erat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:28
translate latin end_game2_6ee7b42f:

    # "Seeing [mc] twist and contort in such a way was unnerving, sure, but the parents had meant to do it, and the wolf is beginning to realize why they're using [mc] as a puppet."
    "[mc] ita torqueri et contorqueri videre sollicitabat, certe; sed Parentes consulto fecerant, et lupus intellegere incipit cur [mc] pro pupa utantur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:29
translate latin end_game2_eaf4e4bf:

    # "Anger and fear battle for control over the wolf, before the latter finally wins out, remembering what type of decision he might have to make."
    "Ira et metus de lupo regendo pugnant, antequam tandem metus vincit, Amico recordante qualem electionem fortasse facere debeat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:30
translate latin end_game2_891462ed:

    # a "\"Please, there must be another way, I can't...I can't choose between these two things!\""
    a "\"Quaeso, alia via esse debet; non possum...inter has duas res eligere non possum!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:31
translate latin end_game2_27c9a9f1:

    # "There's a pause in the air, and Amicus feels his knees about to give out, preparing to throw himself at the imaginary feet of these monolithic beings."
    "Paulisper aer tacet; Amicus genua cessura sentit, paratus se ad fictos pedes harum immensarum rerum iacere."

# game/end_game2.rpy:32
translate latin end_game2_53210fac:

    # "He'd beg until the end of time, wolven pride be damned."
    "Usque ad finem temporis supplicaret, superbia Luporum maledicta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:33
translate latin end_game2_e480c67c:

    # m "\"What decision do you speak of?\""
    m "\"De qua electione loqueris?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:34
translate latin end_game2_517931dc:

    # "Amicus glances up again at the stars."
    "Amicus rursus ad stellas suspicit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:35
translate latin end_game2_42b81a19:

    # a "\"The—The decision presented to Drusus...the one decided for him by Meera ten millennia ago.\""
    a "\"De—de electione Druso oblata...quam Meera pro eo ante decem milia annorum fecit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:36
translate latin end_game2_8341bc92:

    # "Amicus frowns, knowing that the parents already know what he's talking about, becoming further distressed that they're making him vocalize things that are so obvious."
    "Amicus vultum contrahit, sciens Parentes iam scire de qua re loquatur; magis sollicitatur quod eum tam manifesta verba proferre cogunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:37
translate latin end_game2_aa12a452:

    # m "\"Oh, Amicus. Don't you know the proclivity of your own people to twist and distort, to aggrandize and romanticize the truth?\""
    m "\"O, Amice. Nonne nosti ingenium gentis tuae veritatem torquendi et depravandi, amplificandi atque amore ornandi?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:38
translate latin end_game2_561bfe3b:

    # "Amicus is quiet, waiting, heart still hammering, simply feeling numb at this point."
    "Amicus tacet et exspectat, corde adhuc pulsante, iam tantum torpens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:39
translate latin end_game2_d0dedb23:

    # m "\"Do not rely on wolven myth to inform you of parental intention. Only We will speak the truth to you.\""
    m "\"Noli fabulis Luporum niti ut consilia Parentum cognoscas. Tantum Nos verum tibi dicemus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:40
translate latin end_game2_34ceec70:

    # "Amicus lets out a little growl, anger overcoming fear again."
    "Amicus parvum fremitum edit, ira rursus metum superante."

# game/end_game2.rpy:41
translate latin end_game2_63312a87:

    # a "\"Then what is it? Why torment me like this?\""
    a "\"Quid igitur est? Cur sic me cruciatis?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:42
translate latin end_game2_8b4b8f0c:

    # "Several moments of silence pass and Amicus growls again, frustrated at the way he's being treated, how his emotions are being manipulated and sculpted like a mound of clay."
    "Aliquamdiu silentium est; Amicus rursus fremit, irritatus quomodo tractetur, quomodo affectus eius velut massa argillae moveantur atque fingantur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:43
translate latin end_game2_13f5d1ba:

    # "This isn't what he'd been taught at all."
    "Hoc minime id est quod doctus erat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:44
translate latin end_game2_5937582d:

    # "Had his father known the parents to be like this?"
    "Pater eius sciveratne Parentes tales esse?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:45
translate latin end_game2_ee14762e:

    # "His grandfather?"
    "Avus eius?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:46
translate latin end_game2_2629d638:

    # "Amicus wishes that he'd been warned, somehow."
    "Amicus cupit se aliquo modo monitum esse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:47
translate latin end_game2_1b04cf2f:

    # "As the silence drags on, the wolf tries to deaden his emotions, to not give these entities any sort of hint as to what he might be feeling, wanting to refuse this blatant attack on his own agency."
    "Dum silentium protrahitur, lupus affectus suos hebetare conatur, ne his animantibus ullum indicium det quid sentiat, hunc apertum impetum in libertatem suam recusare cupiens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:48
translate latin end_game2_9e280ab2:

    # "Despite how futile he knows that must be."
    "Quamquam scit id certe frustra fieri."

# game/end_game2.rpy:49
translate latin end_game2_6a1b2344:

    # m "\"You can bring back your lover. At this very moment time stands nearly still on your plane. [mc]'s body and mind are still salvageable.\""
    m "\"Amantem tuum revocare potes. Hoc ipso momento tempus in ordine tuo paene immobile est. Corpus atque mens [mc] adhuc servari possunt.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:50
translate latin end_game2_f332a517:

    # "Amicus's heart feels as though it might leap from his mouth, his hold on [mc] tightening."
    "Amico videtur cor suum ex ore paene saliturum esse, dum [mc] artius amplectitur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:51
translate latin end_game2_c4a19054:

    # a "\"How—\""
    a "\"Quomodo—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:52
translate latin end_game2_016a1b5c:

    # m "\"But only if you submit yourself to the benevolent will of the parents...\""
    m "\"Sed tantum si te benevolae voluntati Parentum submittis...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:53
translate latin end_game2_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:54
translate latin end_game2_8c4b036f:

    # m "\"Will you?\""
    m "\"Faciesne?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:55
translate latin end_game2_5225d3d2:

    # "Amicus furrows his brow in confusion, unsure of what this all could mean."
    "Amicus fronte contracta confunditur, incertus quid haec omnia significent."

# game/end_game2.rpy:56
translate latin end_game2_fd8888da:

    # a "\"But...I've already done so, ever since I was a pup we've been told to—\""
    a "\"Sed...iam feci; ex quo catulus eram nobis dictum est ut—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:57
translate latin end_game2_02d144ef:

    # m "\"After this experience your mind will waver. You're unsure as to what our intentions truly are. There will be moments in which you will want to question, to doubt our will...\""
    m "\"Post hanc experientiam mens tua fluctuabit. Incertus es quid consilia nostra vere sint. Momenta erunt quibus quaerere, de voluntate nostra dubitare voles...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:58
translate latin end_game2_6c89b81e:

    # m "\"You must overcome such moments. Our will is what is best for the {i}Galaxias{/i} and the universe as a whole.\""
    m "\"Talia momenta superare debes. Voluntas nostra est id quod {i}Galaxias{/i} atque universo toti optimum est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:59
translate latin end_game2_9c07d739:

    # "Amicus stares for a moment."
    "Amicus paulisper intuetur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:60
translate latin end_game2_b815baed:

    # a "\"And if I don't agree?\""
    a "\"Et si non consentio?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:61
translate latin end_game2_1d2d8418:

    # m "\"Then we shall let the human pass on as he naturally should, and we shall wait for a future emperor to take your place.\""
    m "\"Tum hominem transire sinemus, sicut natura debet, et futurum imperatorem qui locum tuum accipiat exspectabimus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:62
translate latin end_game2_5f8f905b:

    # "Amicus shakes his head, not wanting to believe this is true, that this is the way that the leaders of the {i}Galaxias{/i} function."
    "Amicus caput quatit, credere nolens hoc verum esse, hanc viam qua duces {i}Galaxias{/i} agant esse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:63
translate latin end_game2_1d9bfc12:

    # m "\"It must be done.\""
    m "\"Fieri debet.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:64
translate latin end_game2_27015f58:

    # "The wolf is quiet, for once wishing that he isn't in such a position, wishing that he could hide away in the quiet countryside with his human, to live a normal life..."
    "Lupus tacet, semel cupiens se in tali loco non esse, cupiens cum homine suo in quieta regione rustica latere posse, vitam communem vivere..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:65
translate latin end_game2_9b523202:

    # m "\"That is not your calling. It never was.\""
    m "\"Hoc munus tuum non est. Numquam fuit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:66
translate latin end_game2_f27c8d9c:

    # a "\"I know.\""
    a "\"Scio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:67
translate latin end_game2_5c77094a:

    # "Amicus whispers, more to himself than the parents."
    "Amicus susurrat, magis sibi quam Parentibus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:69
translate latin end_game2_3fd21820:

    # "There's a long moment of silence in which Amicus simply stares into space, contemplating what it means to give up any true freedom, to submit himself to the absolute authority of the galaxy."
    "Longum silentium est, in quo Amicus tantum in spatium spectat, deliberans quid significet omnem veram libertatem tradere, se absolutae galaxiae potestati submittere."

# game/end_game2.rpy:70
translate latin end_game2_92277ed2:

    # m "\"Will you submit?\""
    m "\"Te submittes?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:71
translate latin end_game2_ce194e6b:

    # "Amicus takes a deep breath."
    "Amicus alte spirat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:72
translate latin end_game2_ffa29b58:

    # a "\"Will...will my decision affect [mc]'s free will? You said you have plans for him as well.\""
    a "\"Num...num electio mea liberam voluntatem [mc] afficiet? Dixistis vos ei quoque consilia habere.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:73
translate latin end_game2_f5abd5c4:

    # m "\"He will be allowed to make his own decision. We will tell you of his mission once you make {i}your{/i} decision.\""
    m "\"Suam electionem facere licebit ei. De munere eius tibi narrabimus ubi {i}tuam{/i} electionem feceris.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:74
translate latin end_game2_e5353eb2:

    # "Amicus stifles another growl, hating that his human is being forced into this as well."
    "Amicus alium fremitum comprimit et odit quod hominem suum quoque in haec cogunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:75
translate latin end_game2_92277ed2_1:

    # m "\"Will you submit?\""
    m "\"Te submittes?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:76
translate latin end_game2_0f59256a:

    # "Amicus closes his eyes, feeling his anger and resilience slowly drain away."
    "Amicus oculos claudit, iram et constantiam suam lente evanescere sentiens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:77
translate latin end_game2_a3246673:

    # "Then he opens them."
    "Tum eos aperit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:78
translate latin end_game2_b580cbaa:

    # a "\"I submit.\""
    a "\"Me submitto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:82
translate latin end_game2_d86a984c:

    # "Blue light swirls in front of my eyes in intricate, spiraling tendrils."
    "Lux caerulea ante oculos meos in implicatis cirris spiralibus volvitur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:83
translate latin end_game2_149b8d27:

    # "It's beautiful, and as I begin to focus, I see a blurry, gray shape in the middle of it all."
    "Pulchra est; dum clare videre incipio, confusam griseamque formam in medio omnium video."

# game/end_game2.rpy:84
translate latin end_game2_21acfdb7:

    # "Even before I'm fully able to see him, I know it's my wolf."
    "Etiam antequam eum penitus videre possum, scio lupum meum esse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:85
translate latin end_game2_2842c249:

    # "I smile and reach up, cupping at the warm, furry form."
    "Subrideo et manus tollo, calidam pilosamque formam tenens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:86
translate latin end_game2_9142b0c2:

    # "At some point along this little journey, I've stopped caring about whether the things I see are real or not."
    "Aliquando in hoc parvo itinere desii curare utrum res quas video verae sint necne."

# game/end_game2.rpy:87
translate latin end_game2_20ca0388:

    # "I'm just happy that I'm seeing him."
    "Tantum gaudeo me eum videre."

# game/end_game2.rpy:88
translate latin end_game2_29d00675:

    # "He smiles down at me."
    "Deorsum mihi subridet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:91
translate latin end_game2_4b87ac29:

    # a "\"Hey.\""
    a "\"Heus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:92
translate latin end_game2_568a6418:

    # m "\"...Hey.\""
    m "\"...Salve.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:93
translate latin end_game2_03866667:

    # "I lie quietly in his arms for a while, just enjoying the comforting, blue glow."
    "Aliquamdiu tacitus in bracchiis eius iaceo, tantum suavi caeruleoque lumine fruens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:94
translate latin end_game2_af0313a4:

    # "I'm reminded of when I first met Amicus, when our ship stalled out in the blue dust cloud, when he'd finally revealed to me his botched plan."
    "Admoneor cum primum Amicum conveni, cum navis nostra in caerulea pulveris nube constitit, cum tandem male paratum consilium suum mihi patefecit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:95
translate latin end_game2_718880a5:

    # "That feels so distant now, like it was years ago, rather than just months."
    "Id nunc tam remotum videtur, quasi ante annos, non tantum menses, fuerit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:96
translate latin end_game2_2acfa737:

    # "I take a deep breath, and something about it feels strange, almost like something mechanical is moving in my neck."
    "Alte spiro, et aliquid mirum sentitur, quasi quid mechanicum in cervice mea moveatur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:97
translate latin end_game2_f5ca74ae:

    # "I reach up, touching my fingers to my throat, and for a moment they brush against something that feels like a thin line of flesh."
    "Manum tollo, digitos gutturi admovens; paulisper rem tangunt quae quasi tenuis linea carnis sentitur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:98
translate latin end_game2_f296fa8a:

    # "But Amicus reaches down to move my hand away, pressing it to my chest instead."
    "Sed Amicus manum demittit ut meam removeat eamque potius pectori meo premit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:99
translate latin end_game2_a9ff0949:

    # a "\"You're alright. You're gonna be fine now.\""
    a "\"Vales. Nunc bene valebis.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:100
translate latin end_game2_cc5a0746:

    # m "\"What...\""
    m "\"Quid...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:101
translate latin end_game2_7607027c:

    # "That's when I also realize that my voice sounds strange."
    "Tum etiam intellego vocem meam miram sonare."

# game/end_game2.rpy:102
translate latin end_game2_d712c9e5:

    # "It still sounds like me, but there's something slightly off about it, like it's a little higher, maybe even just a little robotic."
    "Adhuc similis mihi sonat, sed aliquid paulum alienum est, quasi paulo acutior sit, fortasse etiam paulum automatica."

# game/end_game2.rpy:103
translate latin end_game2_e499761a:

    # "I frown."
    "Frontem contraho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:104
translate latin end_game2_1a78d38c:

    # "Amicus presses against my chest firmly, comfortingly."
    "Amicus pectus meum firmiter premit, me consolans."

# game/end_game2.rpy:106
translate latin end_game2_1983067b:

    # a "\"It's okay, I know it might feel a bit strange, but you won't even notice it after a few days.\""
    a "\"Bene est; scio fortasse paulum mirum sentiri, sed post paucos dies ne animadvertes quidem.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:107
translate latin end_game2_f1e1cb15:

    # "What is he talking about?"
    "De qua re loquitur?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:108
translate latin end_game2_ddf54f3a:

    # "Again, I lay quietly in his arms as I gather my thoughts."
    "Rursus tacitus in bracchiis eius iaceo, dum cogitationes colligo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:109
translate latin end_game2_a7a17747:

    # "The fight, the dagger, the darkness, the parents, then..."
    "Pugna, pugio, tenebrae, Parentes, tum..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:110
translate latin end_game2_3a90705a:

    # "I look up at Amicus in question."
    "Ad Amicum interrogans suspicio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:111
translate latin end_game2_6a322264:

    # m "\"What...what happened?\""
    m "\"Quid...quid accidit?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:112
translate latin end_game2_9629233f:

    # "I try to ignore the strange, soundless, mechanical clicking feeling in my throat, while also trying to get used to my voice."
    "Mirum sensum taciti crepitus mechanici in gutture neglegere conor, simul voci meae adsuescere conatus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:113
translate latin end_game2_1cf02a06:

    # "It's like hearing myself in a recording; just not quite right."
    "Quasi me ipsum in sono servato audio: parum rectum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:115
translate latin end_game2_f4566769:

    # "Amicus chuckles, sounding exhausted, relieved, and maybe even a little sad at the same time."
    "Amicus leniter ridet, defatigatus, levatus atque fortasse paulum tristis simul sonans."

# game/end_game2.rpy:117
translate latin end_game2_77478e3c:

    # a "\"Quite a bit happened, [mc].\""
    a "\"Satis multa acciderunt, [mc].\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:118
translate latin end_game2_22894267:

    # m "\"But the parents. I thought they wanted us to meet them?\""
    m "\"Sed Parentes. Putabam eos velle nos se convenire?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:119
translate latin end_game2_8281fee3:

    # "Amicus's gentle smile wavers for a moment."
    "Lenis arrisus Amici paulisper vacillat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:121
translate latin end_game2_25b74959:

    # a "\"Well...they did. I met them.\""
    a "\"Bene...volebant. Eos conveni.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:122
translate latin end_game2_dec0fd59:

    # m "\"What? I don't remember...\""
    m "\"Quid? Non memini...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:123
translate latin end_game2_82e82f92:

    # "I rack my memory, but nothing comes to mind."
    "Memoriam meam scrutor, sed nihil in mentem venit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:124
translate latin end_game2_a38ca5d4:

    # a "\"You, uh, you lost consciousness when it happened.\""
    a "\"Tu, eh, sensum amisisti cum accidit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:125
translate latin end_game2_c848da58:

    # "I frown at that, wondering why that would happen, but Amicus doesn't offer an explanation."
    "Vultum contraho, miratus cur id fiat, sed Amicus explicationem non dat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:126
translate latin end_game2_9ec8853f:

    # "I look down at my chest, and instead of the coating of blood I expect to see, I'm clean and bare, aside from a few, small wet spots on my chest."
    "Pectus meum deorsum inspicio; pro sanguinis strato quod videre exspecto, mundus ac nudus sum, praeter paucas parvas umidasque maculas in pectore."

# game/end_game2.rpy:127
translate latin end_game2_c5cf3b2b:

    # "I suppose Amicus had been a bit more emotional before I'd woken up."
    "Credo Amicum paulo vehementius affectum esse antequam experrectus sum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:128
translate latin end_game2_52e9ad1f:

    # "I look back at him, then press my face against his body, and he responds by hugging me close to his chest for a moment."
    "Ad eum respicio, deinde faciem corpori eius premo; ille paulisper me pectori suo artissime amplectitur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:130
translate latin end_game2_5e7c3f80:

    # m "\"So it's over? They decided to bring me back?\""
    m "\"Ergo finitum est? Me revocare statuerunt?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:131
translate latin end_game2_56b22d0a:

    # "My voice is muffled against his fur."
    "Vox mea in pilis eius obtusa est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:132
translate latin end_game2_1056e810:

    # "My strange, not-quite-right voice."
    "Mira vox mea, parum recta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:133
translate latin end_game2_0e4c4746:

    # "Amicus loosens his hold on me, allowing me to look back up at his face."
    "Amicus amplexum solvit, sinens me rursus ad faciem eius suspicere."

# game/end_game2.rpy:135
translate latin end_game2_3a8de6fd:

    # a "\"Yes. It's over.\""
    a "\"Ita. Finitum est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:136
translate latin end_game2_5f711d93:

    # "The tension that I'd held in my chest ever since I arrived, ever since being abducted from my bedroom in Italy, it all releases slowly."
    "Sollicitudo quam in pectore tenueram ex quo veni, ex quo e cubiculo meo in Italia raptus sum, omnis lente solvitur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:137
translate latin end_game2_6370b32e:

    # "For once, I feel light and free, and I sag in the wolf's arms, sighing deeply."
    "Semel levis liberque sum; in bracchiis lupi languesco, alte suspirans."

# game/end_game2.rpy:138
translate latin end_game2_38f7a6c4:

    # "Even now, I'm starting to get used to the new feelings in my throat."
    "Iam nunc novis sensibus in gutture adsuescere incipio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:140
translate latin end_game2_891ef0b0:

    # a "\"I love you.\""
    a "\"Te amo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:141
translate latin end_game2_58124b9d:

    # m "\"I love you, too.\""
    m "\"Ego quoque te amo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:142
translate latin end_game2_13eb866a:

    # "I smile up at him, and despite everything being over, I can't help but notice that he seems a bit sad, too."
    "Ei sursum subrideo; quamquam omnia finita sunt, animadverto eum paulum tristem quoque videri."

# game/end_game2.rpy:143
translate latin end_game2_f7872598:

    # "I rest a hand against his chest."
    "Manum pectori eius impono."

# game/end_game2.rpy:144
translate latin end_game2_702cfbe4:

    # m "\"You alright?\""
    m "\"Valesne?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:146
translate latin end_game2_459ce3ce:

    # "Amicus laughs loudly, shaking my entire body."
    "Amicus clare ridet, totum corpus meum quatiens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:147
translate latin end_game2_61356971:

    # a "\"Aside from nearly losing everything I hold dear, I suppose I'm alright, yes.\""
    a "\"Praeterquam quod paene omnia quae cara habeo amisi, credo me bene valere, ita.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:148
translate latin end_game2_d8fe3f13:

    # "I try to sit up, but Amicus keeps me reclined gently, but firmly."
    "Sedere conor, sed Amicus me leniter tamen firme reclinatum tenet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:149
translate latin end_game2_b466649c:

    # m "\"You sure? You seem upset.\""
    m "\"Certus es? Perturbatus videris.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:150
translate latin end_game2_01ee7781:

    # "The big wolf sighs deeply, and I feel his torso puff out against my side and shoulder."
    "Magnus lupus alte suspirat; corpus eius contra latus umerumque meum inflari sentio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:152
translate latin end_game2_929f0d2f:

    # a "\"There are...things I must tell you, but later. It's not important right now.\""
    a "\"Sunt...res quas tibi dicere debeo, sed postea. Nunc non grave est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:153
translate latin end_game2_bd610d62:

    # "That tension that had been so mercifully loosened in my chest suddenly appears again, albeit in a much smaller way."
    "Illa sollicitudo quae tam clementer in pectore meo soluta erat subito redit, quamquam multo minor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:154
translate latin end_game2_f617c002:

    # "I want to ask more, but for now I just want to rest."
    "Plura quaerere volo, sed nunc tantum requiescere volo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:155
translate latin end_game2_fc8f316e:

    # m "\"Well...as long as I'm not gonna pass out and wake up completely confused again. I feel like that's all I've been doing the past month.\""
    m "\"Bene...dum non rursus sensum amittam et penitus confusus expergiscar. Sentio me tantum id superiore mense fecisse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:156
translate latin end_game2_ff03efe4:

    # "Amicus huffs in amusement."
    "Amicus delectatus anhelat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:158
translate latin end_game2_a553d900:

    # a "\"Yes, you do have a knack for such things.\""
    a "\"Ita, talium rerum ingenium habes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:159
translate latin end_game2_fb26df1a:

    # "We go quiet again, and it's a nice kind of quiet."
    "Rursus tacemus, et gratum silentium est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:160
translate latin end_game2_30fee3c2:

    # "We're both just basking in the peaceful aftermath of our months-long struggle."
    "Ambo tantum tranquillo fine certaminis nostri per menses gesti fruimur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:161
translate latin end_game2_989320a7:

    # "After a while though, my wolf meets my eyes again."
    "Sed aliquanto post lupus meus rursus in oculos meos spectat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:163
translate latin end_game2_804cd142:

    # a "\"[mc]?\""
    a "\"[mc]?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:164
translate latin end_game2_9e2f24e6:

    # m "\"Yes, Amicus?\""
    m "\"Quid, Amice?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:165
translate latin end_game2_89304c5a:

    # a "\"I'm sorry.\""
    a "\"Doleo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:166
translate latin end_game2_6bc83ed5:

    # m "\"Sorry?\""
    m "\"Veniam?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:167
translate latin end_game2_862faa9a:

    # a "\"For everything, for taking you from your planet, for involving you in Adastran politics, for acting as if I knew better. Even if it was part of the parents' plan, it doesn't make it right...and I'm sorry.\""
    a "\"De omnibus, quod te e planeta tuo abstuli, quod te in res politicas Adastrae implicavi, quod quasi melius scirem egi. Etiamsi pars consilii Parentum erat, id rectum non facit...et veniam peto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:168
translate latin end_game2_15f3bc9d:

    # m "\"Plan?\""
    m "\"Consilium?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:171
translate latin end_game2_f7d47520:

    # "Amicus lets out a small, tired laugh, shaking his head."
    "Amicus parvum defatigatumque risum edit, caput quatiens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:172
translate latin end_game2_633780a5:

    # a "\"Again, I'll tell you later. Let's just be together for now.\""
    a "\"Rursus, postea tibi dicam. Nunc tantum una simus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:173
translate latin end_game2_e6ac4855:

    # "I nod in agreement, ignoring the clicks in my neck, clinging to my wolf, happy to be in this quiet little corner of the universe, undisturbed by politics, mad emperors, or monolithic space entities."
    "Consentiens annuo, crepitus in cervice neglegens, lupo meo adhaerens, laetus in hoc parvo quietoque angulo universi esse, rebus politicis, insanis imperatoribus aut immensis siderum animantibus non turbatus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:177
translate latin end_game2_5b142e94:

    # "The following days are...strange, to say the least."
    "Dies qui sequuntur...miri sunt, ut leniter dicam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:178
translate latin end_game2_5558e129:

    # "After what happened in the amphitheater, the wolven population has seemingly taken great interest in me."
    "Post ea quae in amphitheatro acciderunt, populus Luporum, ut videtur, valde mihi animum adhibet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:179
translate latin end_game2_da160f73:

    # "I guess I'm sort of a celebrity at this point."
    "Credo me iam quodam modo celebrem esse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:180
translate latin end_game2_052c3cdc:

    # "I got my first taste of this while lounging in the dining room, only half-paying attention to the screens when I realize that it's a reenactment of the Trial by Combat between Amicus and Cato."
    "Primum hoc expertus sum dum in triclinio otiosus iacebam, imaginibus tantum dimidium animum adhibens, cum intellego Certamen Pugnae inter Amicum atque Catonem rursus agi."

# game/end_game2.rpy:181
translate latin end_game2_23b55aff:

    # "My character, portrayed by a small wolf wearing a rather uncanny human mask, jumps in at the last second to plunge the dagger into Cato's back."
    "Persona mea, a parvo lupo satis miram personam humanam gerente acta, ultimo momento insilit ut pugionem in tergum Catonis demergat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:182
translate latin end_game2_32adedf0:

    # "He's then stabbed directly in the throat by Cato (instead of slashed) and stands for several seconds, clutching his neck while \"Amicus\" tears out Cato's throat, then arrives just in time to catch \"me\" as he swoons back."
    "Tum Cato recta guttur eius pugione transfigit, pro eo quod secet; per aliquot secunda stat, cervicem tenens, dum \"Amicus\" guttur Catonis evellit, deinde tempore advenit ut \"me\" retro deficientem excipiat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:183
translate latin end_game2_07c0610a:

    # "I have to stop watching at this point, the memories of what happened too fresh and traumatizing for me to see played out, even if it's terribly acted out."
    "Tum spectare desinere debeo; memoriae rei gestae nimis recentes atque atroces sunt ut eam agi videam, etiamsi pessime agitur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:184
translate latin end_game2_76e8ae8b:

    # "While I suppose it's nice to be liked by the general population, I can't help but feel it's for the wrong reasons."
    "Quamquam credo gratum esse me populo placere, sentio id ob falsas causas fieri."

# game/end_game2.rpy:185
translate latin end_game2_0d6c0aa9:

    # "I'm definitely being portrayed as a noble savage of sorts; so in love with my \"master\" that I broke the rules to save him...or I just didn't understand the rules well enough to abide by them."
    "Certe velut quidam barbarus nobilis ostendor: \"dominum\" tam amans ut leges fregerim ad eum servandum...aut leges tam parum intellexi ut eis parere non possem."

# game/end_game2.rpy:186
translate latin end_game2_78d3caba:

    # "Either way, it makes me feel kind of uncomfortable."
    "Utroque modo aliquantum me vexat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:187
translate latin end_game2_4097fcdc:

    # "Meanwhile, Amicus is kept busy, of course."
    "Interea Amicus scilicet occupatus tenetur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:188
translate latin end_game2_0ab29e31:

    # "The quiet moment I'd had with him in the archives is actually the last really long moment alone I've had with him since."
    "Quietum illud tempus quod cum eo in archivis habui revera ultimum fuit quo diu soli fuimus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:189
translate latin end_game2_4580f3ad:

    # "Almost immediately after, Amicus is whisked away to various ceremonies and meetings as everything becomes official."
    "Fere statim postea Amicus ad varias caerimonias conventusque abductus est, dum omnia legitima fiunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:190
translate latin end_game2_c0bc43bb:

    # "Amicus is the emperor now, and he seems to be taking to it rather well, especially after the incredibly stressful events preceding it."
    "Amicus iam imperator est; satis bene huic rei adsuescere videtur, maxime post res incredibiliter sollicitas quae praecesserunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:191
translate latin end_game2_7b3d39fe:

    # "His personality has always been silly, and a bit immature, but after taking the throne, he's taken on a persona of a cool, calm, leader."
    "Ingenium eius semper stultum et paulum immaturum fuit; sed post thronum acceptum personam quieti tranquillique ducis induit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:192
translate latin end_game2_71cecf8d:

    # "It's a side of him that I've seen occasional flashes of, and while I'm happy to see him fitting the role so well, I can't help but feel a bit sad that he has to quash that playful, outgoing side of himself."
    "Pars eius est quam interdum breviter vidi; quamquam gaudeo eum muneri tam bene convenire, aliquantum tristis sum quod ludicram atque apertam partem sui reprimere debeat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:193
translate latin end_game2_eaca2af0:

    # "I suppose it's one of those parts of having to grow up."
    "Credo unam ex rebus esse quae ad crescendum pertinent."

# game/end_game2.rpy:195
translate latin end_game2_2e5b2e26:

    # "I try to stay out of his way for now, knowing he has so much to do, but on the second day after the trial, I'm told by Com that Amicus wants to speak with me."
    "Nunc a rebus eius abstinere conor, sciens eum tam multa facere debere; sed secundo die post certamen Computatrum mihi dicit Amicum mecum loqui velle."

# game/end_game2.rpy:199
translate latin end_game2_140cf5d8:

    # "I open the door and immediately hear Virginia's voice, raised slightly in annoyance."
    "Ianuam aperio et statim vocem Virginiae audio, taedio paulum sublatam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:201
translate latin end_game2_c98e81d4:

    # v "\"No! Lux is the city in desperate need of funds right now. {i}Lex{/i} is doing very well.\""
    v "\"Non! Lux est urbs quae nunc pecunia maxime indiget. {i}Lex{/i} optime se habet.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:203
translate latin end_game2_684e8187:

    # a "\"Well, I'm sorry, but the names are rather similar, are they not? I meant Lux anyway.\""
    a "\"Bene, ignosce, sed nomina satis similia sunt, nonne? Lux tamen significabam.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:205
translate latin end_game2_300ab33e:

    # v "\"Even if you meant it that way, I can guarantee you the triumvirates won't be pleased hearing you mistakenly refer to which city they are from!\""
    v "\"Etiamsi ita significabas, tibi polliceor triumviros non delectatum iri cum te audient urbem ex qua sunt per errorem falso nomine appellare!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:207
translate latin end_game2_8fc0d3a9:

    # a "\"Alright, alright! Calm down. I'll be sure to remember that...and don't yell at me in front of the triumvirates, please. You'll only give my critics more weaponry if I'm seen allowing my own sister to treat me in such a way.\""
    a "\"Bene, bene! Quiesce. Certe id meminero...et noli ad me coram triumviris clamare, quaeso. Tantum obtrectatoribus meis plura arma dabis si videor sororem meam sinere me ita tractare.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:209
translate latin end_game2_fcd6d352:

    # v "\"All the more reason not to make mistakes then.\""
    v "\"Eo magis causa est cur non erres.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:213
translate latin end_game2_1750e977:

    # "The two seem to realize that I'm there finally, and cease their argument."
    "Tandem ambo intellegere videntur me adesse et rixam finiunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:214
translate latin end_game2_5302c0b8:

    # a "\"[mc]! We were just finishing our conversation.\""
    a "\"[mc]! Sermonem nostrum modo finiebamus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:216
translate latin end_game2_ce912c72:

    # v "\"Were we? I'm going to drill you on all of this again on our flight to the city.\""
    v "\"Itane? Rursus te de his omnibus exercebo dum ad urbem volamus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:217
translate latin end_game2_7c63dec8:

    # "Virginia makes her way past me, pausing to rest a paw on my shoulder."
    "Virginia praeter me procedit, paulisper manum umero meo imponens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:219
translate latin end_game2_6f2225cb:

    # v "\"Maybe I should put you in charge of my brother's studies. At least he listens to you.\""
    v "\"Fortasse te studiis fratris mei praeficere debeam. Saltem te audit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:221
translate latin end_game2_4acccd60:

    # "The she-wolf rolls her eyes before disappearing through the door, leaving us in silence so that Amicus's big, heavy sigh seems to resonate through the entire room."
    "Lupa oculos volvit antequam per ianuam evanescit; tacitos nos relinquit, ut magnus gravisque suspiratus Amici per totum cubiculum resonare videatur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:224
translate latin end_game2_195ce336:

    # a "\"Gods, she's relentless.\""
    a "\"Di, immitis est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:225
translate latin end_game2_7baa46b0:

    # m "\"Isn't that a good thing?\""
    m "\"Nonne id bonum est?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:227
translate latin end_game2_03f4f62a:

    # a "\"I suppose, but it doesn't make it any easier to deal with.\""
    a "\"Credo, sed ideo facilius tolerari non potest.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:228
translate latin end_game2_60a11631:

    # "Amicus is walking towards me and immediately takes me up into a deep hug, followed by a kiss."
    "Amicus ad me ambulat et statim me artissime amplectitur, deinde osculatur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:229
translate latin end_game2_68e88f56:

    # "I kiss back, feeling Amicus's tense body relax against mine, and I feel happy at the idea that I might be able to relieve his stress so easily."
    "Vicissim osculor, corpus Amici intentum contra meum relaxari sentiens; gaudeo cogitatione me sollicitudinem eius tam facile levare posse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:230
translate latin end_game2_889a5bc2:

    # "He finally draws back, smiling as he does."
    "Tandem se retrahit, subridens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:232
translate latin end_game2_cc2b86c4:

    # a "\"How have you been? I know I've been rather absent lately, but—\""
    a "\"Quomodo te habuisti? Scio me nuper satis abfuisse, sed—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:233
translate latin end_game2_c4c4146f:

    # m "\"I know, official business and everything. I've been okay. Just trying to adjust to the all the new.\""
    m "\"Scio, negotium publicum et omnia. Bene me habui. Tantum omnibus novis adsuescere conor.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:234
translate latin end_game2_54dc3ddd:

    # "I sweep a hand around me, then hesitantly bring it to my neck, the wound that the parents had somehow healed, my trachea and vocal cords having been replaced and repaired with...something."
    "Manum circum me duco, deinde dubitanter cervici admoveo, vulneri quod Parentes quodam modo sanaverunt, trachea chordisque vocalibus...aliqua re substitutis atque reparatis."

# game/end_game2.rpy:235
translate latin end_game2_f1ed5b06:

    # "I try not to think about it, and I've gotten used to it for the most part."
    "De ea re non cogitare conor, et ei plerumque adsuevi."

# game/end_game2.rpy:237
translate latin end_game2_208a9f72:

    # a "\"Well, I hope you've been adjusting smoothly, then.\""
    a "\"Bene, spero igitur te facile adsuevisse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:238
translate latin end_game2_ab0c9975:

    # "Amicus brushes a paw through my hair, looking me over."
    "Amicus manum per capillos meos ducit, me inspiciens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:239
translate latin end_game2_0854bb69:

    # m "\"What was it you wanted to talk about?\""
    m "\"De qua re loqui volebas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:241
translate latin end_game2_69296fb0:

    # "Amicus pulls his paw back, and the look on his face starts to worry me."
    "Amicus manum retrahit, et vultus eius me sollicitare incipit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:242
translate latin end_game2_625b4e4e:

    # m "\"Is it about what happened with the parents?\""
    m "\"De ea re quae cum Parentibus accidit?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:243
translate latin end_game2_9f5a71ab:

    # "At this point in time, I know that something involving me happened while I'd been unconscious."
    "Iam scio aliquid ad me pertinens accidisse dum inscius eram."

# game/end_game2.rpy:244
translate latin end_game2_20547be1:

    # "For whatever reason, I'd been kept unaware of the conversation that happened between Amicus and the parents."
    "Nescio cur, de sermone inter Amicum atque Parentes facto certior factus non sum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:245
translate latin end_game2_7dc5874e:

    # "Amicus nods, rubbing an arm awkwardly."
    "Amicus annuit, bracchium inepte fricans."

# game/end_game2.rpy:246
translate latin end_game2_8aa00ae3:

    # a "\"Er, yes. It's rather complicated, so it may take a moment for me to explain it all.\""
    a "\"Eh, ita. Satis implicatum est, itaque fortasse paulum temporis opus erit ut omnia explicem.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:249
translate latin end_game2_cb7f4c3e:

    # "The wolf guides me to the sofa, and we sit side-by-side as Amicus drapes an arm around my shoulder."
    "Lupus me ad lectulum ducit; iuxta alterum alter sedemus, dum Amicus bracchium umero meo imponit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:250
translate latin end_game2_a1c2b5fe:

    # "Over the next few minutes, he tells me of the deal he made with the parents, that he'd submit himself to their will, if only to bring me back to life."
    "Per pauca minuta quae sequuntur mihi narrat pactum cum Parentibus factum: se voluntati eorum submittere, vel tantum ut me ad vitam revocet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:251
translate latin end_game2_e49a1b1a:

    # "It's a similar decision that I had to make, and I shake my head."
    "Similis est electio quam facere debui, et caput quatio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:253
translate latin end_game2_623eee90:

    # m "\"I don't like that. Why are they doing this to us?\""
    m "\"Id mihi displicet. Cur hoc nobis faciunt?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:254
translate latin end_game2_bbfe0ab5:

    # "Amicus shrugs loosely against me, shaking his head as well."
    "Amicus leniter contra me umeros tollit, caput quoque quatiens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:256
translate latin end_game2_2c75f809:

    # a "\"I honestly don't know, but I can tell you that my view of them has changed quite a bit since what happened.\""
    a "\"Vere nescio, sed tibi dicere possum sententiam meam de eis satis mutatam esse post ea quae acciderunt.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:257
translate latin end_game2_adb7a868:

    # m "\"So what, now you have to do whatever they say or...something bad happens to me?\""
    m "\"Ergo quid, nunc quidquid dicant facere debes, aut...aliquid mali mihi accidit?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:258
translate latin end_game2_508ac204:

    # "Again, my hand drifts up to my neck, wondering if there's something more to the mechanics in my throat."
    "Rursus manus mea ad cervicem ascendit, miratus num plus in machinatione gutturis mei sit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:259
translate latin end_game2_685b0624:

    # "An irrational part of my mind wonders if maybe there's some type of self-destruct mechanism built into it."
    "Pars irrationalis mentis meae miratur num aliquod instrumentum se ipsum destruendi in eo insit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:260
translate latin end_game2_94c4a329:

    # "I shudder at the thought of my throat suddenly exploding."
    "Horrore tremo, animo fingens guttur meum subito displodi."

# game/end_game2.rpy:261
translate latin end_game2_b0954df3:

    # a "\"I...doubt that, but I feel that maybe they would make it difficult for us to stay together if I did. Our meeting together...it was planned by the parents.\""
    a "\"Id...dubito; sed sentio fortasse eos nobis difficilius una manere facturos si eis non obtemperarem. Conventus noster...a Parentibus paratus erat.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:262
translate latin end_game2_6dcf1164:

    # "This was something I'd sort of assumed on my own, but I still bristle nonetheless."
    "Hoc iam ipse quodam modo putaveram, sed tamen horresco."

# game/end_game2.rpy:263
translate latin end_game2_c3316598:

    # m "\"See? They're using our love against us. This is...this is just fucked up.\""
    m "\"Vides? Amore nostro contra nos utuntur. Hoc...hoc tantum horrendum est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:264
translate latin end_game2_087bbabf:

    # "Amicus just nods quietly, but draws me closer with his arm around my shoulders."
    "Amicus tantum tacitus annuit, sed bracchio circa umeros me propius trahit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:265
translate latin end_game2_fb0ec738:

    # m "\"So they just...draw us together. I was like, the most compatible human to you so now they can make sure we do as we're told so we can stay together?\""
    m "\"Ergo tantum...nos coniungunt. Ego quasi homo maxime tibi conveniens eram; nunc curare possunt ut quod iubemur faciamus, quo una manere possimus?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:266
translate latin end_game2_ffa26087:

    # "Again, Amicus is quiet, just holding me."
    "Rursus Amicus tacet, tantum me tenens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:267
translate latin end_game2_fdf3931c:

    # m "\"I don't like this.\""
    m "\"Hoc mihi displicet.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:268
translate latin end_game2_df975ad7:

    # a "\"Neither do I.\""
    a "\"Mihi quoque.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:269
translate latin end_game2_dcb0476f:

    # m "\"So if your job is to bring the {i}Galaxias{/i} together...what's my job?\""
    m "\"Ergo, si munus tuum est {i}Galaxias{/i} coniungere...quid munus meum est?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:271
translate latin end_game2_0ca3b69b:

    # "Amicus takes another slow, deep breath, which only spikes my anxiety."
    "Amicus rursus lente alteque spirat, quod tantum sollicitudinem meam auget."

# game/end_game2.rpy:272
translate latin end_game2_c8f0254b:

    # "I realize that the release I felt in the archive room was only temporary."
    "Intellego levamen quod in archivorum cubiculo sensi tantum temporarium fuisse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:273
translate latin end_game2_63032193:

    # "In retrospect, I suppose it was a bit silly that I thought everything would be fine after Amicus became emperor."
    "Respiciens, credo me paulum stultum fuisse cum putavi omnia bene futura postquam Amicus imperator fieret."

# game/end_game2.rpy:274
translate latin end_game2_3b442f9e:

    # "This is only the beginning."
    "Hoc tantum initium est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:275
translate latin end_game2_255dcea5:

    # a "\"Well, this is what I wanted to talk to you about.\""
    a "\"Bene, de hac re tecum loqui volebam.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:276
translate latin end_game2_06599db0:

    # "I wait, feeling Amicus steel himself for what he's about to say, and I feel my anxiety grow."
    "Exspecto, Amicum se ad ea quae dicet firmare sentiens, et sollicitudinem meam crescere sentio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:277
translate latin end_game2_12395018:

    # "How bad could this actually be?"
    "Quam grave hoc vere esse possit?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:278
translate latin end_game2_5668dd01:

    # "Then, he lets out the breath with a rush of words, seemingly trying to get the explanation out all at once."
    "Tum spiritum cum impetu verborum emittit, quasi totam explicationem simul proferre conetur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:279
translate latin end_game2_032f46e1:

    # a "\"The parents told me that your mission is to begin the process of integrating humans into the {i}Galaxias{/i}.\""
    a "\"Parentes mihi dixerunt munus tuum esse rationem hominum in {i}Galaxias{/i} inserendorum incipere.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:280
translate latin end_game2_9b699855:

    # "I'm only starting to absorb that when Amicus takes another breath and starts another slew of words."
    "Id tantum percipere incipio cum Amicus rursus spirat et alium impetum verborum incipit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:281
translate latin end_game2_78cddaf2:

    # a "\"They want you to return to Earth and complete a series of steps to begin the integration process, a process that will take...\""
    a "\"Volunt te ad Terram redire et seriem graduum perficere ut rationem inserendi incipias, rationem quae...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:283
translate latin end_game2_baf58a2f:

    # "Amicus suddenly winces, as though the words themselves hurt."
    "Amicus subito horrescit, quasi verba ipsa doleant."

# game/end_game2.rpy:284
translate latin end_game2_6b27817c:

    # a "\"...that will take around eight years to complete.\""
    a "\"...quae octo fere annos ad perficiendum requiret.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:285
translate latin end_game2_a239cbde:

    # "That last bit takes the longest for me to comprehend."
    "Illud ultimum omnium tardissime intellego."

# game/end_game2.rpy:286
translate latin end_game2_0a09e71f:

    # "Eight years?"
    "Octo annos?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:287
translate latin end_game2_dd72dbf2:

    # m "\"Eight years? Like, I'll have to go to Earth for eight years and...do a bunch of crap to bring my planet into the {i}Galaxias{/i}?\""
    m "\"Octo annos? Quasi ad Terram per octo annos ire debeam et...multas nugas agere ut planetam meum in {i}Galaxias{/i} inseram?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:288
translate latin end_game2_4f30f690:

    # "Amicus nods, and I see the deep sadness on his face."
    "Amicus annuit, et gravem tristitiam in vultu eius video."

# game/end_game2.rpy:289
translate latin end_game2_141bd4b4:

    # "This explains why he wasn't exactly happy after we'd escaped the parental dimension."
    "Hoc explicat cur non omnino laetus esset postquam e dimensione Parentum effugimus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:290
translate latin end_game2_e2f10517:

    # "I find myself at a loss for words, even though there's so much I want to ask."
    "Verba invenire non possum, quamquam tam multa rogare volo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:291
translate latin end_game2_cf35e122:

    # "Amicus tries to fill the silence:"
    "Amicus silentium implere conatur:"

# game/end_game2.rpy:293
translate latin end_game2_71db4670:

    # a "\"Your planet won't be...conquered, or anything. Rather you're already on a sibling-like level. You're unique in that you aren't exactly a sibling species, but you won't be under the control of another civilization, if that makes sense.\""
    a "\"Planeta tuus non...expugnabitur, vel quid tale. Iam potius ad gradum Fratrum similem pervenistis. Singulares estis quia non exacte species Fraterna estis, sed alteri civilizationi non suberitis, si hoc intellegitur.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:295
translate latin end_game2_0f929c9f:

    # a "\"Aside from the parents, of course.\""
    a "\"Praeter Parentes scilicet.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:296
translate latin end_game2_48b2b80d:

    # "That's a relief, I suppose."
    "Id levamen est, credo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:297
translate latin end_game2_f138af9d:

    # "Though the more I learn about the parents, the more I'm unsure about any of this."
    "Sed quo plura de Parentibus disco, eo minus certus de his omnibus sum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:298
translate latin end_game2_a84f6935:

    # "While I'd once worried about the wolves invading Earth, I'm not sure I'd want the parents to be doing the same."
    "Cum olim timerem ne Lupi Terram invaderent, non certus sum me velle Parentes idem facere."

# game/end_game2.rpy:299
translate latin end_game2_b9e1adf3:

    # "The way we're being...{i}used{/i} like this, like we're just a pair of tools."
    "Modus quo ita...{i}usurpamur{/i}, quasi tantum duo instrumenta simus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:300
translate latin end_game2_2e2b5c5d:

    # "It makes my skin crawl."
    "Cutem meam horrere facit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:301
translate latin end_game2_76d07600:

    # m "\"And the eight years? Will I just...will I be able to see you?\""
    m "\"Et octo anni? Tantum...te videre potero?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:303
translate latin end_game2_7d4ff00a:

    # "I see the corners of Amicus's muzzle dip down deeply into a frown before stubbornly pulling back up, the way they often did when he was trying not to tear up."
    "Angulos rostri Amici vehementer demitti video, deinde pertinaciter rursus tolli, sicut saepe faciebant cum lacrimas comprimere conabatur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:305
translate latin end_game2_735dbcbe:

    # a "\"No, but I discussed with them those supplements that we take to extend our lifespans. You'll be able to take them, to make those eight years seem more negligible.\""
    a "\"Non; sed cum eis disputavi de illis supplementis quae sumimus ut vitae spatium extendamus. Ea sumere poteris, ut illi octo anni leviores videantur.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:306
translate latin end_game2_01846b83:

    # "The way Amicus is talking; fast-paced and upbeat tells me that he's trying to make this sound like it isn't a huge deal at all...but it is."
    "Modus quo Amicus loquitur, celer et laetus, mihi ostendit eum conari facere ut res minime gravis videatur...sed gravis est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:307
translate latin end_game2_a561f874:

    # m "\"Eight years...\""
    m "\"Octo anni...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:309
translate latin end_game2_60465660:

    # "The arm around my shoulder brings me into a full-on hug now, pressing my face against his chest."
    "Bracchium circa umerum meum nunc totum me amplectitur, faciem meam pectori eius premens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:310
translate latin end_game2_408873dd:

    # a "\"I know. It seems like a long time, and it is, but after that...we'll be free.\""
    a "\"Scio. Longum tempus videtur, et est; sed postea...liberi erimus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:311
translate latin end_game2_73c0528c:

    # "Amicus's voice is strained, like there's a heavy weight on his chest."
    "Vox Amici intenta est, quasi magnum pondus in pectore habeat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:312
translate latin end_game2_c09655a0:

    # "We both know we won't."
    "Ambo scimus nos liberos non futuros."

# game/end_game2.rpy:313
translate latin end_game2_d48ac3ae:

    # m "\"And I'm gonna have to do all of that alone? Couldn't you come help me?\""
    m "\"Et omnia illa solus facere debebo? Non poteris venire ut me adiuves?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:314
translate latin end_game2_625f102c:

    # "Now I sound like a child."
    "Nunc quasi puer sono."

# game/end_game2.rpy:315
translate latin end_game2_f5407cc7:

    # "I can see Amicus's eyes glistening, but he stubbornly continues to smile."
    "Oculos Amici micantes video, sed pertinaciter subridere pergit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:317
translate latin end_game2_dfa727db:

    # a "\"You won't need my help. You're fully capable on your own. Besides, we'll see each other again as soon as your series of planned steps are completed.\""
    a "\"Auxilio meo non egebis. Ipse plene potes. Praeterea rursus nos invicem videbimus statim ubi series graduum tibi constitutorum perfecta erit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:318
translate latin end_game2_750be4be:

    # "Over the course of eight years."
    "Per octo annos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:320
translate latin end_game2_6b9038c7:

    # a "\"And once we reach that point, we'll be able to finally relax and—\""
    a "\"Et cum ad illum locum pervenimus, tandem relaxari poterimus et...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:321
translate latin end_game2_97670b48:

    # m "\"But will we?\""
    m "\"Sed poterimusne?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:322
translate latin end_game2_4be4d5de:

    # "I'm still trying to absorb the idea of a years-long mission, a mission that involves introducing all of Earth to the idea of sapient life beyond our planet."
    "Adhuc cogitationem muneris per annos gerendi percipere conor, muneris quod totam Terram de vita sapiente extra planetam nostrum certiorem facere complectitur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:323
translate latin end_game2_eb272b36:

    # "That idea is harrowing enough, but after being strung along by the parents like this, I have to wonder..."
    "Illa cogitatio satis terrifica est; sed postquam a Parentibus sic deceptus sum, mirari debeo..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:324
translate latin end_game2_981d7d93:

    # m "\"It seems like after we accomplish every step, there's a bigger one right after.\""
    m "\"Videtur post quemque gradum quem perficimus statim maior adesse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:325
translate latin end_game2_a898dd3f:

    # "I feel my heart rate pick up, but rather than becoming angry, I'm feeling kind of desperate."
    "Cor meum celerius pulsare sentio; sed pro ira aliquantum despero."

# game/end_game2.rpy:326
translate latin end_game2_9aa60d66:

    # m "\"How much more are they gonna ask from us? This whole thing is just...puppeteering. We're not in control of anything at all!\""
    m "\"Quanto plus a nobis petent? Tota res tantum...pupas regere est. Nihil omnino regimus!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:328
translate latin end_game2_9e17ba4d:

    # a "\"[mc]...\""
    a "\"[mc]...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:329
translate latin end_game2_e82ff981:

    # "Amicus reaches out to me as I stand up."
    "Amicus manus ad me porrigit dum surgo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:330
translate latin end_game2_9125143f:

    # a "\"Please, I know this is hard. I've been trying to figure out a way not to drag you into this, but the parents seem intent—\""
    a "\"Quaeso, scio hoc difficile esse. Viam invenire conatus sum qua te in haec non implicem, sed Parentes videntur intenti—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:331
translate latin end_game2_8aa4a3a0:

    # m "\"This isn't fair, though! We paid our dues...I fucking DIED!\""
    m "\"Sed hoc iniquum est! Satis iam dedimus...ego, mehercule, MORTUUS SUM!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:332
translate latin end_game2_9f3987e1:

    # "Again, I sound like a little kid."
    "Rursus quasi parvus puer sono."

# game/end_game2.rpy:333
translate latin end_game2_65bd5da1:

    # "I can't help myself."
    "Me continere non possum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:334
translate latin end_game2_556a477b:

    # "This really isn't fair at all."
    "Hoc vere omnino iniquum est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:335
translate latin end_game2_be4f33bc:

    # "I didn't ask for any of this."
    "Nihil horum petivi."

# game/end_game2.rpy:336
translate latin end_game2_0958e2d5:

    # "Originally, I had Amicus to blame."
    "Initio Amicum accusare poteram."

# game/end_game2.rpy:337
translate latin end_game2_f5d26e5a:

    # "He was the one that brought me here in the first place."
    "Ipse me ab initio huc adduxerat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:338
translate latin end_game2_fed64c3c:

    # "Now though, knowing that everything was planned and orchestrated by the parents...I feel powerless, like I didn't have any choice from the very beginning."
    "Sed nunc, sciens omnia a Parentibus parata atque ordinata esse...impotens me sentio, quasi ab ipso initio nullam electionem habuerim."

# game/end_game2.rpy:339
translate latin end_game2_81558108:

    # m "\"I don't even have a say in this...\""
    m "\"Ne vocem quidem in hac re habeo...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:341
translate latin end_game2_357acd82:

    # a "\"But you do! I haven't gotten to that part yet.\""
    a "\"Sed habes! Nondum ad illam partem perveni.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:342
translate latin end_game2_628def40:

    # "Amicus has his paws raised, and I can see that he's still trying to hold back tears."
    "Manus Amici sublatae sunt; video eum adhuc lacrimas comprimere conari."

# game/end_game2.rpy:343
translate latin end_game2_a760ebeb:

    # "I want to lash out at something, but I know this isn't his fault, especially now, so I try to calm myself, taking a few deep breaths and swallowing hard."
    "Aliquid ferire volo; sed scio culpam eius non esse, maxime nunc, itaque me sedare conor, aliquoties alte spirans et graviter deglutiens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:345
translate latin end_game2_bce3d6e6:

    # a "\"They told me that you can make a decision, just as I made mine.\""
    a "\"Mihi dixerunt te electionem facere posse, sicut ego meam feci.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:346
translate latin end_game2_a7f00c9c:

    # "I'm quiet for a moment, still breathing heavily."
    "Paulisper taceo, adhuc graviter spirans."

# game/end_game2.rpy:347
translate latin end_game2_753ece1c:

    # a "\"You can choose not to accept the mission. They will not force you to do it. We have around nine months before the mission begins.\""
    a "\"Munus non accipere eligere potes. Te facere non cogent. Novem fere menses habemus antequam munus incipit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:348
translate latin end_game2_210a946a:

    # "I stare at the wolf, letting those words sink in."
    "Lupum intueor, verba illa percipiens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:349
translate latin end_game2_5a1d1c0a:

    # m "\"And...and if I don't accept? What are the consequences?\""
    m "\"Et...et si non accipio? Qui effectus sunt?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:350
translate latin end_game2_fde41635:

    # "That deep frown returns to Amicus's face."
    "Gravis ille contractus vultus Amici redit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:352
translate latin end_game2_1e607857:

    # a "\"Well...they won't provide transport back to Earth. Of course, I'll likely be able to set it up for you now, but considering that the integration will be delayed...I would be disallowed from returning to see you.\""
    a "\"Bene...vecturam ad Terram non praebebunt. Scilicet nunc probabiliter eam tibi parare potero, sed cum insertio differatur...mihi redire ut te videam vetabitur.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:353
translate latin end_game2_0b79c47e:

    # "More manipulation."
    "Plures artes ad nos regendos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:354
translate latin end_game2_12215d3d:

    # "I clench my hands into fists, willing the parents, wherever the fuck they are, to feel my anger toward them for doing this to us."
    "Manus in pugnos stringo, volens Parentes, ubicumque malum sunt, iram meam adversus eos sentire, quod hoc nobis faciunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:355
translate latin end_game2_763230a1:

    # "I half-expect my throat to just explode right then and there and send a shower of blood over Amicus who's still sitting in front of me."
    "Paene exspecto guttur meum ibi statim explodere et imbrem sanguinis super Amicum, qui adhuc coram me sedet, spargere."

# game/end_game2.rpy:356
translate latin end_game2_403db639:

    # m "\"So either I do what they say, or I never see you again?\""
    m "\"Ergo aut quod dicunt facio, aut te numquam rursus video?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:358
translate latin end_game2_9c746b8d:

    # a "\"Well...you could choose not to return to Earth. I am not suggesting that be your decision, but it is one of the possibilities.\""
    a "\"Bene...eligere possis te ad Terram non redire. Non suadeo id eligendum, sed una ex facultatibus est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:359
translate latin end_game2_599a4f50:

    # "I look away, never having been so unsure of what to do in my life."
    "Oculos averto, numquam in vita mea tam incertus quid facerem."

# game/end_game2.rpy:360
translate latin end_game2_e4c2de1d:

    # "This all feels so wrong."
    "Haec omnia tam prava sentio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:361
translate latin end_game2_e40573ca:

    # "I'd always felt wrong about the parents, but I'd never suspected {i}this{/i}."
    "Semper aliquid pravum de Parentibus senseram, sed numquam {i}hoc{/i} suspicatus eram."

# game/end_game2.rpy:363
translate latin end_game2_4c30ac82:

    # m "\"I—I need to go think about this.\""
    m "\"Ego—ire debeo ut de hac re cogitem.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:365
translate latin end_game2_acddb55b:

    # "I'm starting to turn away when Amicus abruptly stands up."
    "Me avertere incipio cum Amicus subito surgit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:366
translate latin end_game2_2a69a45f:

    # "I think he's going to come after me, maybe wrap me up in another hug."
    "Puto eum post me venturum, fortasse rursus me amplexurum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:367
translate latin end_game2_144064f4:

    # "Instead, he keeps his paws behind his back, looking at me with an expression of stoic duty."
    "Sed manus post tergum tenet, me vultu tranquilli officii spectans."

# game/end_game2.rpy:369
translate latin end_game2_bbde8ffd:

    # a "\"Alright, I'll be heading out to the city for part of the day to visit with a triumvirate...and whatever you choose, [mc], I will fully support you.\""
    a "\"Bene, ad urbem per partem diei ibo ut triumvirum conveniam...et quidquid eligis, [mc], tibi penitus favebo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:370
translate latin end_game2_9618a47a:

    # "It takes me a moment to realize that Amicus is using his \"official\" face right now, and it's strange to have him use it on me."
    "Paulum temporis opus est ut intellegam Amicum nunc vultu \"publico\" uti; mirum est eum eo erga me uti."

# game/end_game2.rpy:371
translate latin end_game2_99b83ef7:

    # "Even though I know he's doing it to make things easier for me, to not sway my decision based on his emotions, I hate that he has to do it."
    "Quamquam scio eum id facere ut mihi facilius sit, ne affectibus suis electionem meam flectat, odi eum facere debere."

# game/end_game2.rpy:372
translate latin end_game2_7216cec5:

    # "I shake my head and turn away, walking out of the room even as I hear Amicus make a strangled noise as he cuts himself off and holds back from saying whatever he was going to say."
    "Caput quatio et me averto, e cubiculo ambulans, dum etiam Amicum sonum pressum edere audio, verba comprimentem et quidquid dicturus erat retinentem."

# game/end_game2.rpy:376
translate latin end_game2_6d989b06:

    # "I walk briskly through the hallways, trying to gather my thoughts."
    "Celeriter per ambulacra ambulo, cogitationes colligere conatus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:377
translate latin end_game2_b42ad93b:

    # "I just...want to spend time with Amicus, go back to Earth, see my family, come back to Adastra..."
    "Tantum...tempus cum Amico agere volo, ad Terram redire, familiam meam videre, in Adastram redire..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:378
translate latin end_game2_794d043e:

    # "But no, these parents are meddling with my life, seemingly rendering every choice I make meaningless."
    "Sed non: hi Parentes vitam meam turbant, quasi omnem electionem quam facio inanem reddentes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:379
translate latin end_game2_09d75d61:

    # "If they can do all and see all, why are they messing with me and Amicus like this?"
    "Si omnia facere atque videre possunt, cur me et Amicum sic vexant?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:380
translate latin end_game2_65623900:

    # "I feel another hot flash of anger toward them as I turn a corner and run smack into something soft, furry, and white."
    "Alium calidum irae impetum adversus eos sentio, dum angulum circumverto et recta in aliquid molle, pilosum et album incurro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:383
translate latin end_game2_a237968c:

    # unk "\"Oof! What in the name of the gods!?\""
    unk "\"Oof! Quid, per deos!?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:384
translate latin end_game2_7d866cf4:

    # "It takes me a moment to recognize the voice, probably because of how disoriented I am from running into him."
    "Paulum temporis opus est ut vocem agnoscam, probabiliter quia incursu tam perturbatus sum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:385
translate latin end_game2_d86fad64:

    # m "\"Sorry...Cassius.\""
    m "\"Ignosce...Cassi.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:386
translate latin end_game2_70528eec:

    # "I finally focus on the indignant wolf as he angrily smooths down his fur."
    "Tandem lupum indignatum clare video, dum iratus pilos suos complanat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:388
translate latin end_game2_2a0e22d9:

    # c "\"Watch where you're going! You could have knocked me to the floor. You know what a catastrophe that could result in!\""
    c "\"Vide quo eas! Me in solum deicere potuisti. Scis quantam calamitatem id efficere possit!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:389
translate latin end_game2_4eb5cc91:

    # "Despite his outrage, I'm actually kind of happy to see Cassius back to his old self."
    "Quamquam iratus est, aliquantum vere gaudeo Cassium ad pristinos mores reversum videre."

# game/end_game2.rpy:390
translate latin end_game2_9ca4a036:

    # "Just two days ago he was bed-ridden, though recovering."
    "Ante duos tantum dies lecto adstrictus erat, quamquam convalescens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:391
translate latin end_game2_361a3f9c:

    # "A combination of Virginia inducing him to vomit and a quick delivery of an antidote left Cassius in a position to fully recover."
    "Quod Virginia eum vomere fecit et antidotum cito allatum est Cassio facultatem penitus convalescendi dedit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:392
translate latin end_game2_b297e991:

    # m "\"Hello to you too, Cass.\""
    m "\"Tu quoque salve, Cass.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:393
translate latin end_game2_f32b5277:

    # "Cassius fixes me with a narrow-eyed glare."
    "Cassius oculis contractis iratus me spectat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:395
translate latin end_game2_d9b06f11:

    # c "\"Since when did I give you permission to use my shortened name, human?\""
    c "\"Ex quo tibi nomine meo abbreviato uti permisi, homo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:396
translate latin end_game2_0a23efe4:

    # "I shrug, simply adjusting my robe after having it disheveled from the collision."
    "Umeros tollo, tantum togam post incursum incomptam componens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:397
translate latin end_game2_36eb5885:

    # m "\"How are you feeling?\""
    m "\"Quomodo te habes?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:399
translate latin end_game2_07b191f7:

    # c "\"Changing the subject, I see. Well never mind. I'm feeling fine, thank you. I can at least eat solid foods now without retching, though I doubt I'll ever be able to drink wine again without doing so.\""
    c "\"Argumentum mutas, video. Bene, nihil refert. Bene valeo, gratias. Saltem nunc cibos solidos sine vomitu edere possum, quamquam dubito me umquam rursus vinum sine eo bibere posse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:400
translate latin end_game2_623e858c:

    # m "\"I'm sorry to hear that.\""
    m "\"Me paenitet id audire.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:402
translate latin end_game2_c389f91d:

    # c "\"I'm sure you are.\""
    c "\"Certus sum te esse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:403
translate latin end_game2_4f6bc2a8:

    # "I shake my head, wondering why the wolf has to be so sour all the time."
    "Caput quatio, miratus cur lupus semper tam amarus esse debeat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:404
translate latin end_game2_f364dae6:

    # "Maybe it's a side-effect of always being second-in-line for everything."
    "Fortasse effectus est semper secundum in omnibus esse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:405
translate latin end_game2_f62e233b:

    # "I see something similar in Neferu, they just go about handling it differently."
    "Simile quid in Neferu video; tantum aliter rem tractant."

# game/end_game2.rpy:406
translate latin end_game2_4f387644:

    # "Maybe it's also because of his illness, always seen as weak and needing help, and he reacted by being a dick."
    "Fortasse etiam morbus eius causa est: Cassius semper infirmus atque auxilio egens visus est, et ideo improbus factus est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:407
translate latin end_game2_75512a28:

    # "Then again, it could just be because he {i}is{/i} a dick."
    "Rursus, fortasse tantum quia improbus {i}est{/i}."

# game/end_game2.rpy:408
translate latin end_game2_c1f695ab:

    # m "\"So, uh, what are your plans now that—\""
    m "\"Ergo, eh, quid nunc paras, cum—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:410
translate latin end_game2_c59ee696:

    # c "\"—Now that I've abdicated the throne and am leaving in disgrace?\""
    c "\"—Cum throno abdicaverim et cum dedecore abeam?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:411
translate latin end_game2_cd210691:

    # m "\"You're not leaving in disgrace, I think the people are going to be really—\""
    m "\"Cum dedecore non abis; puto populum vere—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:412
translate latin end_game2_3d85ed27:

    # c "\"I'm already being made fun of for being one of the shortest serving emperors in the history of the empire. I'm the main topic in all of the comedies at the moment.\""
    c "\"Iam irrideor quod unus ex imperatoribus brevissime regentibus in historia imperii fui. Praecipuum argumentum omnium comoediarum nunc sum.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:413
translate latin end_game2_d1171c7d:

    # m "\"Ah.\""
    m "\"Ah.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:415
translate latin end_game2_07f0be09:

    # "Cassius takes in a deep breath, closing his eyes."
    "Cassius alte spirat, oculos claudens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:417
translate latin end_game2_cbf85703:

    # c "\"Anyway, [mc], I wanted to thank you.\""
    c "\"Ceterum, [mc], tibi gratias agere volebam.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:418
translate latin end_game2_34dd85e0:

    # "I almost get whiplash from the sudden change in tone and topic."
    "Paene cervix mea laeditur tam subito sono et argumento mutatis."

# game/end_game2.rpy:419
translate latin end_game2_df8ec4bc:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"Quid?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:421
translate latin end_game2_f14c34eb:

    # c "\"Oh, don't make me say it again. I'm simply thankful for you putting the empire on a course that is...somewhat tolerable, at least.\""
    c "\"O, noli me rursus dicere cogere. Tantum gratias ago quod imperium in viam posuisti quae...saltem aliquantum tolerabilis est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:422
translate latin end_game2_6251f340:

    # m "\"As opposed to being ruled by Cato?\""
    m "\"Potius quam Catoni pareamus?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:424
translate latin end_game2_e064fbf4:

    # c "\"Yes. While I might not believe that my brother is what is best for the empire, at least he cares for it, and I suppose that's all that I can hope for.\""
    c "\"Ita. Quamquam fortasse non credo fratrem meum optimum imperio esse, saltem id curat; credo id omne esse quod sperare possum.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:425
translate latin end_game2_22a21ada:

    # m "\"Weren't you negotiating a position with Amicus?\""
    m "\"Nonne de munere cum Amico tractabas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:427
translate latin end_game2_e4b3eda3:

    # "Cassius looks at me suspiciously, though I have no idea why."
    "Cassius suspiciosus me spectat, quamquam omnino nescio cur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:428
translate latin end_game2_2352acfd:

    # "I suppose having almost being assassinated and also being sabotaged by everyone in the palace has made him a bit wary."
    "Credo eum paulo cautiorem factum esse, cum paene interfectus sit et omnes in palatio ei insidiati sint."

# game/end_game2.rpy:429
translate latin end_game2_f62f0546:

    # c "\"I suppose he'll tell you anyway, so yes, I'm looking to become the Chief of Social Affairs.\""
    c "\"Credo eum tamen tibi narraturum; itaque ita, Praefectus Rerum Socialium fieri cupio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:430
translate latin end_game2_9244ed78:

    # "He rolls his eyes at my lack of reaction."
    "Oculos volvit quia nihil respondeo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:432
translate latin end_game2_37fe3af9:

    # c "\"In other words, I will be making sure that Adastra's most vulnerable are taken care of, that all will someday receive the financial, social, and especially medical care that they need.\""
    c "\"Aliis verbis, curabo ut infirmissimi Adastrae protegantur, ut omnes aliquando auxilium pecuniarium, sociale atque maxime medicum accipiant quo egent.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:433
translate latin end_game2_6e10c4fe:

    # "I perk up."
    "Animum attendo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:434
translate latin end_game2_bda8bda6:

    # m "\"Oh good! That's kind of what you were all about with your campaigning, right?\""
    m "\"O bonum! Hoc quodam modo praecipuum consiliorum tuorum erat, recte?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:436
translate latin end_game2_36f90952:

    # c "\"Yes, it will be nice to focus all my energy on that rather than the bothersome politics that come with being emperor. I don't envy Amicus.\""
    c "\"Ita; gratum erit omnes vires meas ad id conferre, pro molestis rebus politicis quae cum imperio veniunt. Amico non invideo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:437
translate latin end_game2_fae1d549:

    # "He eyes me closely."
    "Me diligenter spectat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:439
translate latin end_game2_55a29d8c:

    # c "\"I know you're very close with him, so please, if I must ask anything of you, it's to make sure that he does not forget those outside the Triumvir Cities.\""
    c "\"Scio te ei proximum esse; itaque, quaeso, si quid a te petere debeo, id est curare ut eos extra Urbes Triumvirales non obliviscatur.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:440
translate latin end_game2_d0113423:

    # c "\"Their situation is desperate, and if we are truly going to reap fortune from an alliance, then they should be the first to benefit, not the Adastran elites.\""
    c "\"Condicio eorum desperata est; et si vere fortunam e foedere colligemus, primi fructum habere debent, non optimates Adastrae.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:441
translate latin end_game2_39d5b9db:

    # "It's one of those rare moments that Cassius is being completely genuine with me, so I nod earnestly."
    "Rarum momentum est quo Cassius penitus sincere mecum agit, itaque serio annuo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:442
translate latin end_game2_83b24450:

    # m "\"Of course.\""
    m "\"Certe.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:443
translate latin end_game2_0be0c35c:

    # "I also plan on making sure that Amicus remembers the wolven children, and to right the wrongs of what the past rulers had done to them."
    "Etiam curare cogito ut Amicus Liberorum Luporum meminerit atque iniurias corrigat quas pristini rectores eis fecerunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:445
translate latin end_game2_89bcea3a:

    # "There's a lull in the conversation, and I try to think of something to say, to thank Cassius for in return."
    "Sermo paulisper cessat; aliquid dicendum invenire conor, aliquam rem qua vicissim Cassio gratias agam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:446
translate latin end_game2_123574dc:

    # m "\"And, um, thank you for understanding our position, for deciding to step down when we asked.\""
    m "\"Et, ehm, gratias quod condicionem nostram intellexisti, quod abdicare statuisti cum petivimus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:448
translate latin end_game2_7741584b:

    # c "\"You threatened me with outright humiliation if I did not.\""
    c "\"Dedecus apertum mihi minati estis si non facerem.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:449
translate latin end_game2_6c538681:

    # "I try to hold in a sigh of my own at the wolf's frustrating attitude, even if my attempt at some form of diplomacy with him was clumsy."
    "Suspiratum meum continere conor ob irritantes lupi mores, etiamsi conatus meus cum eo legatum agendi ineptus erat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:450
translate latin end_game2_3bf5aa36:

    # m "\"Yeah, well, thanks anyway.\""
    m "\"Ita, bene, tamen gratias.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:452
translate latin end_game2_276a9304:

    # "Cassius grunts noncommittally, then looks past me."
    "Cassius incertum fremitum edit, tum praeter me spectat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:453
translate latin end_game2_1f2153c9:

    # c "\"Anyway, I must be going to the city. I have an appointment.\""
    c "\"Ceterum, ad urbem ire debeo. Conventum habeo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:454
translate latin end_game2_0a95e931:

    # "That's when I remember Alex."
    "Tum Alex memini."

# game/end_game2.rpy:455
translate latin end_game2_de606041:

    # "I never did see Cassius's reaction to finding out about the cat's treachery."
    "Numquam reactionem Cassii vidi cum proditionem felis comperit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:456
translate latin end_game2_2a2a54a1:

    # "Amicus had been furious when I told him, and I'd practically had to hold him back from marching out into the gardens and strangling the cat himself."
    "Amicus furiosus erat cum ei narravi; paene eum retinere debui ne in hortos exiret et felem ipse strangularet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:457
translate latin end_game2_ea4b358e:

    # "He was especially furious when I told him that I'd made a deal with Alex to keep him from facing the consequences of sabotaging the entire empire."
    "Maxime furiosus erat cum ei dixi me cum Alex pactum fecisse ne ille poenas totius imperii impediendi daret."

# game/end_game2.rpy:458
translate latin end_game2_a40b1901:

    # "Amicus had settled on banishing Alexios from the palace, to some high-security apartments in the center of Adastra City."
    "Amicus Alexios e palatio in conclavia diligenter custodita in media Urbe Adastra expellere statuerat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:459
translate latin end_game2_9b0b067a:

    # "Cassius has been visiting him there ever since."
    "Cassius eum ibi ex eo tempore visitavit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:460
translate latin end_game2_843caba9:

    # "While I don't know what the state of their relationship is, I suppose even high treason isn't enough to stop Cassius from seeing the cat again."
    "Quamquam nescio quo statu necessitudo eorum sit, credo ne maiestatis quidem crimen satis esse ut Cassium felem rursus videre prohibeat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:461
translate latin end_game2_f5473994:

    # "They must be pretty close, even closer than I'd initially thought."
    "Valde coniuncti esse debent, etiam magis quam initio putaveram."

# game/end_game2.rpy:462
translate latin end_game2_66edc6d8:

    # "I'm curious, but stop myself from asking, as I know that would only lead to more glares and sneers from the wolf."
    "Curiosus sum, sed me rogare prohibeo, quia scio id tantum plures obtutus iratos atque irrisiones lupi excitaturum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:464
translate latin end_game2_0745edb7:

    # "So instead I bow and step aside, a bit surprised when Cassius bows in return, even if it's mostly just a half-hearted nod."
    "Itaque inclino et in latus cedo, paulum miratus cum Cassius vicissim inclinat, etiamsi plerumque tantum invitus annuit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:466
translate latin end_game2_600c20fe:

    # "I watch the white wolf disappear out through the main entrance, and I wait a few moments before taking the same route out into the gardens."
    "Lupum album per praecipuum aditum evanescere specto; paulisper exspecto antequam eadem via in hortos exeo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:470
translate latin end_game2_c2f8da65:

    # "While the conversation with Cassius had distracted me for a bit, my mind wanders back to what Amicus had just told me."
    "Quamquam sermo cum Cassio animum meum paulisper avertit, mens mea ad ea quae Amicus modo dixit redit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:471
translate latin end_game2_3bff8ca6:

    # "I can't stop the feeling of constriction that seems to wrap around me, bound to the will of these supposedly all-knowing creatures."
    "Sensum constrictionis quae me circumdare videtur sistere non possum, voluntati harum rerum quae omnia scire dicuntur vinctus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:472
translate latin end_game2_c575c8ee:

    # "I sit for a while on a bench, contemplating everything while my hand absently caresses my repaired neck."
    "Aliquamdiu in scamno sedeo, omnia deliberans dum velut inscius manu cervicem reparatam mulceo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:473
translate latin end_game2_e7938bcb:

    # "I'd pressed a bit harder against the skin a few times, and didn't like the unfamiliar shapes and edges that I felt."
    "Aliquoties cutem paulo durius presseram, nec mihi placebant alienae formae atque acies quas sentiebam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:474
translate latin end_game2_511ea7b4:

    # "I'd asked Amicus how the parents had done it, how they had the time to place the machinery in my neck, and also make me start breathing again."
    "Amicum rogaveram quomodo Parentes fecissent, quomodo tempus habuissent machinas in cervicem meam ponendi atque me rursus spirare faciendi."

# game/end_game2.rpy:475
translate latin end_game2_47731c6b:

    # "But it turns out it's one of those parental-tech things that no one really understands."
    "Sed apparet id unam ex illis rebus artis Parentum esse quas nemo vere intellegit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:476
translate latin end_game2_f2015377:

    # "It seemed to have happened instantaneously, as if I'd been whisked away somewhere else to have surgery before being placed back in the archives."
    "Statim factum videbatur, quasi alio ad curationem abductus essem antequam in archiva reponerer."

# game/end_game2.rpy:477
translate latin end_game2_b85396ef:

    # "Apparently when Amicus's father had asked the parents to restore Cato's sight, it had just happened overnight, the old wolf surprising everyone when he walked into the dining room with his brand new visor."
    "Ut videtur, cum pater Amici Parentes rogaverat ut visum Catonis restituerent, una nocte factum erat; senex lupus omnes obstupefecerat cum in triclinium novo oculorum tegumento ingressus est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:478
translate latin end_game2_91b8c6f2:

    # "That had been over a decade ago."
    "Id ante plus quam decem annos fuerat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:479
translate latin end_game2_4397a5a3:

    # "And that gets me wondering why the parents did that if they knew Cato would go on to do the things he did."
    "Et hoc me facit mirari cur Parentes ita fecerint si sciebant Catonem postea illa facturum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:480
translate latin end_game2_1354e0f2:

    # "He blatantly got in the way of their plans."
    "Aperte consilia eorum impediebat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:481
translate latin end_game2_022bac52:

    # "Why would they let him hold such an influential position in the empire, let alone restore his vision?"
    "Cur eum tam gravem locum in imperio habere sinerent, nedum visum restituerent?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:482
translate latin end_game2_b4ba0485:

    # "{i}Interference is to be kept to a minimum{/i} — I can practically hear the monitor say."
    "{i}Interventus minimus servandus est{/i} — Monitorem paene dicentem audio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:483
translate latin end_game2_f749c0de:

    # "I sigh, just sort of wishing that the parents didn't exist at all, that this {i}Other{/i} wasn't eating at the edges of our universe, which is apparently the root of all of this."
    "Suspiro, tantum cupiens Parentes omnino non exsistere, hoc {i}Alterum{/i} margines universi nostri non rodere, quod manifeste radix omnium horum est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:484
translate latin end_game2_984fc457:

    # "That's something else that I don't understand."
    "Id aliud est quod non intellego."

# game/end_game2.rpy:485
translate latin end_game2_d87ad4f1:

    # "From what I gathered, the {i}Galaxias{/i} had already known about the Other, just vaguely."
    "Ex iis quae intellexi, {i}Galaxias{/i} iam Alterum noverat, sed obscure."

# game/end_game2.rpy:486
translate latin end_game2_be0c3486:

    # "Amicus had almost described it to me when I first arrived here and had been told that all life originated from the same source...except for the Other."
    "Amicus paene id mihi descripserat cum primum huc veni et mihi dictum erat omnem vitam ab eodem fonte ortam esse...praeter Alterum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:487
translate latin end_game2_2d9e80af:

    # "A different type of life, so different from {i}us{/i} that we can barely understand {i}them{/i}."
    "Aliud genus vitae, tam diversum a {i}nobis{/i} ut {i}illud{/i} vix intellegere possimus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:488
translate latin end_game2_ec56416a:

    # "But now we know that they're out to get us, or something."
    "Sed nunc scimus illud nos petere, vel quid tale."

# game/end_game2.rpy:489
translate latin end_game2_5158943f:

    # "I just can't help but feel so distant from all of this, the result of the struggle between us and them being millennia away."
    "Tantum me ab his omnibus remotissimum sentio, effectu certaminis inter nos atque illud post milia annorum futuro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:490
translate latin end_game2_7e92c690:

    # "We don't even know {i}how{/i} many millennia."
    "Ne scimus quidem {i}quot{/i} milia annorum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:491
translate latin end_game2_663a3569:

    # "As I'm becoming more and more depressed over all of this, I hear footsteps on the path."
    "Dum propter haec omnia magis magisque tristis fio, vestigia in semita audio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:492
translate latin end_game2_ccef79e2:

    # "I look up, half-expecting to see Alex, even as I remember he's been banished from the palace."
    "Suspicio, nonnihil exspectans me Alex visurum, dum etiam memini eum e palatio expulsum esse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:493
translate latin end_game2_0b3d1b17:

    # "It's Neferu, and he's strolling along the pathways, paws behind his back with his usual suave smile plastered on his muzzle."
    "Neferu est; per semitas otiose ambulat, manibus post tergum, solito eleganti arrisu rostro induto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:494
translate latin end_game2_9ace4164:

    # "I have to wonder how he keeps that expression on all the time, as it's clear he doesn't see me until he comes a bit closer."
    "Mirari debeo quomodo semper illum vultum servet, quia clare me non videt nisi paulo propius venit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:495
translate latin end_game2_5ae1c4e2:

    # "When he does spot me, his ears flick up and I get a glimpse of white teeth as his smile broadens."
    "Ubi me videt, aures eius eriguntur, et dentes albos breviter video dum arrisus latior fit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:496
translate latin end_game2_6e9a8576:

    # "I smile back, even though I'm not in the best mood to chat at the moment."
    "Vicissim subrideo, quamquam nunc colloqui non maxime cupio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:497
translate latin end_game2_2c6e8da1:

    # "Still, I scoot over to make room on the bench, and Neferu greets me with a bow along with a \"Ahhotep be with you\" before he sits next to me, crossing one leg over the other."
    "Tamen recedo ut locum in scamno faciam; Neferu inclinat et \"Ahhotep tecum sit\" me salutat, antequam iuxta me sedet, altero crure alteri imposito."

# game/end_game2.rpy:499
translate latin end_game2_0a432623:

    # n "\"Beautiful day.\""
    n "\"Pulcher dies.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:500
translate latin end_game2_6e7dcc8a:

    # "He says it wistfully, and I just nod in agreement."
    "Desideranter dicit; ego tantum consentiens annuo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:502
translate latin end_game2_4f0c5f4c:

    # n "\"Though I can see that you're not enjoying it as much as I am. Is everything alright, [mc]?\""
    n "\"Sed video te eo non tam frui quam me. Omnia recte se habent, [mc]?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:503
translate latin end_game2_5d1f8647:

    # "I'm about to give him a generic answer before I sigh, leaning back on the bench."
    "Iam commune responsum daturus sum, tum suspiro, in scamno recumbens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:504
translate latin end_game2_54015def:

    # m "\"No...no, not really, Neferu.\""
    m "\"Non...non, vere non, Neferu.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:506
translate latin end_game2_bf3db091:

    # n "\"Ah, I find that a bit surprising considering the way things have gone the past few days.\""
    n "\"Ah, id paulum mirum invenio, habita ratione rerum superiorum dierum.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:507
translate latin end_game2_8619f2c6:

    # "I shrug."
    "Umeros tollo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:508
translate latin end_game2_d2976e4a:

    # m "\"I mean, aside from almost dying, I guess everything here is good, but out there—\""
    m "\"Dico, praeterquam quod paene mortuus sum, credo omnia hic bona esse, sed illic—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:509
translate latin end_game2_0b8d64ac:

    # "I nod up at the sky, at space."
    "Capite caelum atque spatium siderale significo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:510
translate latin end_game2_a0c62d5e:

    # m "\"I just don't know what to do.\""
    m "\"Tantum nescio quid faciam.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:512
translate latin end_game2_8420473b:

    # n "\"Perhaps I could offer some advice?\""
    n "\"Fortasse consilium dare possim?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:513
translate latin end_game2_fe10ab79:

    # m "\"Uh...\""
    m "\"Eh...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:514
translate latin end_game2_c985aa82:

    # "I remember that Amicus had told me to keep the revelations about human civilization a secret, at least until the parents give further instruction."
    "Memini Amicum mihi dixisse ut revelationes de civilizatione humana occultas servarem, saltem donec Parentes amplius iubeant."

# game/end_game2.rpy:515
translate latin end_game2_a35ef469:

    # m "\"I don't know. I think I'm just stressed about going home, about how I'm gonna do it, ya know?\""
    m "\"Nescio. Credo me tantum de reditu domum sollicitari, de modo quo id faciam, scis?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:517
translate latin end_game2_2c01e597:

    # n "\"Ah, I definitely understand, for I am in a similar boat. Unfortunately, I have little advice on that particular matter.\""
    n "\"Ah, certe intellego, nam in simili condicione sum. Infeliciter parum consilii de illa re ipsa habeo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:518
translate latin end_game2_65e307a9:

    # "I glance over at him, watching as he rhythmically bounces a black foot about, wiggling the toes and claws."
    "Ad eum specto, pedem nigrum ordinate moventem observans, digitos unguesque agitantem."

# game/end_game2.rpy:519
translate latin end_game2_bfb739ef:

    # m "\"Is Khemia still pissed about what happened?\""
    m "\"Khemia adhuc propter rem gestam irata est?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:521
translate latin end_game2_ef902cd9:

    # n "\"Oh yes, furious. They're still threatening to cut all diplomatic relations with Adastra if Amicus doesn't make things right somehow.\""
    n "\"O ita, furiosa. Adhuc omnes necessitudines legatorum cum Adastra rumpere minantur, nisi Amicus res aliquo modo corrigat.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:522
translate latin end_game2_77f4659f:

    # m "\"Make things right?\""
    m "\"Res corrigat?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:524
translate latin end_game2_40c090ab:

    # n "\"Yes, despite the fact that my family very nearly despises me, they actually despise that our name has been sullied by wolven disrespect.\""
    n "\"Ita; quamquam familia mea paene me contemnit, maxime odit quod nomen nostrum contemptu Luporum foedatum est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:525
translate latin end_game2_e5f5675c:

    # m "\"How you were almost executed?\""
    m "\"Quod paene interfectus es?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:527
translate latin end_game2_7b51d250:

    # n "\"That, and also the fact that Cato released the footage of his attack on my person before the scheduled execution. It's been in heavy rotation on the news channels ever since.\""
    n "\"Id atque etiam quod Cato imagines sui impetus in me ante tempus necis constitutum publicavit. Ex eo tempore in canalibus nuntiorum creberrime ostenduntur.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:528
translate latin end_game2_89357ba6:

    # m "\"Oh...\""
    m "\"O...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:529
translate latin end_game2_ab47f2cb:

    # "I haven't watched much Adastran TV after seeing the reenactments of my own death, so I guess I've been missing Neferu getting kicked in the balls over and over again."
    "Non multum televisionis Adastrae spectavi postquam mortem meam rursus actam vidi, itaque credo me Neferu iterum iterumque in testiculos calce percussum non vidisse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:530
translate latin end_game2_90beb000:

    # m "\"Uh...well, you know wolves. They just like any sort of drama.\""
    m "\"Eh...bene, Lupos nosti. Quodlibet drama amant.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:532
translate latin end_game2_ea693e66:

    # n "\"It's been spread across the entire {i}Galaxias{/i}. I suppose seeing a Khemian in such a position is rather amusing to everyone, siblings and children alike.\""
    n "\"Per totam {i}Galaxias{/i} diffusum est. Credo Khemianum in tali loco videre satis omnibus iocosum esse, Fratribus et Liberis aeque.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:533
translate latin end_game2_70b8d467:

    # "I look over at Neferu again, but his light, care-free demeanor continues as he simply seems to be soaking in the scenery."
    "Rursus ad Neferu specto, sed leves securique mores eius manent, dum tantum locum contemplari videtur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:534
translate latin end_game2_aaaf2aef:

    # m "\"Are you doing alright?\""
    m "\"Bene te habes?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:536
translate latin end_game2_a5f89165:

    # "Neferu looks at me then, smile becoming a bit more warm."
    "Tum Neferu ad me spectat, arrisu paulum calidiore."

# game/end_game2.rpy:538
translate latin end_game2_d577863d:

    # n "\"I am fine, [mc], but if I'm being truthful, I {i}am{/i} embarrassed, but that's nothing new for me.\""
    n "\"Bene valeo, [mc]; sed, si vere dico, me {i}vere{/i} pudet, quamquam id nihil novi mihi est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:539
translate latin end_game2_e499761a_1:

    # "I frown."
    "Frontem contraho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:540
translate latin end_game2_f9eefcb4:

    # m "\"I can count the number of times I've seen you embarrassed on one hand, Neferu. You're downright shameless.\""
    m "\"Quoties te pudere vidi una manu numerare possum, Neferu. Plane impudens es.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:541
translate latin end_game2_4012b079:

    # "I smile to lighten the words, and Neferu just chuckles."
    "Subrideo ut verba leviora faciam; Neferu tantum leniter ridet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:543
translate latin end_game2_5172f9fb:

    # n "\"You probably know by this point that I'm not often genuine. It comes with being a diplomat and the Pharaoh's son.\""
    n "\"Probabiliter iam scis me non saepe sincerum esse. Cum munere legati et filii Pharaonis venit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:545
translate latin end_game2_92e8d4a1:

    # "There's a lull in the conversation as we both just watch the gardens, listening to the birds and watching the bees hover from flower to flower."
    "Sermo cessat dum ambo hortos tantum spectamus, aves audientes et apes e flore in florem volantes observantes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:546
translate latin end_game2_20c75519:

    # "That's when I'm reminded of something."
    "Tum aliquid memini."

# game/end_game2.rpy:547
translate latin end_game2_f0b86e3b:

    # m "\"So...what made the Khemians want to start an alliance? Isn't it pretty groundbreaking for siblings to work together. Like isn't that against the purpose of the {i}Galaxias{/i}?\""
    m "\"Ergo...quid Khemianos foedus incipere velle fecit? Nonne res satis nova est Fratres una agere? Quasi nonne id contra finem {i}Galaxias{/i} est?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:548
translate latin end_game2_1232547c:

    # "I play dumb, like I don't already know it isn't."
    "Stultum simulo, quasi iam nesciam non esse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:549
translate latin end_game2_d9d3c2b9:

    # "Neferu quirks an eyebrow at me."
    "Neferu supercilium ad me tollit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:551
translate latin end_game2_eb9e8fab:

    # n "\"That's a surprising question. Well, to put it simply, we studied the earliest histories of the {i}Galaxias{/i} and came to the conclusion that it was never the intent of the parents for us to be competitors.\""
    n "\"Mira quaestio est. Bene, simpliciter, primis historiis {i}Galaxias{/i} studuimus et conclusimus numquam consilium Parentum fuisse nos competitores esse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:552
translate latin end_game2_e66e99bf:

    # n "\"If you don't know, the goal of a sibling race and its children is to achieve parental status. To do that we must be able to achieve intergalactic travel.\""
    n "\"Si nescis, finis gentis Fraternae atque Liberorum eius est gradum Parentum adipisci. Ut id faciamus, iter inter galaxias facere posse debemus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:553
translate latin end_game2_1f82f7b4:

    # n "\"We're...slowly realizing that this may not be possible without the cooperation of all sapient life in the Galaxy.\""
    n "\"Lente...intellegimus hoc fortasse sine communi opera omnis vitae sapientis in Galaxia fieri non posse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:554
translate latin end_game2_076d574a:

    # "I nod in understanding."
    "Intellegens annuo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:555
translate latin end_game2_0d6df9c5:

    # "So it seems like the Khemians were already hip to this grand plan, either by actually figuring it out themselves, or with the help of their own parent."
    "Itaque Khemiani iam de hoc magno consilio scivisse videntur, aut ipsi rem comperientes aut auxilio sui Parentis."

# game/end_game2.rpy:556
translate latin end_game2_f722b24f:

    # "This makes me wonder if they might know more about the thing lingering on the edges of the universe."
    "Hoc me facit mirari num plura sciant de re in finibus universi manente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:557
translate latin end_game2_3283e36f:

    # m "\"Do you know much about the Other?\""
    m "\"Multa de Altero scis?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:558
translate latin end_game2_79d2a3a9:

    # "Now Neferu turns on the bench to really look at me, furrowing his brows."
    "Iam Neferu in scamno se vertit ut vere me spectet, fronte contracta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:560
translate latin end_game2_17c1aa78:

    # n "\"Another interesting question. Did you have some sort of experience with the parents when they healed your wounds?\""
    n "\"Alia quaestio grata. Aliquid cum Parentibus expertus es cum vulnera tua sanaverunt?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:561
translate latin end_game2_b5dbb0ef:

    # m "\"Uh, yeah, kind of. Just really vague stuff, so I'm just curious about it is all.\""
    m "\"Eh, ita, quodam modo. Tantum res vere vagae; itaque tantum curiosus sum.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:562
translate latin end_game2_977229b4:

    # "I try to make it sound like it's not a big deal."
    "Conor facere ut res non gravis videatur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:565
translate latin end_game2_703661ec:

    # n "\"Hmm...well, it is an...entity that spreads through the universe every few billion years. It originated from somewhere other than the original source of life, the source from which we all came.\""
    n "\"Hmm...bene, est...aliquid quod per universum singulis aliquot miliardis annorum diffunditur. Aliunde ortum est quam e primo fonte vitae, fonte ex quo omnes venimus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:566
translate latin end_game2_0e4ddfa6:

    # "His choice of words is confusing me."
    "Verba quae eligit me confundunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:567
translate latin end_game2_dc20acbf:

    # m "\"Is it like, alive?\""
    m "\"Quasi vivit?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:569
translate latin end_game2_700f6858:

    # n "\"Is it alive like you and I? No, not really. It is more of a...machine, I suppose. On the edge of life, but it needs sapient life to exist.\""
    n "\"Vivit sicut tu atque ego? Non, vere non. Magis est...machina, credo. In limite vitae, sed vita sapiente indiget ut exsistat.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:570
translate latin end_game2_e350fc39:

    # m "\"Oh, like a virus?\""
    m "\"O, quasi virus?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:572
translate latin end_game2_8b173763:

    # n "\"Yes, though even viruses originated from the original source. The Other is truly something different.\""
    n "\"Ita, quamquam etiam vira e primo fonte orta sunt. Alterum vere aliquid diversum est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:573
translate latin end_game2_47275cb7:

    # m "\"And it feeds on life? Our life, I mean?\""
    m "\"Et vita alitur? Vita nostra, dico?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:575
translate latin end_game2_972a9b6a:

    # n "\"First I should say that what we know about it is very, very limited, and the majority of that information is likely wrong; really just ghost stories.\""
    n "\"Primum dicere debeo ea quae de eo scimus valde, valde pauca esse, pleraque autem probabiliter falsa; vere tantum fabulae umbrarum.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:576
translate latin end_game2_a1e6df79:

    # m "\"Well, what are these ghost stories?\""
    m "\"Bene, quae sunt hae fabulae umbrarum?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:578
translate latin end_game2_0d30241f:

    # "Neferu sighs and I realize that he's not exactly interested in this topic."
    "Neferu suspirat; intellego eum hoc argumento non maxime delectari."

# game/end_game2.rpy:579
translate latin end_game2_2f6b2350:

    # n "\"How to put it...well, it's thought that in the half dozen or so times that the Other has spread through our part of the universe, it has left behind small, patchy portions of itself.\""
    n "\"Quomodo dicam...bene, putant Alterum sex fere vicibus quibus per nostram universi partem diffusum est parvas partes sui passim reliquisse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:580
translate latin end_game2_58235895:

    # n "\"It is technically all around us, but very weak, though it is thought that highly concentrated portions of it attach to tangible things, or occasionally pass through us.\""
    n "\"Revera circum nos undique est, sed infirmissimum; tamen partes eius valde densae rebus tangibilibus adhaerere aut interdum per nos transire putantur.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:581
translate latin end_game2_5346a6ed:

    # "I feel a little tingle down my spine."
    "Parvam formicationem per spinam sentio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:582
translate latin end_game2_3ac21f16:

    # m "\"And what does it do?\""
    m "\"Et quid facit?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:583
translate latin end_game2_aafda3e6:

    # "Neferu shakes his head."
    "Neferu caput quatit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:585
translate latin end_game2_5b5ca65a:

    # n "\"I'm sure your people have stories of phenomena that are unexplainable? Perhaps an abandoned building that is inhabited by malicious spirits? Possibly a creature that defies all logical explanation, yet sporadically appears in a particular forest?\""
    n "\"Certus sum gentem tuam fabulas de rebus inexplicabilibus habere. Fortasse aedificium desertum a spiritibus malitiosis habitatum? Fortasse creaturam quae omnem explicationem rationalem superat, tamen interdum in certa silva apparet?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:586
translate latin end_game2_703ac1f3:

    # m "\"Wait, like supernatural stuff?\""
    m "\"Exspecta, quasi res supra naturam?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:587
translate latin end_game2_0a855e13:

    # "I give the jackal an incredulous look, and he shrugs and laughs."
    "Chacalum incredulus specto; ille umeros tollit et ridet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:589
translate latin end_game2_bb9119e6:

    # n "\"So the stories say.\""
    n "\"Sic fabulae dicunt.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:590
translate latin end_game2_8501494f:

    # n "\"They also say that sapient consciousness is used by the Other to project these manifestations, and that the sapient's reaction to these projections feeds the entity.\""
    n "\"Etiam dicunt conscientiam Sapientum ab Altero ad has species ostendendas adhiberi, et reactionem Sapientis ad has species rem alere.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:592
translate latin end_game2_b954020a:

    # n "\"Personally, I feel that the legends surrounding the Other are simply a catch-all for anything that is feared, or poorly understood...or just the product of a bored society.\""
    n "\"Ipse puto fabulas circa Alterum tantum omnem rem complecti quae timetur aut parum intellegitur...vel tantum fructum societatis taedio affectae esse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:593
translate latin end_game2_fbed8d77:

    # "I think back to what little I know about ghosts, monsters...even aliens or UFOs, and immediately, the idea is too ridiculous for me to accept."
    "Reminiscor quae pauca de umbris monstrisque scio...etiam de alienigenis aut rebus volantibus ignotis; statim cogitatio nimis ridicula est ut accipiam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:594
translate latin end_game2_73d153b6:

    # m "\"Why haven't I heard of this while I've been here?\""
    m "\"Cur de hac re non audivi dum hic fui?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:596
translate latin end_game2_dda1de9f:

    # n "\"You probably have, but just didn't understand the topic at the time. Either way, it's never a serious worry on anyone's mind considering how rarely this entity makes contact with our side of the universe.\""
    n "\"Probabiliter audivisti, sed tum argumentum non intellexisti. Utroque modo nemini gravis sollicitudo est, cum haec res tam raro nostram universi partem tangat.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:598
translate latin end_game2_ba12d96d:

    # "I just stare at the ground, not really sure of what to say."
    "Tantum solum specto, minime certus quid dicam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:599
translate latin end_game2_ae49887e:

    # "Like Neferu, I find myself not very interested in the topic anymore, and our discussion moves on."
    "Sicut Neferu, hoc argumento iam parum delector, et sermo noster ad alia transit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:600
translate latin end_game2_aba5ed15:

    # "We talk of Neferu's plans; when he might return home, and how I might help him secure the alliance."
    "De consiliis Neferu loquimur: quando domum redeat, et quomodo eum ad foedus firmandum adiuvare possim."

# game/end_game2.rpy:601
translate latin end_game2_2375d7f2:

    # "Eventually, he gets up to return to his room for a nap, leaving me to sit on the bench in silence."
    "Tandem surgit ut ad cubiculum redeat ad brevem somnum, me in scamno tacitum relinquens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:603
translate latin end_game2_1f2b8b9c:

    # "If I'm being honest, the conversation has left me feeling even less convinced by this intergalactic war the parents are apparently getting ready for."
    "Ut verum dicam, colloquium me etiam minus persuasum reliquit de hoc bello intergalactico ad quod Parentes manifeste se parant."

# game/end_game2.rpy:604
translate latin end_game2_c182a8b3:

    # "It sounds more like we're getting ready to fight off an army of space ghosts rather than anything real."
    "Sonat quasi nos ad exercitum umbrarum sideralium repellendum paremus, non ad aliquid verum oppugnandum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:605
translate latin end_game2_1b360c0c:

    # "I sit there for a long while, opening my mind a bit, kind of hoping that the Monitor will swing by and dump a little more information on me that I can work with, even though I know that's not really in his nature."
    "Diu ibi sedeo, mentem paulum aperiens, quodam modo sperans Monitorem venturum et plura indicia mihi daturum quibus uti possim, quamquam scio id non vere naturae eius convenire."

# game/end_game2.rpy:606
translate latin end_game2_a7cb6344:

    # "Things stay predictably quiet, and as I'm thinking about heading back to Amicus's room to see if he's returned, Com's voice makes me jump."
    "Res, ut exspectatur, quietae manent; dum de reditu ad cubiculum Amici cogito ut videam num redierit, vox Computatri me subsilire facit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:607
translate latin end_game2_5b8599ca:

    # com "\"Amicus would like to let you know that he is currently in the bath, and if you would like to, you can join him. However, he wants to make it explicitly clear that it is your choice and that if you need more time—\""
    com "\"Amicus te certiorem facere vult se nunc in balneo esse; si vis, cum eo esse potes. Tamen clare dicere vult electionem tuam esse et, si maiore tempore eges—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:608
translate latin end_game2_bd81624d:

    # m "\"Thanks Com, I'll head there now.\""
    m "\"Gratias, Computatrum; nunc illuc eo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:609
translate latin end_game2_520b085c:

    # com "\"Yes, [mc].\""
    com "\"Ita, [mc].\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:614
translate latin end_game2_98df30cf:

    # "I immediately spot Amicus as the door slides open, and I see the wolf jolt up from leaning back against the edge of the pool before quickly leaning back again, raising a paw casually."
    "Statim Amicum video dum ianua aperitur; lupum a margine piscinae cui innitebatur subito se erigere video, antequam cito rursus recumbit, manum otiose tollens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:615
translate latin end_game2_bb8aede0:

    # "I walk through the steamy air to stand behind Amicus, next to the bench and he looks back at me with a gentle smile."
    "Per aerem vaporosum ambulo ut post Amicum iuxta scamnum stem; ille ad me respicit, leniter subridens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:617
translate latin end_game2_9b769784:

    # a "\"Soak with me?\""
    a "\"Mecum in aqua requiesces?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:618
translate latin end_game2_de155dd5:

    # "I nod wordlessly and slip out of my robes and underwear before walking to the edge of the pool."
    "Tacitus annuo et togam subligaculumque exuo, antequam ad marginem piscinae ambulo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:619
translate latin end_game2_f353b0d0:

    # "With a little hop, I dip in quietly all at once, mostly used to the scalding temperature at this point."
    "Parvo saltu tacite totus immergor, iam plerumque calori ardenti adsuetus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:620
translate latin end_game2_d1fbdbb5:

    # "As I come up, Amicus reaches out to me and I press up next to him, fitting against the curve of his chest in that familiar, easy way."
    "Dum emergo, Amicus manus ad me porrigit; iuxta eum me premo, familiari facilique modo curvae pectoris eius adhaerens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:621
translate latin end_game2_c5f40fc4:

    # m "\"How was the meeting with the triumvirates?\""
    m "\"Quomodo conventus cum triumviris fuit?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:623
translate latin end_game2_6c5c9964:

    # a "\"Good, good. Lots of seemingly pointless talk and etiquette, but as you and I know, it's necessary.\""
    a "\"Bonus, bonus. Multus sermo et multae urbanitates quae inanes videntur; sed, ut tu atque ego scimus, necesse est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:624
translate latin end_game2_5fc9fc28:

    # m "\"As long as there aren't any riots.\""
    m "\"Dum nulli tumultus sunt.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:625
translate latin end_game2_c653a8ed:

    # a "\"Yes, as long as there aren't any of those.\""
    a "\"Ita, dum tales nulli sunt.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:626
translate latin end_game2_8369e5f5:

    # "We sit in the hot water for a while, and I enjoy the way it makes my worries seem so far away, locked behind the doors to the bath."
    "Aliquamdiu in calida aqua sedemus; mihi placet quod sollicitudines meas tam remotas videri facit, post ianuas balnei inclusas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:627
translate latin end_game2_a7540760:

    # "I should do this more often."
    "Hoc saepius facere debeam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:628
translate latin end_game2_c2120147:

    # "But, of course, it's the main thing on Amicus's mind right now."
    "Sed scilicet haec praecipua res in mente Amici nunc est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:629
translate latin end_game2_e1c69ba5:

    # "He clears his throat nervously."
    "Sollicitus guttur purgat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:631
translate latin end_game2_3a8cb532:

    # a "\"Um...how did thinking about, uh...I mean, did you make your deci—no, sorry...\""
    a "\"Ehm...quomodo de, eh...dico, num electionem—non, ignosce...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:632
translate latin end_game2_14574e09:

    # "Amicus trails off in the most awkward way possible, and I laugh a little bit, though it's more of a sad laugh."
    "Amicus ineptissime tacet; paulum rideo, quamquam tristior risus est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:633
translate latin end_game2_7e4308ed:

    # m "\"A little, but...I really don't know, Amicus. I just...\""
    m "\"Paulum, sed...vere nescio, Amice. Tantum...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:635
translate latin end_game2_ac29148e:

    # a "\"Do what you feel is right—\""
    a "\"Fac quod rectum esse sentis...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:636
translate latin end_game2_27b25bb8:

    # m "\"The whole reason we met is because of this purpose they've given me, and I really don't want to cause delays, or drag some other human into this, but something feels really off about this.\""
    m "\"Tota causa cur convenerimus est hoc propositum quod mihi dederunt, et vere moras facere aut alium hominem in hoc trahere nolo, sed aliquid valde pravum de hac re sentio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:637
translate latin end_game2_7b6e451a:

    # "Amicus nods."
    "Amicus annuit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:639
translate latin end_game2_3a32041d:

    # a "\"Well, I don't believe that you should be forced to take on duties that were thrust upon you without your consent. It's cruel, and I want you to choose what you feel is right.\""
    a "\"Bene, non credo te cogi debere officia suscipere quae tibi sine consensu imposita sunt. Crudele est, et volo te eligere quod rectum esse sentis.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:640
translate latin end_game2_9be73704:

    # "I give Amicus a look."
    "Amicum significanter specto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:641
translate latin end_game2_bb0ee4d7:

    # m "\"Hasn't that been {i}your{/i} whole life?\""
    m "\"Nonne tota {i}tua{/i} vita talis fuit?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:643
translate latin end_game2_76ce095d:

    # a "\"Well...yes, but I'm talking about {i}you{/i}.\""
    a "\"Bene...ita, sed de {i}te{/i} loquor.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:644
translate latin end_game2_393dd690:

    # "I smirk."
    "Callide subrideo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:645
translate latin end_game2_78b01f05:

    # m "\"Oh, I see. The silly, dumb ape who can't handle big boy responsibilities.\""
    m "\"O, intellego. Stulta ineptaque simia quae officia virorum sustinere non potest.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:647
translate latin end_game2_f1ee0ee8:

    # "Amicus's reaction to my teasing is instant and visceral."
    "Reactio Amici ad iocum meum statim vehementissima est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:649
translate latin end_game2_21f03b97:

    # a "\"No! I would never—\""
    a "\"Non! Numquam—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:650
translate latin end_game2_73548c05:

    # m "\"Sorry! I was just kidding. I shouldn't make fun about that.\""
    m "\"Ignosce! Tantum iocabar. De ea re iocari non debeam.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:651
translate latin end_game2_423fbd29:

    # "Amicus settles back again, still looking concerned."
    "Amicus rursus recumbit, adhuc sollicitus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:653
translate latin end_game2_0935d879:

    # a "\"It's alright. I just don't want you to ever feel that way again.\""
    a "\"Bene est. Tantum nolo te umquam rursus ita sentire.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:654
translate latin end_game2_6d85daed:

    # "Amicus sighs deeply."
    "Amicus alte suspirat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:656
translate latin end_game2_bd018e14:

    # a "\"Also, I do believe we would have met somehow even without the parents intervening.\""
    a "\"Etiam vere credo nos aliquo modo conventuros fuisse, etiam sine interventu Parentum.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:657
translate latin end_game2_1e36bee6:

    # "Now I really give Amicus a look."
    "Iam vere Amicum significanter specto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:658
translate latin end_game2_1cdd7b14:

    # m "\"Seriously?\""
    m "\"Serio?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:660
translate latin end_game2_a1bc440b:

    # a "\"Of course. Something this special can't be stopped by the likes of time and space.\""
    a "\"Certe. Res tam singularis tempore spatioque prohiberi non potest.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:661
translate latin end_game2_1e5e40d3:

    # "Amicus starts pulling me into his body, nuzzling me."
    "Amicus me corpori suo trahere incipit, rostro mulcens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:662
translate latin end_game2_2cd4a0df:

    # m "\"Anyway, I'm not completely sure yet. I need time to think about it, and we do have nine months.\""
    m "\"Ceterum, nondum penitus certus sum. Tempore ad cogitandum egeo, et novem menses habemus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:663
translate latin end_game2_0677976a:

    # a "\"Take your time, but...but on the off chance that you do choose to go, you must promise me one thing.\""
    a "\"Tempus tibi sume, sed...sed si forte tamen discedere eligis, unam rem mihi promittere debes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:664
translate latin end_game2_4db4f382:

    # "I feel a little apprehension at that."
    "His verbis paulum sollicitor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:665
translate latin end_game2_e2d30ef3:

    # m "\"Yes?\""
    m "\"Volui?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:667
translate latin end_game2_8e130891:

    # a "\"Well, eight years is quite a while for a human lifespan so, I know you rejected them initially, but please start taking the life-extension medication.\""
    a "\"Bene, octo anni satis longi in humana vita sunt; itaque scio te initio recusavisse, sed quaeso medicamenta vitae extendendae sumere incipe.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:669
translate latin end_game2_56d57b96:

    # a "\"There is a formula especially for primates. I need you around for as long as I am, [mc].\""
    a "\"Mixtura primatibus proprie accommodata est. Te adesse volo tam diu quam ego adsum, [mc].\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:670
translate latin end_game2_13a1cd4d:

    # "I realize then how well Amicus is taking this whole 'eight years' thing, and I have to wonder if he's just trying to make it sound less bad than it actually is."
    "Tum intellego quam bene Amicus totam hanc rem 'octo annorum' ferat; mirari debeo num tantum eam minus malam quam vere sit videri facere conetur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:671
translate latin end_game2_1b87042f:

    # "Eight years is a long time, whether you're a human or a wolf."
    "Octo anni longum tempus sunt, sive homo sive lupus es."

# game/end_game2.rpy:672
translate latin end_game2_e69073d0:

    # "I'd actually forgotten about the lifespan-extending medication after Amicus had told me about it."
    "Revera medicamentorum vitae extendendae oblitus eram postquam Amicus de eis narravit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:673
translate latin end_game2_f545b6bb:

    # "For whatever reason, extending my life by decades, even hundreds of years didn't really appeal to me."
    "Nescio cur vitam meam decenniis, etiam centenis annis extendere, non vere me alliceret."

# game/end_game2.rpy:675
translate latin end_game2_0d644fea:

    # "Even now it doesn't really, especially after what I experienced in the Greater Intelligence, but if it makes Amicus happy..."
    "Ne nunc quidem vere me allicit, praesertim post ea quae in Maiore Intellegentia expertus sum, sed si id Amicum laetum facit..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:676
translate latin end_game2_83b24450_1:

    # m "\"Of course.\""
    m "\"Certe.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:680
translate latin end_game2_c0933825:

    # "And yet time seems to move faster than ever."
    "Tamen tempus celerius quam umquam moveri videtur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:681
translate latin end_game2_c9f681ca:

    # "This is on top of the fact that nine months is quite a few more days here on Adastra than it would be on Earth."
    "Accedit quod novem menses hic in Adastra satis multo plures dies quam in Terra habent."

# game/end_game2.rpy:682
translate latin end_game2_d9bfbd12:

    # "Still, the days fly by, and I think it mostly has to do with my life not being in peril anymore."
    "Tamen dies volant, et puto id plerumque ex eo fieri quod vita mea iam non periclitatur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:683
translate latin end_game2_7026886a:

    # "I'm not dreading a trial, or fight that will determine my future."
    "Certamen aut pugnam quae futuram vitam meam decernat non timeo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:684
translate latin end_game2_03e1bf44:

    # "Now it's more of a slow burn that just blends together."
    "Nunc magis est lentus ardor qui omnia confundit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:685
translate latin end_game2_e3ffe38c:

    # "Life in the palace becomes routine again."
    "Vita in palatio rursus cotidiana fit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:686
translate latin end_game2_dd7c912a:

    # "I have my own little schedule that involves gardening, and watching certain programs on Adastran TV that I've actually grown to tolerate."
    "Parvum ordinem meum habeo, qui hortos colere atque certa programmata in televisione Adastrae spectare complectitur, quae iam tolerare didici."

# game/end_game2.rpy:688
translate latin end_game2_15f691f0:

    # "I start to study, using Com as my teacher to learn as much as I can about Adastran and {i}Galaxias{i} history."
    "Studere incipio, Computatro magistro usus, ut quam plurimum de historia Adastrae atque {i}Galaxias{i} discam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:689
translate latin end_game2_eb26c8f4:

    # "I even have enough time to start learning the Language."
    "Etiam satis temporis habeo ut Sermonem discere incipiam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:690
translate latin end_game2_4524baa5:

    # "Apparently they never bothered to name their own language, which is a very wolven thing to do."
    "Ut videtur, numquam sermonem suum nominare curaverunt, quod valde Luporum proprium est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:691
translate latin end_game2_091ee84b:

    # "But as I'd noticed when I first arrived, it's nearly identical to Latin back on Earth."
    "Sed, ut animadverti cum primum veni, paene idem est atque Latina lingua in Terra."

# game/end_game2.rpy:692
translate latin end_game2_58e765c9:

    # "This makes it fairly easy to pick up considering I studied some Latin back in school, and I learned a good deal of Italian before my trip."
    "Hoc eum satis facile discendum facit, cum aliquantum Latinae in schola studuerim et multum Italicae ante iter didicerim."

# game/end_game2.rpy:693
translate latin end_game2_b72d709a:

    # "Amicus thinks it's a bit odd I want to learn, considering I have the lingua."
    "Amicus paulum mirum putat me discere velle, cum Linguam habeam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:694
translate latin end_game2_d78afae1:

    # "And while I've become used to life in what's basically a dubbed film, I can't help but feel like it's a filter of some kind."
    "Quamquam vitae in re quasi pellicula alio sermone conversa adsuevi, sentio quasi aliquod colum esse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:695
translate latin end_game2_a7d970a7:

    # "I'd like to get past that, hear Amicus and the others as they are."
    "Id superare velim, Amicum atque alios sicut sunt audire."

# game/end_game2.rpy:697
translate latin end_game2_26745d29:

    # "And if I'm going to spend most of my life here..."
    "Et si maiorem vitae partem hic agam..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:698
translate latin end_game2_bce61006:

    # "I've already started taking the supplements to extend my lifespan, which means I could be alive for a lot longer than I'd ever imagined."
    "Iam supplementa vitae extendendae sumere coepi; id significat me multo diutius vivere posse quam umquam finxerim."

# game/end_game2.rpy:699
translate latin end_game2_27279348:

    # "Though, Felix says that, at most, I might get about 100 extra years out of the treatment, rather than the 200 years or so that the wolves get because I started taking them when I was already an adult."
    "Sed Felix dicit me summum centum fere annos additos ex curatione habere posse, pro ducentis fere annis quos Lupi habent, quia ea sumere coepi cum iam adultus eram."

# game/end_game2.rpy:700
translate latin end_game2_179db9f1:

    # "Still, it's a lot, and while I'm sure most people on Earth would be desperate for this supplement, I strangely feel a bit exhausted by the idea."
    "Tamen multum est; quamquam certus sum plerosque in Terra hoc supplementum vehementer cupituros, mirum est me cogitatione paulum defatigari."

# game/end_game2.rpy:701
translate latin end_game2_72797534:

    # "Living 150 to 200 years really changes one's perspective on time."
    "Centum quinquaginta ad ducentos annos vivere vere sententiam de tempore mutat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:702
translate latin end_game2_15952d6f:

    # "Maybe that's one of the factors that makes it seem as if the days are going by so fast."
    "Fortasse una ex causis est quae dies tam celeriter transire videri facit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:703
translate latin end_game2_22229787:

    # "The worst part about it is that I don't get to spend very much of it with Amicus."
    "Pessima pars est me parum eius cum Amico agere posse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:704
translate latin end_game2_043330e9:

    # "It's something I had expected, anticipated, even."
    "Res est quam exspectaveram, etiam praevideram."

# game/end_game2.rpy:705
translate latin end_game2_f7590c92:

    # "But I can't help but feel a little depressed that I only see him for a second in the morning when he kisses me goodbye, then late at night to have dinner with me, exhausted by his imperial duties."
    "Sed aliquantum tristis sum quod tantum eum paulisper mane video cum me valedicens osculatur, tum sera nocte ut mecum cenet, officiis imperii defatigatus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:706
translate latin end_game2_9c785ed4:

    # "While Cassius mainly lounged around during his short rule, I also know now that Cato was doing nearly all the work behind the scenes."
    "Quamquam Cassius in brevi imperio suo plerumque otiosus iacebat, iam scio Catonem fere omne opus occulte egisse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:707
translate latin end_game2_7ea3b01d:

    # "And while Virginia would be more than happy to do the same, Amicus isn't the type to be lazy like that."
    "Quamquam Virginia idem libentissime faceret, Amicus non est qui ita piger sit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:708
translate latin end_game2_2bcae931:

    # "Speaking of which, it's not just Amicus; while his absence would be bearable if I had at least {i}someone{/i} to talk to that isn't Com, everyone else seems to have become just as busy."
    "De hac re, non tantum Amicus est: absentiam eius ferre possem si saltem {i}aliquem{/i} haberem quocum loquerer praeter Computatrum, sed omnes alii aeque occupati facti videntur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:710
translate latin end_game2_49f32b0c:

    # "Neferu, my only real friend on this moon aside from Amicus, is usually off doing diplomatic stuff in the city, his mission to secure an alliance now fully in motion."
    "Neferu, solus verus amicus meus in hac luna praeter Amicum, plerumque in urbe res legatorum agit, munere foederis firmandi iam plene incepto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:711
translate latin end_game2_ca7b510c:

    # "Virginia is always by Amicus's side, especially now that the populace has grown used to the idea of a woman in a chief advisor role."
    "Virginia semper iuxta Amicum est, maxime nunc cum populus cogitationi mulieris in munere praecipui consiliarii adsuevit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:712
translate latin end_game2_8f908d02:

    # "And while I've never really connected with her, it would still be nice to have some kind of company."
    "Quamquam numquam vere cum ea coniunctus sum, tamen aliqua societas grata esset."

# game/end_game2.rpy:713
translate latin end_game2_d40ab3da:

    # "I mean, even Cassius would be a welcome distraction, but the white wolf left a few months back to tour the more impoverished regions of Adastra so that resources might be better allocated."
    "Dico, etiam Cassius grata avocatio esset; sed lupus albus ante aliquot menses abiit ut regiones pauperiores Adastrae viseret, quo opes melius distribuantur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:714
translate latin end_game2_007735f1:

    # "And it also turns out that he left with my former best Adastra friend, Alexios."
    "Etiam apparet eum cum pristino optimo amico meo Adastrae Alexios abiisse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:715
translate latin end_game2_5357c49a:

    # "Cassius left us all somewhat stunned when he did this; doing important social work while a known spy and saboteur, one that could be blamed for a lot of damage to Adastran society, is by his side."
    "Cassius omnes nos aliquantum attonitos reliquit cum hoc fecit: grave opus sociale agens dum explorator ac vastator notus, qui multorum damnorum societatis Adastrae accusari possit, iuxta eum est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:716
translate latin end_game2_e2afe305:

    # "Amicus was adamant on deporting Alexios on the first ship back to Omorofa, but Cassius talked with him, and I guess he'd been convincing."
    "Amicus pertinaciter Alexios prima nave ad Omorofa expellere volebat; sed Cassius cum eo locutus est, et credo ei persuasisse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:717
translate latin end_game2_f4baa531:

    # "Amicus simply sent a few extra guards to keep a close eye on Alex."
    "Amicus tantum paucos custodes additos misit ut Alex diligenter observarent."

# game/end_game2.rpy:718
translate latin end_game2_e5f17d7c:

    # "When I'd asked about this, Amicus only told me that the cat is powerless now, unable to connect with his homeworld due to all communication with Omorfa having been blocked after the scandal—"
    "Cum de hac re rogavi, Amicus tantum mihi dixit felem iam impotentem esse, cum mundo suo coniungi non posse, quia omnis communicatio cum Omorfa post scandalum prohibita est—"

# game/end_game2.rpy:719
translate latin end_game2_95e3ae8b:

    # "—one that involved many more actors than just Alex."
    "—quod multo plures quam tantum Alex implicabat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:721
translate latin end_game2_36362789:

    # "It doesn't sit right with me though, the idea that Alex caused so much pain for so many people, yet he's facing no consequences."
    "Sed mihi displicet: Alex tantum dolorem tam multis intulit, tamen nullas poenas dat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:722
translate latin end_game2_4cf95691:

    # "Sure, I'd made that \"deal\" with him to free Amicus, but he really shouldn't still be here."
    "Certe illud \"pactum\" cum eo ad Amicum liberandum feceram; sed vere adhuc hic esse non debet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:723
translate latin end_game2_2f6883bf:

    # "I already know though, that it has more to do with Cassius's relationship with the cat, and I don't doubt that the white wolf had compared their situation to ours so that he could better convince Amicus."
    "Tamen iam scio id magis ad necessitudinem Cassii cum fele pertinere; non dubito lupum album condicionem eorum nostrae comparavisse, quo Amico melius persuaderet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:724
translate latin end_game2_4fccff82:

    # "Even if it was incomparable."
    "Etiamsi comparari non poterant."

# game/end_game2.rpy:725
translate latin end_game2_d6458dd0:

    # "So now even Alex has something to do, a role to fill, and I'm the one that's left feeling useless and alone in the palace."
    "Itaque nunc etiam Alex aliquid faciendum habet, munus implendum; ego autem me inutilem solumque in palatio sentio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:726
translate latin end_game2_56069bd2:

    # "While I know I'll have a special position once I start my own mission, I'm supposed to keep a low profile until then."
    "Quamquam scio me singularem locum habiturum ubi munus meum incipiam, usque ad illud tempus occultus esse debeo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:727
translate latin end_game2_5e92ded5:

    # "The only job I have right now, over the course of the entire nine months, is to decide whether or not I'm going to play the role the parents want me to."
    "Solum munus quod nunc per totos novem menses habeo est decernere num partes a Parentibus optatas agam necne."

# game/end_game2.rpy:728
translate latin end_game2_cd9b72df:

    # "And while that's well and good, as it's a decision that will affect the rest of my life, I also sort of expected to be given more information over the course of my waiting period."
    "Quamquam id bonum est, cum electio reliquam vitam meam affectura sit, etiam quodam modo exspectabam me plura indicia dum exspecto accepturum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:730
translate latin end_game2_f5f1314c:

    # "But no, infinite space remains quiet, and the monitor isn't breaking in through my consciousness to give me tips on what to expect."
    "Sed non: infinitum spatium tacet, et Monitor per conscientiam meam non intrat ut consilia de rebus exspectandis det."

# game/end_game2.rpy:731
translate latin end_game2_aa469221:

    # "So I'm left pulling the endless weeds in the gardens, waiting, wondering, as unsure of my future as I've ever been..."
    "Itaque infinitas herbas in hortis evello, exspectans, miratus, tam incertus futurae vitae meae quam umquam..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:734
translate latin end_game2_a96cfcab:

    # a "\"[mc].\""
    a "\"[mc].\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:735
translate latin end_game2_72a6ea31:

    # "I crack open my eyes, seeing the large silhouette of Amicus in the dimmed lighting of the bedroom."
    "Oculos paulum aperio, magnam umbram Amici in obscurata luce cubiculi videns."

# game/end_game2.rpy:738
translate latin end_game2_0554e7f9:

    # a "\"Good morning.\""
    a "\"Bonum mane.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:739
translate latin end_game2_81d82868:

    # "I smile and reach out my hands, expecting the usual hug and kiss before he's off for the day."
    "Subrideo et manus porrigo, solitum amplexum atque osculum exspectans antequam ad diem agendum abeat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:741
translate latin end_game2_f0fdf9c2:

    # "Instead though, he sits on the bed next to me, running a paw through my hair gently, pushing it back away from my forehead."
    "Sed in lecto iuxta me sedet, manum leniter per capillos meos ducens, eos a fronte retrudens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:742
translate latin end_game2_ba4da02b:

    # a "\"Your fur is a mess.\""
    a "\"Pili tui incompti sunt.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:743
translate latin end_game2_d7b23592:

    # m "\"I mean, I did just wake up.\""
    m "\"Dico, modo experrectus sum.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:745
translate latin end_game2_ca10941c:

    # a "\"Mmmh...It's cute.\""
    a "\"Mmmh...venustum est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:746
translate latin end_game2_016389c0:

    # "Amicus continues to brush his fingers and claws through my hair."
    "Amicus digitos unguesque per capillos meos ducere pergit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:747
translate latin end_game2_36ac07c4:

    # "I watch him for a moment, a bit confused."
    "Paulisper eum specto, aliquantum confusus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:748
translate latin end_game2_702cfbe4_1:

    # m "\"You alright?\""
    m "\"Valesne?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:749
translate latin end_game2_dccb9457:

    # a "\"Very much so.\""
    a "\"Valde quidem.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:750
translate latin end_game2_658e967d:

    # "I look over at the curtains, seeing the soft light of dawn creeping around the edges."
    "Ad vela specto, lenem lucem aurorae circa margines serpentem videns."

# game/end_game2.rpy:751
translate latin end_game2_80a04599:

    # m "\"Don't you have to go to the city?\""
    m "\"Non debes ad urbem ire?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:752
translate latin end_game2_6b6ab49e:

    # a "\"Nope.\""
    a "\"Non.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:753
translate latin end_game2_9454d6dd:

    # m "\"Okay...do you have the day off? You're acting a little odd.\""
    m "\"Bene...diem liberum habes? Paulo mire agis.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:755
translate latin end_game2_a105cc88:

    # a "\"Ah, so you don't know.\""
    a "\"Ah, ergo nescis.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:756
translate latin end_game2_53ab1b83:

    # m "\"Know what?\""
    m "\"Quid sciam?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:757
translate latin end_game2_39908655:

    # "An irrational part of me begins to wonder if the nine months is already up, even though the last time I'd calculated it out, I still had four months left."
    "Pars irrationalis mei mirari incipit num novem menses iam finiti sint, quamquam novissime cum computavi, adhuc quattuor menses restabant."

# game/end_game2.rpy:759
translate latin end_game2_d5f6f593:

    # a "\"I'm honestly glad you don't. I was hoping to surprise you.\""
    a "\"Vere gaudeo te nescire. Sperabam te re inopinata delectare.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:760
translate latin end_game2_b7fcc9fd:

    # "I close my eyes in only the slightest amount of frustration."
    "Oculos claudo minimo tantum taedio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:761
translate latin end_game2_a769dc94:

    # m "\"Amicus, please just tell me. You know I don't like—\""
    m "\"Amice, quaeso tantum dic. Scis me non amare—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:762
translate latin end_game2_98186c02:

    # "I hear rustling from the wolf in front of me, and I open my eyes to the sight of a bouquet of flowers being held out to me."
    "Lupum ante me moventem audio; oculos aperio et fasciculum florum mihi porrectum video."

# game/end_game2.rpy:763
translate latin end_game2_4b06e26c:

    # "Like last time, it's dominated by lavender and its smell surrounds me, a smell that my brain has exclusively tied to my wolf."
    "Sicut antea, plerumque lavandula est; odor eius me circumdat, odor quem cerebrum meum soli lupo meo coniunxit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:764
translate latin end_game2_b6d59d09:

    # "Meanwhile, white and pink flowers along the edges compliment the purple."
    "Interea flores albi roseique per margines purpureum colorem complent."

# game/end_game2.rpy:765
translate latin end_game2_4d47254f:

    # "I stare at it in surprise, unsure of what to think or say."
    "Miratus intueor, incertus quid cogitem aut dicam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:766
translate latin end_game2_7d66fc27:

    # "Amicus fills the silence."
    "Amicus silentium implet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:768
translate latin end_game2_10be5100:

    # a "\"Happy Lover's Day, [mc].\""
    a "\"Felicem Diem Amantium, [mc].\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:769
translate latin end_game2_375dc2f3:

    # "The wolf continues to hold out the bouquet insistently, so I finally reach up and take it, noticing that it looks much nicer this time versus Amicus's first bouquet."
    "Lupus fasciculum pertinaciter porrigere pergit; tandem manus tollo et eum accipio, animadvertens hoc tempore multo pulchriorem quam primum Amici fasciculum videri."

# game/end_game2.rpy:770
translate latin end_game2_981e234c:

    # m "\"O—Oh! Thank you.\""
    m "\"O—o! Gratias.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:772
translate latin end_game2_d102f978:

    # a "\"You're welcome!\""
    a "\"Libenter!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:773
translate latin end_game2_1aec7524:

    # "I sit there holding the bouquet awkwardly for a few seconds, noticing the stems dripping slightly on the blanket, so I hold them out over the edge."
    "Aliquot secunda ibi sedeo, fasciculum inepte tenens; animadverto caules in stragulum paulum stillare, itaque eos supra marginem porrigo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:774
translate latin end_game2_ed658f2f:

    # m "\"So is this, uh, some kind of Adastran holiday?\""
    m "\"Ergo hic, eh, quidam dies festus Adastrae est?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:776
translate latin end_game2_3eb52eef:

    # a "\"Indeed! To celebrate those who you love and cherish, and for me, that is you, [mc]. I love you.\""
    a "\"Certe! Ad eos celebrandos quos amas et caros habes; mihi tu es, [mc]. Te amo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:777
translate latin end_game2_9021dd00:

    # "Though I'm still feeling a bit dazed at the unexpectedness of it all, I manage to smile."
    "Quamquam adhuc aliquantum attonitus sum omnibus tam inopinatis, subridere possum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:778
translate latin end_game2_4e869cdd:

    # m "\"You too, Amicus. Um, I kind of wish I'd known...I didn't get you anything.\""
    m "\"Ego quoque te, Amice. Ehm, quodam modo vellem me scivisse...nihil tibi paravi.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:779
translate latin end_game2_fa09bf9b:

    # "Amicus waves his paw dismissively in the air."
    "Amicus manum in aere neglegenter agitat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:781
translate latin end_game2_cf5245cb:

    # a "\"Pff, the flowers are simply a human touch that I knew you'd appreciate. Besides, this isn't a gift-giving occasion, it's a go-out-and-enjoy-yourself occasion!\""
    a "\"Pff, flores tantum mos humanus sunt quem sciebam tibi placiturum. Praeterea haec non occasio donorum dandorum est, sed exeundi seque oblectandi!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:782
translate latin end_game2_74882566:

    # "Amicus stands suddenly, reaching out his paw to me."
    "Amicus subito surgit, manum mihi porrigens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:784
translate latin end_game2_36d26951:

    # a "\"Come! I have the entire day planned out, just you and I. No Triumvirs, diplomats, or advisors to bother us.\""
    a "\"Veni! Totum diem paravi, tantum tu atque ego. Nulli Triumviri, legati aut consiliarii qui nos vexent.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:785
translate latin end_game2_182d054c:

    # "I take his paw, smiling as I realize how this has seemingly come just in time for me."
    "Manum eius capio, subridens cum intellego hoc quasi ipso tempore mihi venisse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:786
translate latin end_game2_6ad449e4:

    # "I've been feeling so lonely and bored in the palace, this is exactly what I need."
    "Tam solus atque taedio affectus in palatio fui; haec ipsa res est qua egeo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:787
translate latin end_game2_ba9a2354:

    # "I hold the flowers to my chest, smelling them, not caring anymore that they're all wet."
    "Flores pectori premo, odorem hauriens, iam non curans eos omnes umidos esse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:788
translate latin end_game2_f6059224:

    # m "\"What do you have planned?\""
    m "\"Quid paravisti?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:790
translate latin end_game2_5cbfe535:

    # a "\"Ah! That's also a surprise. I'd like to leave in the next few minutes though, so get dressed, and don't worry about showering.\""
    a "\"Ah! Id quoque inopinatum est. Sed intra pauca minuta abire velim; itaque te vesti, nec de lavando sollicitare.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:791
translate latin end_game2_6f19d038:

    # m "\"Alright.\""
    m "\"Bene.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:792
translate latin end_game2_d1bd88f0:

    # "I move toward the dresser to grab my robes, but as I'm doing so, there's a loud knock at the door."
    "Ad armarium eo ut togam capiam; sed dum facio, ianua clare pulsatur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:795
translate latin end_game2_cbb2797c:

    # "Amicus's cheery mood drops for a moment as he lets out a frustrated sigh."
    "Laetus animus Amici paulisper concidit, dum taedio suspirat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:797
translate latin end_game2_a351bc32:

    # a "\"Com, who's at my door?\""
    a "\"Computatrum, quis ad ianuam meam est?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:798
translate latin end_game2_c21a3f7e:

    # com "\"Neferu is at your bedroom door, Amicus.\""
    com "\"Neferu ad ianuam cubiculi tui est, Amice.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:799
translate latin end_game2_6ef293ca:

    # "Amicus closes his eyes for a second, then opens them again, smiling at me."
    "Amicus oculos paulisper claudit, tum rursus aperit, mihi subridens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:801
translate latin end_game2_15f2194c:

    # a "\"One moment, probably just wants to wish us a good Lover's Day...\""
    a "\"Unum momentum; probabiliter tantum felicem Diem Amantium nobis optare vult...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:803
translate latin end_game2_db256d30:

    # a "\"...or something.\""
    a "\"...aut aliquid.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:804
translate latin end_game2_ebf05380:

    # "Amicus strides over to the door while I quickly pull out a clean robe, pulling it over my body as the door opens."
    "Amicus ad ianuam magnis passibus ambulat; ego cito togam mundam extraho et corpori induo, dum ianua aperitur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:807
translate latin end_game2_79ccbab6:

    # a "\"Neferu. Did you need something?\""
    a "\"Neferu. Aliquo egebas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:809
translate latin end_game2_9dcdc9a8:

    # n "\"Hello Amicus...and Ahhotep be with you, [mc].\""
    n "\"Salve, Amice...et Ahhotep tecum sit, [mc].\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:810
translate latin end_game2_3ec08fd8:

    # "Neferu pokes his head around Amicus's bulk which the wolf is clearly trying to use to shield me from view, even though I'm already in the process of tying my robe on."
    "Neferu caput circa corpus Amici porrigit, quo lupus clare me ab aspectu tegere conatur, quamquam iam togam alligo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:811
translate latin end_game2_97495df2:

    # m "\"Ahhotep be with you.\""
    m "\"Ahhotep tecum sit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:812
translate latin end_game2_da7e5a22:

    # "I mumble back, nodding in the jackal's direction."
    "Leniter respondeo, ad chacalum annuens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:813
translate latin end_game2_a115a5c1:

    # a "\"What was it you needed?\""
    a "\"Quo egebas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:815
translate latin end_game2_adb6c019:

    # n "\"Well, {i}you{/i} are needed by the council. The Khemian ambassador and Vizier arrived an hour ago, and they requested we begin our meeting at once.\""
    n "\"Bene, consilium {i}te{/i} requirit. Legatus Khemianus et Vizirus ante horam venerunt et petiverunt ut statim conventum incipiamus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:818
translate latin end_game2_66fadc00:

    # a "\"Wha—No!\""
    a "\"Qu—non!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:820
translate latin end_game2_c0aa9175:

    # "Amicus lets out a groan of frustration, leaning his head back and tilting his muzzle toward the ceiling."
    "Amicus taedio gemit, caput reclinans et rostrum ad tectum dirigens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:822
translate latin end_game2_fa24d455:

    # n "\"Didn't Com notify you? I've been waiting in the carriage for fifteen minutes. Virginia's already there.\""
    n "\"Nonne Computatrum te certiorem fecit? Quindecim minuta in curru exspectavi. Virginia iam ibi est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:823
translate latin end_game2_cce5e850:

    # "Neferu leans sideways slightly to look at me again."
    "Neferu paulum in latus inclinat ut rursus me spectet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:825
translate latin end_game2_5728cb81:

    # n "\"Am I interrupting something?\""
    n "\"Aliquid interrumpo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:827
translate latin end_game2_03e09a9a:

    # a "\"It's Lover's Day! I cleared my schedule weeks in advance for this!\""
    a "\"Dies Amantium est! Ordinem meum ad hoc ante hebdomadas liberavi!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:829
translate latin end_game2_7ac93770:

    # n "\"Oh, is it? Hm, well, I suppose I would have no reason to know, eh?\""
    n "\"O, estne? Hm, bene, credo mihi nullam causam sciendi esse, eh?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:831
translate latin end_game2_40610a1d:

    # "Neferu winks."
    "Neferu oculo nictat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:833
translate latin end_game2_fd18d516:

    # n "\"Anyway, you know how poorly schedules match up when the stretch drive is used. Simply bad luck.\""
    n "\"Ceterum, scis quam male ordines congruant cum Propulsio Dilatatoria adhibetur. Tantum mala fortuna.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:834
translate latin end_game2_1c801bd8:

    # a "\"Bad luck, indeed.\""
    a "\"Mala fortuna quidem.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:835
translate latin end_game2_0fafde95:

    # "All the while, I feel the slight sinking sensation of disappointment."
    "Toto tempore levem animi deiectionem ex spe frustrata sentio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:836
translate latin end_game2_db2a2941:

    # "I can't really say I've been looking forward to this considering I didn't even know it was a thing, but in the couple of minutes I knew about it, I was really looking forward to it."
    "Non vere dicere possum me hoc exspectavisse, cum ne scirem quidem rem esse; sed in paucis minutis quibus scivi, vere exspectabam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:837
translate latin end_game2_0e2d1fea:

    # "Amicus turns then, gaze softening as he spots me standing in my disheveled, half-tied-on robe."
    "Tum Amicus se vertit, obtutu mollito cum me videt stantem in toga incompta tantum dimidiam partem alligata."

# game/end_game2.rpy:839
translate latin end_game2_e940ac88:

    # a "\"I, uh...\""
    a "\"Ego, eh...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:840
translate latin end_game2_50658592:

    # "I shrug in what I hope looks like a nonchalant manner."
    "Umeros tollo modo quem spero otiosum videri."

# game/end_game2.rpy:841
translate latin end_game2_c5729f35:

    # m "\"It's alright, I understand. We can do something any other time.\""
    m "\"Bene est, intellego. Quolibet alio tempore aliquid facere possumus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:842
translate latin end_game2_9e17ba4d_1:

    # a "\"[mc]...\""
    a "\"[mc]...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:843
translate latin end_game2_2ce4682e:

    # "I suppose I'm not doing a very good job of not looking just a little upset."
    "Credo me non bene facere ne paulum perturbatus videar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:844
translate latin end_game2_a582d1a4:

    # m "\"I mean, I'm happy with just this—\""
    m "\"Dico, hoc tantum mihi placet—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:845
translate latin end_game2_6ef88d1d:

    # "I pick up the bouquet of flowers I'd set on the dresser, inhaling the scent again."
    "Fasciculum florum in armario positum capio, odorem rursus hauriens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:846
translate latin end_game2_e62c0ac6:

    # m "\"The fact that you did all this in the first place means a lot to me.\""
    m "\"Quod omnia haec omnino fecisti mihi multum significat.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:847
translate latin end_game2_ac92827b:

    # "Amicus goes on frowning at me, clearly not buying it."
    "Amicus fronte contracta me spectare pergit, clare non credens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:848
translate latin end_game2_c0faedef:

    # "Then he snarls."
    "Tum fremit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:850
translate latin end_game2_f07d449b:

    # a "\"Fuck!\""
    a "\"Merda!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:851
translate latin end_game2_b7ab907c:

    # "Neferu raises a brow."
    "Neferu supercilium tollit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:853
translate latin end_game2_bd18281a:

    # n "\"Poor language for an emperor, Amicus.\""
    n "\"Verba parum decora imperatori, Amice.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:854
translate latin end_game2_30ef2bcb:

    # "Amicus ignores the jackal, keeping his eyes on me."
    "Amicus chacalum neglegit, oculos in me tenens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:856
translate latin end_game2_5823aa1f:

    # a "\"This is the only meeting I'll have all day. It shouldn't last too long, and then we'll still be able to do most of what I planned.\""
    a "\"Hic solus conventus totius diei mihi erit. Nimis diu durare non debet; deinde pleraque quae paravi adhuc facere poterimus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:857
translate latin end_game2_99a2ae02:

    # n "\"I wouldn't plan on that. This is a very important—\""
    n "\"Id non exspectarem. Hic valde gravis—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:859
translate latin end_game2_089a5cd5:

    # a "\"I know, ja—Neferu, but it won't last all day. Anyway, [mc], come with me. That way, as soon as the meeting is finished, we can immediately go to our private dinner.\""
    a "\"Scio, cha—Neferu, sed totum diem non durabit. Ceterum, [mc], mecum veni. Sic, statim ubi conventus finitus est, recta ad cenam nostram privatam ire possumus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:861
translate latin end_game2_376ce14a:

    # n "\"You're bringing [mc]? Didn't you say we should be keeping his profile low?\""
    n "\"[mc] adducis? Nonne dixisti nos cavere debere ne nimis conspicuus esset?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:863
translate latin end_game2_1bbb3109:

    # a "\"It's Lover's Day. No one will be at the university.\""
    a "\"Dies Amantium est. Nemo in universitate erit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:864
translate latin end_game2_ab563c0b:

    # "I raise my hands."
    "Manus tollo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:865
translate latin end_game2_9b3ebf15:

    # m "\"I don't want to cause any problems. I can just wait for you here—\""
    m "\"Nulla mala facere volo. Tantum hic te exspectare possum—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:867
translate latin end_game2_59e8271f:

    # a "\"You are causing no problems. You will be accompanying me to the city. As my lover you should be at my side during Lover's Day.\""
    a "\"Nulla mala facis. Me ad urbem comitaberis. Amans meus iuxta me in Die Amantium esse debes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:869
translate latin end_game2_fc2c577d:

    # a "\"Erm, if you so choose.\""
    a "\"Ehm, si ita eligis.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:870
translate latin end_game2_cb6c14a8:

    # "At this point, anything sounds better than staying in the palace, so the decision is pretty easy."
    "Iam quidlibet melius quam in palatio manere videtur; itaque electio satis facilis est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:871
translate latin end_game2_c870cb7d:

    # m "\"Alright, yeah, let's go.\""
    m "\"Bene, ita, eamus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:874
translate latin end_game2_367a2694:

    # "Amicus looks somewhat relieved, letting out a breath before reaching out to take my hand, walking us out into the hallway while Neferu follows behind."
    "Amicus aliquantum levatus videtur, spiritum emittens antequam manum meam capit, nos in ambulacrum ducens dum Neferu post sequitur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:878
translate latin end_game2_6798d7c9:

    # a "\"I promise it will be quick, and I'm sorry. Sometimes it's just hard to...\""
    a "\"Promitto cito futurum, et veniam peto. Interdum tantum difficile est...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:879
translate latin end_game2_b991b2bc:

    # "Amicus seems to struggle to find his words."
    "Amicus verba invenire aegre videtur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:880
translate latin end_game2_0d75efcc:

    # m "\"I understand. You're the emperor. Besides, it's not fair for me to be upset because my boyfriend is spending more time on his emperor duties than me.\""
    m "\"Intellego. Imperator es. Praeterea iniquum est me perturbari quod amans meus plus temporis officiis imperii quam mihi dat.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:881
translate latin end_game2_10c5b863:

    # a "\"I would understand if you were.\""
    a "\"Intellegerem si perturbareris.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:882
translate latin end_game2_f343ae12:

    # m "\"I just hope it won't be like this forever.\""
    m "\"Tantum spero non in perpetuum ita fore.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:884
translate latin end_game2_e0f7d9a4:

    # a "\"It won't be. We're simply at a turning point in Adastran history. When...When you return, and when everything settles, we will have much more time to ourselves.\""
    a "\"Non erit. Tantum in loco historiae Adastrae vertendae sumus. Cum...cum redieris, et cum omnia sedata erunt, multo plus temporis nobis erit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:885
translate latin end_game2_51e9e7c0:

    # "My stomach lurches slightly at being reminded that I have my own job to do, one that I'm not looking forward to."
    "Venter meus paulum concidit cum admoneor me quoque munus agendum habere, quod non cupio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:886
translate latin end_game2_1b63bf56:

    # "I glance back at Neferu, wondering if he should be hearing any of this, but the jackal seems to not be paying attention to anything, his expression distant as his lips move silently."
    "Ad Neferu respicio, miratus num haec audire debeat; sed chacalus nihil animadvertere videtur, vultu remoto, labris tacite motis."

# game/end_game2.rpy:887
translate latin end_game2_467a580a:

    # "It looks like he's reciting something."
    "Aliquid recitare videtur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:889
translate latin end_game2_745964ae:

    # "I look forward again, leaning against Amicus as we head outside toward the carriage."
    "Rursus ante me specto, Amico innitens dum foras ad currum imus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:893
translate latin end_game2_8b3ecb46:

    # "I already start feeling a lot better as our mechanical carriage creaks through the forest, the peaceful, eerie green calming any irritation I might have felt with the whole situation."
    "Iam multo melius sentire incipio dum currus noster mechanicus per silvam stridet, tranquillo miroque viridi colore quodlibet taedium totius rei sedante."

# game/end_game2.rpy:895
translate latin end_game2_0f526070:

    # "Amicus has me pulled against his right side, fitting me in that familiar way as I rest my head against his shoulder."
    "Amicus me lateri dextro pressum tenet, familiari modo aptans dum caput umero eius impono."

# game/end_game2.rpy:897
translate latin end_game2_b18bceea:

    # "To Amicus's left, Neferu sits with his legs crossed, an elbow on his knee and his chin in his paw."
    "Ad sinistram Amici Neferu sedet, cruribus implicatis, cubito genu imposito et mento in manu."

# game/end_game2.rpy:898
translate latin end_game2_6c39cffe:

    # "I notice Neferu and Amicus not attempting to make conversation with each other, not even glancing at one another."
    "Animadverto Neferu atque Amicum sermonem inter se non conari, ne ad alterum quidem spectantes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:899
translate latin end_game2_8a2af303:

    # "I think it's pretty clear at this point that Amicus and Neferu just don't really mesh well, their personalities too different."
    "Puto iam satis clarum esse Amicum et Neferu non vere bene congruere, ingeniis nimis diversis."

# game/end_game2.rpy:900
translate latin end_game2_e785baf0:

    # "Which I guess is fine, as long as they're not fighting anymore."
    "Quod credo bonum esse, dum iam non pugnant."

# game/end_game2.rpy:901
translate latin end_game2_c8fd0293:

    # "Neferu seems to have stopped his silent chanting, so I take the opportunity to ask him a question, leaning forward to look around Amicus's front."
    "Neferu tacitum cantum finivisse videtur; itaque occasione utor ut eum rogem, inclinans ut circa anteriorem Amici partem spectem."

# game/end_game2.rpy:902
translate latin end_game2_ed88ebf9:

    # m "\"So what's going on with this Khemian ambassador and, uh, the other thing you mentioned? If you can tell me, that is.\""
    m "\"Ergo quid accidit cum hoc legato Khemiano et, eh, altera re quam memoravisti? Si mihi dicere potes, scilicet.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:903
translate latin end_game2_5173caab:

    # "The jackal glances at me before shifting into a position that more directly faces me."
    "Chacalus ad me spectat, deinde se componit ut rectius ad me vertatur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:905
translate latin end_game2_71683cec:

    # n "\"The vizier? He's the highest official serving under the pharaoh. As for the ambassador, Adastra hasn't had a Khemian ambassador since the war.\""
    n "\"Viziro? Summus magistratus sub Pharaone est. De legato autem, Adastra legatum Khemianum ex tempore belli non habuit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:906
translate latin end_game2_9d8e02e9:

    # "Amicus grunts."
    "Amicus fremit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:908
translate latin end_game2_548e1830:

    # a "\"I'll point out that Khemia was the first to expel the ambassador.\""
    a "\"Notabo Khemiam primam legatum expulisse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:909
translate latin end_game2_ea3c8fd3:

    # "Neferu maintains a straight face."
    "Neferu vultum aequum servat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:910
translate latin end_game2_da7fb6f1:

    # n "\"And we are the first to reestablish one.\""
    n "\"Et nos primi eum restituimus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:912
translate latin end_game2_e4621826:

    # a "\"As it should go.\""
    a "\"Sicut fieri debet.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:913
translate latin end_game2_b30ff7c3:

    # m "\"Well that's good.\""
    m "\"Bene, id bonum est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:914
translate latin end_game2_89537544:

    # "I talk a little louder than usual, trying to stop an argument before it can happen."
    "Paulo clarius quam soleo loquor, rixam antequam oriatur prohibere conatus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:915
translate latin end_game2_7183e978:

    # m "\"So are they going to help establish an alliance?\""
    m "\"Ergo ad foedus constituendum adiuvabunt?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:916
translate latin end_game2_12c61f42:

    # a "\"Yes, along with smoothing over Adastra-Khemia relations in general. The ambassador will be here for the long-term. The vizier—\""
    a "\"Ita, una cum necessitudinibus Adastrae et Khemiae in universum componendis. Legatus hic diu manebit. Vizirus—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:917
translate latin end_game2_32fc55b4:

    # "Amicus glances at Neferu, but the jackal simply leans back, looking out at the forest again."
    "Amicus ad Neferu spectat, sed chacalus tantum recumbit, rursus silvam spectans."

# game/end_game2.rpy:918
translate latin end_game2_fa7dfc31:

    # n "\"—the vizier will depart back to Khemia within a week, which is why negations must begin at once.\""
    n "\"—Vizirus intra hebdomadam ad Khemiam redibit, quam ob rem colloquia statim incipere debent.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:919
translate latin end_game2_6b58867d:

    # m "\"And you said this is taking place at a university?\""
    m "\"Et dixisti haec in universitate fieri?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:920
translate latin end_game2_460acdcd:

    # a "\"Yes, there are a few Khemia experts there...and I suppose Khemians find places of learning more comfortable to negotiate in.\""
    a "\"Ita, aliquot periti Khemiae ibi sunt...et credo Khemianis loca discendi commodiora ad tractandum videri.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:921
translate latin end_game2_ce57594b:

    # "Amicus glances at Neferu for confirmation."
    "Amicus ad Neferu spectat ut ille confirmet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:923
translate latin end_game2_e050513a:

    # n "\"I believe it has more to do with Adastran academia being a more friendly entity compared to the political departments, or palace.\""
    n "\"Credo magis ex eo fieri quod academia Adastrae amicior quam officia politica aut palatium est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:924
translate latin end_game2_84d141c7:

    # "Amicus smirks."
    "Amicus callide subridet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:926
translate latin end_game2_1c48b7e6:

    # a "\"Indeed, the last bastion of Khemaphiles.\""
    a "\"Certe, ultimum praesidium Khemiam amantium.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:927
translate latin end_game2_b492a58c:

    # "Neferu rolls his eyes before they settle on me again."
    "Neferu oculos volvit antequam rursus in me consistunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:929
translate latin end_game2_2deca85b:

    # n "\"Oh, and remember our conversation about the Other? This university is famous for supposedly being absolutely infested.\""
    n "\"O, et meministi sermonem nostrum de Altero? Haec universitas nota est quod eo penitus infesta esse dicitur.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:930
translate latin end_game2_09722dcb:

    # "I raise an eyebrow."
    "Supercilium tollo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:931
translate latin end_game2_b4ec0074:

    # m "\"So it's haunted?\""
    m "\"Ergo umbris habitatur?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:932
translate latin end_game2_e0a11c00:

    # "Amicus frowns."
    "Amicus frontem corrugat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:934
translate latin end_game2_0eaa559a:

    # a "\"Are you serious? Have you been filling his head with the ghost stories of students, Neferu?\""
    a "\"Serio dicis? Caput eius fabulis umbrarum discipulorum implevisti, Neferu?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:935
translate latin end_game2_fcd949e3:

    # n "\"I have.\""
    n "\"Implevi.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:936
translate latin end_game2_8801b4a2:

    # m "\"Don't worry, I don't really believe it.\""
    m "\"Noli sollicitari; non vere credo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:937
translate latin end_game2_78acc33b:

    # "I lean back against Amicus, deciding that we can't really have a conversation without the two canines butting heads."
    "Rursus Amico innitor, statuens nos sermonem sine duobus caninis inter se pugnantibus habere non posse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:939
translate latin end_game2_d7d52ab7:

    # "The university is in a secluded area outside the city, mostly surrounded by forest."
    "Universitas in loco remoto extra urbem est, plerumque silva circumdata."

# game/end_game2.rpy:940
translate latin end_game2_1937c683:

    # "The gardens and paths are well taken care of, and it reminds me of a more classical-looking version of the palace."
    "Horti atque semitae bene curantur, et quasi palatium forma magis classica mihi in mentem revocant."

# game/end_game2.rpy:941
translate latin end_game2_8abb33be:

    # "Amicus was right; I don't see a single person on the campus."
    "Amicus recte dixit: neminem in campo video."

# game/end_game2.rpy:942
translate latin end_game2_f2909c56:

    # "Our carriage rides up the main path to the largest-looking building that's front and center."
    "Currus noster per praecipuam semitam ad maximum aedificium ante nos in medio vehitur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:943
translate latin end_game2_717256f9:

    # "We park in front of the building next to a few small aircraft before getting out and heading inside."
    "Ante aedificium iuxta paucas parvas naves aereas consistimus, deinde egredimur atque intro imus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:945
translate latin end_game2_e2a8490e:

    # "For a moment, I'm in awe at the size and architecture surrounding me, especially the amount of sculptures spread throughout the halls."
    "Paulisper magnitudinem et architecturam circa me admiror, maxime multitudinem statuarum per ambulacra sparsarum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:946
translate latin end_game2_8023371f:

    # "Amicus immediately begins talking to me though."
    "Sed Amicus statim mecum loqui incipit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:948
translate latin end_game2_5a6489e0:

    # a "\"Go ahead and make yourself comfortable. There should be screens in most of the rooms, and down those stairs, you can find games of amusement—\""
    a "\"Age, commode requiesce. Tabulae imaginum in plerisque cubiculis esse debent; infra illos gradus ludos oblectamenti invenire potes—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:949
translate latin end_game2_aae04b86:

    # v "\"Amicus!\""
    v "\"Amice!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:952
translate latin end_game2_cb547aeb:

    # "Amicus jerks his head away from me, looking up as Virginia's familiar voice in a very familiar tone echoes around the marble hallways."
    "Amicus caput a me avertit et suspicit, dum familiaris vox Virginiae familiarissimo sono per ambulacra marmorea resonat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:954
translate latin end_game2_90196a65:

    # a "\"Gods...\""
    a "\"Dei...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:955
translate latin end_game2_2b60bb93:

    # "Amicus mumbles under his breath as Virginia, her face a mask of fury, approaches."
    "Amicus sub voce murmurat dum Virginia, vultu irae pleno, accedit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:956
translate latin end_game2_e69800dd:

    # "She spares me a glance for a single second before focusing back on Amicus."
    "Unum tantum momentum ad me spectat, deinde rursus Amico animum adhibet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:958
translate latin end_game2_ef8e17d2:

    # v "\"You are an hour late.\""
    v "\"Una hora serus es.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:959
translate latin end_game2_f22e0ee5:

    # a "\"Am I?\""
    a "\"Sumne?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:960
translate latin end_game2_a1e7e69f:

    # v "\"Yes! I've tolerated your tardiness since, well, since you were a child, but you've kept the {i}vizier{/i} waiting...{i}how could you!{/i}\""
    v "\"Ita! Moras tuas toleravi ex quo, bene, ex quo puer eras; sed {i}Vizirum{/i} exspectare fecisti...{i}quomodo potuisti!{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:961
translate latin end_game2_095eed4a:

    # "The wolf whisper-screams through her teeth, eyes practically bulging from her head."
    "Lupa per dentes quasi susurrans clamat, oculis paene e capite prominentibus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:962
translate latin end_game2_b247db10:

    # "I've never seen Virginia so angry before."
    "Virginiam tam iratam numquam antea vidi."

# game/end_game2.rpy:963
translate latin end_game2_c74e5986:

    # "Amicus shifts uncomfortably."
    "Amicus incommode se movet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:964
translate latin end_game2_ed260570:

    # a "\"Well, it's a holiday, so I disabled notifications—\""
    a "\"Bene, dies festus est, itaque nuntiationes intermisi—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:965
translate latin end_game2_6046a2d0:

    # v "\"Are you {i}joking{/i}? Emperors do not get holidays. EVER.\""
    v "\"{i}Iocaris{/i}? Imperatores dies festos liberos non habent. NUMQUAM.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:967
translate latin end_game2_f6f98990:

    # a "\"Well, consider it strategic.\""
    a "\"Bene, callido consilio factum puta.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:969
translate latin end_game2_37fb03a1:

    # v "\"What?\""
    v "\"Quid?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:971
translate latin end_game2_ae02419c:

    # a "\"I am simply letting him know who holds the power here. It will be an advantageous start to our negotiations.\""
    a "\"Tantum ei ostendo quis potestatem hic habeat. Commodum initium colloquiorum nostrorum erit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:972
translate latin end_game2_f75d4eea:

    # "Virginia looks at her brother with borderline disgust."
    "Virginia fratrem paene fastidio spectat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:973
translate latin end_game2_5af08f3a:

    # v "\"Well, at least you can make even the most extreme stupidity sound....not quite so stupid. I hope you're not planning on bringing your mate in?\""
    v "\"Bene, saltem efficere potes ut etiam extrema stultitia...non tam stulta sonet. Spero te amantem tuum intro adducere non cogitare?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:975
translate latin end_game2_d3259ce5:

    # "For a moment I don't realize that she's referring to me."
    "Paulisper non intellego eam me significare."

# game/end_game2.rpy:977
translate latin end_game2_8d74b9ce:

    # a "\"Of course not. He's waiting out here.\""
    a "\"Certe non. Hic foris exspectat.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:978
translate latin end_game2_76bd8262:

    # "Virginia looks at me again."
    "Virginia rursus ad me spectat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:980
translate latin end_game2_867d2111:

    # v "\"My apologies. I hope my brother learns to treat you with more respect in the future. If not, then I'm sure you'll have no trouble finding someone better.\""
    v "\"Veniam peto. Spero fratrem meum posthac te reverentius tractare discere. Si non, certe non difficile erit tibi aliquem meliorem invenire.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:982
translate latin end_game2_2e20aa42:

    # a "\"Wha—If you're so worried about wasting time, why are we doing just that?\""
    a "\"Qu—si tam sollicita es de tempore terendo, cur ipsum facimus?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:985
translate latin end_game2_d681505c:

    # v "\"Teacher Veteris is entertaining them on a tour. You'd better think of a good excuse before they return...actually, just pretend it didn't happen.\""
    v "\"Magister Veteris eos circumeundo delectat. Melius est bonam causam excogitare antequam redeant...immo tantum simula rem non accidisse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:987
translate latin end_game2_ffb95151:

    # a "\"Oh? That sounds like something you wouldn't want me to do.\""
    a "\"O? Hoc simile ei sonat quod me facere nolles.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:989
translate latin end_game2_c54a6d08:

    # v "\"Khemians are different. I suggest you not try to trick them. Let's go in for now, I think I hear them.\""
    v "\"Khemiani diversi sunt. Moneo ne eos fallere coneris. Nunc intro eamus; credo me eos audire.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:990
translate latin end_game2_d893a456:

    # "Sure enough, I hear echoing voices up the hallways."
    "Certe voces resonantes longius in ambulacris audio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:994
translate latin end_game2_50b7999e:

    # "Amicus turns to me, giving me a quick hug, again reassuring me that he won't be long before following Virginia up the hall and disappearing behind a sliding door."
    "Amicus ad me se vertit et breviter amplectitur, rursus promittens se non diu afuturum, antequam Virginiam per ambulacrum sequitur atque post ianuam labentem evanescit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:995
translate latin end_game2_6947fead:

    # "Neferu, who I had completely forgotten about, walks past me, heading for the room as well."
    "Neferu, cuius omnino oblitus eram, praeter me ambulat, cubiculum quoque petens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:996
translate latin end_game2_d82f6709:

    # "I frown, noting the dull look on his face, the one he'd been wearing since the carriage ride."
    "Vultum contraho, animadvertens hebetem eius vultum quem ex itinere in curru gesserat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:997
translate latin end_game2_702cfbe4_2:

    # m "\"You alright?\""
    m "\"Valesne?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:998
translate latin end_game2_9a956c45:

    # "I ask him just as he passes me."
    "Eum rogo dum praeter me transit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:999
translate latin end_game2_ca970397:

    # "He glances toward me."
    "Ad me spectat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1001
translate latin end_game2_589a1f8c:

    # n "\"Of course.\""
    n "\"Certe.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1002
translate latin end_game2_86f2fd8e:

    # "He doesn't even make an effort to make it look like that's the case before walking through the door as well."
    "Ne conatur quidem facere ut ita videatur, antequam ipse quoque per ianuam ambulat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1004
translate latin end_game2_e80df5ff:

    # "The voices get closer, coming from a bend in the hallway up ahead."
    "Voces propius veniunt, ex flexu ambulacri ante nos."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1005
translate latin end_game2_9fe3bc6d:

    # "Not really wanting to be seen, I move back toward the sculptures, hiding myself amongst them."
    "Non vere cupiens videri, retro ad statuas eo, inter eas me occultans."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1006
translate latin end_game2_b016ef3a:

    # "Technically all of Adastra City knows who I am, my face having been shown on the giant screens in the city, on loop, for months."
    "Revera tota Urbs Adastra scit quis sim, facie mea per menses iterum iterumque in magnis urbis tabulis ostensa."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1007
translate latin end_game2_0130da93:

    # "Still, I'm odd enough that I feel like it would just cause more trouble than it would be worth if I'm seen."
    "Tamen satis mirus sum ut putem me visum plus molestiae quam commodi facturum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1008
translate latin end_game2_f850826d:

    # "So I peer around a statue wolf's waist, feeling like a stalker as I watch the small crowd approaching the door that Amicus, Virginia, and Neferu walked through."
    "Itaque circa lumbos statuae lupi specto, quasi insidiator, dum parvam turbam ad ianuam quam Amicus, Virginia atque Neferu intraverunt accedentem observo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1009
translate latin end_game2_41c13eb1:

    # "A very short, old wolf leads the way, followed by only the second jackal I've ever seen in person."
    "Lupus brevissimus et senex ducit, secundo tantum chacalo quem umquam ipse vidi sequente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1010
translate latin end_game2_4ad6f3e4:

    # "He's taller and thinner than Neferu, and there's an icy-cold expression on his face."
    "Altior graciliorque quam Neferu est, vultu gelido frigidoque."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1011
translate latin end_game2_9bb7a261:

    # "I imagine him to be the vizier, and next to him walks a rather broad-shouldered creature that vaguely looks like a wolverine."
    "Eum Vizirum esse fingo; iuxta eum creatura satis latis umeris ambulat, vage guloni similis."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1012
translate latin end_game2_fbc109f9:

    # "His clothing and the paint on his fur is definitely Khemian, so I assume him to be the ambassador."
    "Vestimenta atque pigmentum in pilis eius certe Khemiana sunt, itaque eum legatum esse puto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1013
translate latin end_game2_fbf094d4:

    # "Finally, a younger wolf brings up the rear, one that has longer fur on his neck which he he's styled into a braid."
    "Tandem iunior lupus postremus venit, longioribus pilis in cervice quos in plectam composuit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1014
translate latin end_game2_8d29d7e0:

    # "I'd heard about wolves with manes at some point in my studies, a trait that had been cultivated amongst Adastra's more influential families, a status symbol of the elite."
    "De Lupis iubatis aliquando in studiis meis audiveram, nota inter familias graviores Adastrae culta, insigni optimatium."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1015
translate latin end_game2_4c35db63:

    # "The braided wolf starts to look in my direction, and that's when I pull back quickly, hiding myself behind the marble and waiting until I hear the door slide shut again."
    "Lupus plectam gerens versus me spectare incipit; tum cito recedo, post marmora me occultans et exspectans donec ianuam rursus claudi audio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1016
translate latin end_game2_5593e621:

    # "I'm left alone, standing amongst the quiet, spotless marble of the expansive university."
    "Solus relinquor, inter quietum atque purissimum marmor magnae universitatis stans."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1017
translate latin end_game2_eb7fe493:

    # "At first, I sit on a bench, quietly taking in the architecture, thinking about how cool it would be if I could come here to study instead."
    "Primum in scamno sedeo, architecturam tacite contemplans, cogitans quam gratum esset si potius huc studendi causa venire possem."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1018
translate latin end_game2_f4fa9e94:

    # "Though, now I know that this is the most prestigious university in Adastra, having seen the giant name carved into the face of the building on the way in."
    "Sed iam scio hanc universitatem clarissimam Adastrae esse, magno nomine in fronte aedificii inscripto dum intrabam viso."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1019
translate latin end_game2_a189263a:

    # "Varro's University."
    "Universitas Varronis."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1020
translate latin end_game2_adb20125:

    # "Or just Varro."
    "Aut tantum Varro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1021
translate latin end_game2_888b6e2a:

    # "Only the smartest young wolves study here along with wolves from the richest families in Adastra."
    "Tantum sapientissimi iuvenes Lupi hic student, una cum Lupis e familiis ditissimis Adastrae."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1022
translate latin end_game2_224926fc:

    # "However, from the handful of times that it came up in Com's ramblings, it sounded like it was one of the most progressive places on the moon."
    "Tamen ex paucis vicibus quibus in sermonibus Computatri memorata est, quasi unus ex locis lunae maxime novis rebus faventibus sonabat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1023
translate latin end_game2_4d594602:

    # "It was one of the first elite universities to allow women to study inside the school, rather than having to sit in a separate, cheaper building on the outskirts of campus."
    "Una ex primis universitatibus optimatium erat quae mulieres intra scholam studere permisit, pro eo quod in separato vilioreque aedificio in extremis campi sedere deberent."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1024
translate latin end_game2_c51fea56:

    # "That was just fifty years ago, finally allowed under the rule of Amicus's father."
    "Id ante quinquaginta tantum annos fuit, tandem sub imperio patris Amici permissum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1025
translate latin end_game2_c91b88fc:

    # "Eventually, I grow bored with just sitting there and start to walk around, looking at the sculptures and plaques."
    "Tandem ibi tantum sedere me taedet, et circum ambulare incipio, statuas tabulasque spectans."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1026
translate latin end_game2_7bccdc9e:

    # "They give short descriptions of the various wolves the sculptures depict, and I try to piece together what I can with my limited written Language knowledge."
    "Breves descriptiones variorum Luporum quos statuae ostendunt dant; conor quidquid possum ex parva scientia Sermonis scripti colligere."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1027
translate latin end_game2_b08e75a1:

    # "Notable is the one in the middle, Varro, the university's namesake."
    "Praecipua est illa in medio, Varro, a quo universitas nomen habet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1028
translate latin end_game2_90fc5a55:

    # "He apparently studied the education system on Omorfa before implementing that system on Adastra."
    "Ut videtur, rationi educationis in Omorfa studuit antequam eam in Adastra instituit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1029
translate latin end_game2_613a9ea1:

    # "This alone shows how different this university is from the rest of Adastra."
    "Hoc solum ostendit quam diversa haec universitas a reliqua Adastra sit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1030
translate latin end_game2_88924269:

    # "The wolves, especially the politicians, would {i}never{/i} admit to borrowing anything from the cats, even though they borrowed plenty."
    "Lupi, maxime qui res politicas agunt, {i}numquam{/i} faterentur se quidquam a Felibus mutuatos esse, quamquam multa mutuati sunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1031
translate latin end_game2_63d5fb6c:

    # "But...even here, there are only sculptures of wolves."
    "Sed...etiam hic tantum statuae Luporum sunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1032
translate latin end_game2_ddf208bb:

    # "No siblings, no children, nothing."
    "Nulli Fratres, nulli Liberi, nihil."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1033
translate latin end_game2_fef5d58c:

    # "It reminds me of one of the biggest issues I've been wrestling with the past few months...how separate I feel from this society."
    "Hoc unam ex maximis rebus quibus superioribus mensibus luctatus sum mihi in mentem revocat...quam separatus ab hac societate me sentiam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1034
translate latin end_game2_8001c494:

    # "It's to be expected."
    "Exspectandum est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1035
translate latin end_game2_f2f72512:

    # "I'm on an alien world after all."
    "Tamen in mundo alieno sum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1036
translate latin end_game2_1ecbed71:

    # "But it's a world of many different creatures and cultures, yet the wolves seem to be doing their best to ignore that."
    "Sed mundus est multarum diversarum creaturarum atque cultuum; tamen Lupi omnibus viribus id neglegere videntur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1037
translate latin end_game2_0652606e:

    # "I realize that I will never be part of this society, even if humans are successfully integrated into the {i}Galaxias{/i}."
    "Intellego me numquam partem huius societatis futurum, etiamsi homines feliciter in {i}Galaxias{/i} inseruntur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1038
translate latin end_game2_7048201d:

    # "In fact, I already know what the wolven reaction to human society will be:"
    "Revera iam scio qualis reactio Luporum ad societatem humanam futura sit:"

# game/end_game2.rpy:1039
translate latin end_game2_a5d53513:

    # "Suspicion, condescension, and overall jealousy at the idea of a race that seemingly uplifted itself, a species assigned a role that's different than all the rest."
    "Suspicio, contemptus atque in universum invidia cogitationis gentis quae se ipsam ad altiorem cultum evexisse videtur, speciei cui munus diversum ab omnibus aliis assignatum est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1040
translate latin end_game2_66df781f:

    # "It doesn't matter that I'm liked by them now."
    "Nihil refert me nunc eis placere."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1041
translate latin end_game2_959d393f:

    # "It's only because I'm a seemingly dumb, parent-less, ape."
    "Tantum quia stulta simia sine Parente videor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1042
translate latin end_game2_109a5622:

    # "They will come to despise me just as they despise the Khemians."
    "Me contemnere incipient sicut Khemianos contemnunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1043
translate latin end_game2_6c2c7cda:

    # "Is it worth it to deal with all that, only to be with Amicus?"
    "Operae pretium est omnia illa ferre, tantum ut cum Amico sim?"

# game/end_game2.rpy:1044
translate latin end_game2_86f5af5d:

    # "I know the answer, but I still contemplate."
    "Responsum scio, sed adhuc delibero."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1045
translate latin end_game2_fa81bc1d:

    # "As my thought process spirals, I even think for a moment that maybe Alex had the right idea...but no, thoughts like that always bring me back down."
    "Dum cogitationes meae volvuntur, paulisper etiam puto fortasse Alex rectum consilium habuisse...sed non, tales cogitationes semper me revocant."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1046
translate latin end_game2_e0155605:

    # "It reminds me that humans, wolves, and all the rest of the {i}Galaxias{/i} aren't so different in the end."
    "Me admonent homines, Lupos atque omnes alios {i}Galaxias{/i} tandem non tam diversos esse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1047
translate latin end_game2_8dec85f6:

    # "Which means I have to hope that the parents {i}are{/i} different, because I don't think I can trust gods that act like I do."
    "Id significat me sperare debere Parentes diversos {i}esse{/i}, quia non puto me dis confidere posse qui sicut ego agant."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1048
translate latin end_game2_6ae01a40:

    # "I try to distract myself, walking around the big marble halls, looking into different rooms, and reading any inscriptions I can find."
    "Animum avertere conor, per magna ambulacra marmorea ambulans, varia cubicula inspiciens atque quaslibet inscriptiones quas invenio legens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1049
translate latin end_game2_63e323a7:

    # "The \"game room\" in the basement is just a series of tables with various board games that I've never learned to play."
    "\"Cubiculum ludorum\" infra solum tantum series mensarum est cum variis ludis tabularum quos numquam ludere didici."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1050
translate latin end_game2_edf254cc:

    # "After a while, it becomes clear that this isn't going to be a quick meeting."
    "Aliquanto post clarum fit hunc conventum celerem non fore."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1052
translate latin end_game2_ec23975d:

    # "The hours go by slowly, and while I would usually be pretty ticked off at Amicus at this point, I'm mostly just sad."
    "Horae lente transeunt; quamquam plerumque iam Amico satis iratus essem, nunc maxime tristis sum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1053
translate latin end_game2_c70714e2:

    # "Being alone amongst towering, marble pillars isn't so different from the palace, and still, this is actually a nice change of pace."
    "Solum inter altas columnas marmoreas esse non tam diversum a palatio est; tamen haec vere grata mutatio est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1054
translate latin end_game2_9de5a081:

    # "I just wish I could be spending more time with Amicus."
    "Tantum vellem me plus temporis cum Amico agere posse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1055
translate latin end_game2_9988bc7b:

    # "Eventually, I find a bunch of folded red cloth piled on a table, looking like banners for what could be the school flag, or colors, or something."
    "Tandem multum pannum rubrum complicatum in mensa congestum invenio, quasi vexilla quae insignia aut colores scholae esse possint, vel aliquid."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1056
translate latin end_game2_37bcbe6d:

    # "I grab a couple of these before scouting out a marble bench hidden in the corner of the main room, behind the statues and out of sight of the door."
    "Duo capio, deinde scamnum marmoreum in angulo cubiculi praecipui occultum quaero, post statuas atque extra aspectum ianuae."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1057
translate latin end_game2_12c40c9f:

    # "I lie down on the bench, flat on my back, laying the cloth under my head."
    "In scamno recumbo, supinus, pannum sub capite ponens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1058
translate latin end_game2_9cdbfa8d:

    # "I'm tired after being woken up so much earlier than I'm used to, and it's not long before I'm drifting off to sleep..."
    "Defatigatus sum quia multo maturius quam soleo excitatus sum; mox somno cedere incipio..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1062
translate latin end_game2_dd7fa190:

    # "Space stretches and twists into the distance, the infinite dark blue broken here and there with planets, stars, and dust clouds."
    "Spatium in longinquum extenditur et torquetur, infinito caeruleo obscuro hic illic planetis, stellis nubibusque pulveris interrupto."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1063
translate latin end_game2_f296672d:

    # "It's endless, monolithic, passionless..."
    "Infinitum est, immensum, sine affectu..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1064
translate latin end_game2_1bff11b5:

    # "Except there."
    "Nisi ibi."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1065
translate latin end_game2_8b7829bb:

    # "Its mark is clear on the universe, like a stain, a blemish on the glittering patchwork of stars."
    "Nota eius clara in universo est, velut macula, vitium in fulgenti opere stellarum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1066
translate latin end_game2_d8c6c497:

    # "The planets die, the stars shrivel, the dust scatters."
    "Planetae moriuntur, stellae contrahuntur, pulvis dispergitur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1067
translate latin end_game2_277592d0:

    # "It's all tainted."
    "Omne corruptum est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1068
translate latin end_game2_61ff649b:

    # "The mark is old."
    "Nota vetus est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1069
translate latin end_game2_8bf4761b:

    # "It's ancient."
    "Antiqua est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1070
translate latin end_game2_5c1b5cc5:

    # "It existed before life."
    "Ante vitam exstitit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1071
translate latin end_game2_9c83a385:

    # "{i}Our{/i} life."
    "Vitam {i}nostram{/i}."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1072
translate latin end_game2_e3a6d777:

    # "It touches every life form from the youngest child to the oldest sibling."
    "Omnem formam vitae tangit, a minimo Libero ad veterrimum Fratrem."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1073
translate latin end_game2_b49f6069:

    # "It convulses before your eyes in the dark."
    "Coram oculis tuis in tenebris convellitur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1074
translate latin end_game2_b3af052a:

    # "It whispers in your ear while you sleep."
    "Ad aurem tuam susurrat dum dormis."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1075
translate latin end_game2_0168ccc8:

    # "It brushes your neck when you don't see."
    "Cervicem tuam tangit cum non vides."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1076
translate latin end_game2_f872b3f0:

    # "We all feel it."
    "Omnes sentimus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1077
translate latin end_game2_cf68f8c1:

    # "We all know it."
    "Omnes novimus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1078
translate latin end_game2_d7a27e2c:

    # "It transcends all, it touches all, it {i}becomes{/i} all."
    "Omnia transcendit, omnia tangit, in omnia {i}vertitur{/i}."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1079
translate latin end_game2_f43fd1f4:

    # "\"{cps=22}{i}I see you...{/i}\""
    "\"{cps=22}{i}Te video...{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1080
translate latin end_game2_f6a4dda9:

    # "The black tendrils of its reach already infect everything around you."
    "Nigri cirri eius iam omnia circa te inficiunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1081
translate latin end_game2_95cf7678:

    # "\"{cps=22}{i}They're going to kill you...They're going to kill him...Your purpose is doomed...{/i}\""
    "\"{cps=22}{i}Te interficient...Eum interficient...Munus tuum periturum est...{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1082
translate latin end_game2_71246463:

    # "And yet, you know that this is only the beginning, that soon it will blanket everything."
    "Tamen scis hoc tantum initium esse, mox illud omnia operturum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1083
translate latin end_game2_4cab159b:

    # "\"{cps=22}{i}You will die...He will die...Trapped in the amalgamation forever...apart...{/i}\""
    "\"{cps=22}{i}Morieris...Morietur...In mixtura in perpetuum inclusi...separati...{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1084
translate latin end_game2_03b7467d:

    # "And that's when it won't hide in the dark anymore..."
    "Tum iam in tenebris non latebit..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1087
translate latin end_game2_b641b5fd:

    # "I gasp loudly, sitting up on the bench, feeling like something had been sitting on my chest."
    "Clare spiritum duco, in scamno sedens, quasi aliquid in pectore meo sedisset."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1088
translate latin end_game2_16e18701:

    # "I feel like I've been holding my breath...or something had pushed it out."
    "Sentio me spiritum tenuisse...aut aliquid eum expressisse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1089
translate latin end_game2_2a3fcf2b:

    # "\"{cps=22}{i}..die...{/i}\""
    "\"{cps=22}{i}..mori...{/i}\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1090
translate latin end_game2_c068a429:

    # "A faint whisper to my left, and when I look, just for the briefest of moments, it seems as if the crouched wolf statue is contorted."
    "Lenis susurrus ad sinistram; cum specto, brevissimo tantum momento statua lupi genibus flexis contorta videtur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1091
translate latin end_game2_ac203bb0:

    # "Its neck is broken, staring straight back at me."
    "Cervix eius fracta est, et statua recta ad me vicissim spectat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1092
translate latin end_game2_ea37f14f:

    # "I jump, leaning back as I stare at the grotesquely twisted wolf, but it's not twisted, it's like it always was..."
    "Subsilio et recedo, lupum horrende contortum intuens; sed contortus non est: talis est qualis semper erat..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1094
translate latin end_game2_faf6cd3f:

    # "And then I'm falling off the bench, landing hard on my ass and sending a jolt of pain through my tail bone."
    "Tum e scamno cado, in nates dure incidens, impetum doloris per os coccygis mittens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1097
translate latin end_game2_99f2c6f1:

    # "I can't help the involuntary yelp that comes out of my mouth."
    "Involuntariam exclamationem ex ore prohibere non possum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1098
translate latin end_game2_804cd142_1:

    # a "\"[mc]?\""
    a "\"[mc]?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1099
translate latin end_game2_b3d55b08:

    # "Amicus's voice echoes through halls, making me scramble to my feet, suddenly embarrassed about what had just happened."
    "Vox Amici per ambulacra resonat, me cito in pedes surgere faciens, subito pudore rei modo gestae affectum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1100
translate latin end_game2_220eb1e7:

    # "I clear my throat in a way that sounds casual."
    "Guttur purgo modo qui otiosus sonat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1101
translate latin end_game2_c5f7a6a9:

    # m "\"I'm over here.\""
    m "\"Hic sum.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1102
translate latin end_game2_f45fb9c1:

    # "I move out from behind the statues, glancing one last time at the crouched wolf, neck in its proper position."
    "Ex occulto loco post statuas procedo, ultimo ad lupum genibus flexis spectans, cervice in recto situ."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1103
translate latin end_game2_867d38f9:

    # "{i}It whispers in your ear while you sleep...{/i}"
    "{i}Ad aurem tuam susurrat dum dormis...{/i}"

# game/end_game2.rpy:1104
translate latin end_game2_437280fc:

    # "When my back is to it, the nape of my neck prickles, and I hurry out from my hiding spot."
    "Cum tergum meum ei verso, cervix pungitur; cito ex occulto loco exeo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1105
translate latin end_game2_3ac44e5b:

    # "As I move out into the brightly lit main room, I realize that it's already dark."
    "Dum in clare illuminatum cubiculum praecipuum procedo, intellego iam tenebras esse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1106
translate latin end_game2_14e56174:

    # "I've been here all day."
    "Totum diem hic fui."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1107
translate latin end_game2_d086ee83:

    # a "\"Where?\""
    a "\"Ubi?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1108
translate latin end_game2_15639431:

    # "Amicus's voice seems to come from further away, up the hall."
    "Vox Amici longius abesse videtur, in ambulacro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1109
translate latin end_game2_ddda9d21:

    # m "\"Here!\""
    m "\"Hic!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1110
translate latin end_game2_a6babd6e:

    # "I just want him to come get me."
    "Tantum volo eum venire ut me capiat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1111
translate latin end_game2_99f92f03:

    # "I had a nightmare, or something, but it had felt so cold, dark...and real."
    "Somnium horrendum habui, vel aliquid; sed tam frigidum, obscurum...et verum sentiebatur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1112
translate latin end_game2_aa072113:

    # "I hear some footsteps padding up the hall, and I turn to see Amicus come around the corner, his paws clasped together."
    "Vestigia per ambulacrum venientia audio; me verto et Amicum circa angulum venientem video, manibus coniunctis."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1115
translate latin end_game2_acb86774:

    # a "\"[mc]? I am so, so, so sorry. They wouldn't agree on anything, and I couldn't excuse myself to come see you because that would make it look as if I—\""
    a "\"[mc]? Maxime, maxime, maxime veniam peto. De nulla re consentiebant; nec excusare me poteram ut te viderem, quia id me quasi—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1117
translate latin end_game2_4eebb6b7:

    # "I cut Amicus off by hugging him, just wanting to feel his presence for now."
    "Verba Amici interrumpo eum amplectens, tantum praesentiam eius nunc sentire cupiens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1118
translate latin end_game2_15fe9223:

    # "The depressing thoughts I'd had all day, on top of that awful nightmare...at least what I hope was a nightmare, has left me feeling like complete shit."
    "Tristes cogitationes per totum diem habitae, praeter horrendum illud somnium...saltem quod somnium spero fuisse, me miserrimum fecerunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1119
translate latin end_game2_012c0fd7:

    # a "\"Are you alright?\""
    a "\"Bene vales?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1120
translate latin end_game2_fe09af0d:

    # "I'm quiet for a moment, wondering if I should tell Amicus anything about what I was thinking, what I saw...then decide against it, at least for now."
    "Paulisper taceo, deliberans num quidquam Amico de cogitationibus meis, de visis narrem...tum statuo non, saltem nunc."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1121
translate latin end_game2_ecc028a1:

    # m "\"I'm just happy to see you.\""
    m "\"Tantum gaudeo te videre.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1123
translate latin end_game2_caa0de5c:

    # a "\"Really? Even after suffering through my complete incompetence all day long?\""
    a "\"Vere? Etiam postquam totum diem penitus ineptum me passus es?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1124
translate latin end_game2_6763a3dd:

    # "I'm about to scold Amicus for saying that about himself, but then I just end up nodding."
    "Iam Amicum obiurgaturus sum quod sic de se dicat; sed tandem tantum annuo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1125
translate latin end_game2_62565fa2:

    # m "\"Yeah...We all have days like that. Did everyone leave?\""
    m "\"Ita...omnibus tales dies sunt. Omnes abierunt?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1126
translate latin end_game2_79b4bae6:

    # a "\"Yes, the meeting concluded about ten minutes ago. I had worried you'd left the university for whatever reason.\""
    a "\"Ita, conventus ante decem fere minuta finitus est. Timebam te aliqua de causa ex universitate abiisse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1127
translate latin end_game2_96c48d19:

    # m "\"Sorry.\""
    m "\"Ignosce.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1129
translate latin end_game2_aeb0979f:

    # a "\"Don't be. Were you sleeping?\""
    a "\"Noli veniam petere. Dormiebas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1130
translate latin end_game2_c806ebc0:

    # m "\"Yeah.\""
    m "\"Ita.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1132
translate latin end_game2_7eb761af:

    # a "\"Well, that's good, because I'm hoping...even after how poorly the day went, that you might join me for a late night Lover's Day celebration?\""
    a "\"Bene, id bonum est, quia spero...etiam post diem tam male actum, te fortasse mecum in seram celebrationem Diei Amantium venturum?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1134
translate latin end_game2_7ddcaa1a:

    # "He never gives up, and I do love that about him."
    "Numquam desistit, et hoc in eo vere amo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1135
translate latin end_game2_ad10a89a:

    # "I smile."
    "Arrideo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1136
translate latin end_game2_65ef732e:

    # m "\"That sounds great, Amicus.\""
    m "\"Id pulchrum sonat, Amice.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1139
translate latin end_game2_8b3939f4:

    # "We walk down the steps from the main building into an empty courtyard, all of the vehicles gone."
    "E praecipuo aedificio per gradus in vacuum atrium descendimus, omnibus vehiculis absentibus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1140
translate latin end_game2_e499761a_2:

    # "I frown."
    "Frontem contraho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1141
translate latin end_game2_eec9377f:

    # m "\"They just left us without any transportation?\""
    m "\"Tantum nos sine ulla vectura reliquerunt?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1143
translate latin end_game2_90ba4167:

    # a "\"Oh yes, I told them to go on ahead.\""
    a "\"O ita, eos ante ire iussi.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1144
translate latin end_game2_62a5f071:

    # m "\"Oh, why?\""
    m "\"O, cur?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1146
translate latin end_game2_3174351e:

    # a "\"Do you not wish to walk?\""
    a "\"Non vis ambulare?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1147
translate latin end_game2_b6161ada:

    # m "\"Isn't it a little far to walk?\""
    m "\"Nonne paulo longius ad ambulandum est?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1148
translate latin end_game2_649935a5:

    # "I follow Amicus down the steps and through the university's gardens before we're back in the forest, walking in the direction away from the palace."
    "Amicum per gradus atque hortos universitatis sequor, donec rursus in silva sumus, in partem a palatio remotam ambulantes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1150
translate latin end_game2_45d2986b:

    # a "\"Not really. The city and palace are within reasonable walking distance.\""
    a "\"Vere non. Urbs atque palatium intra spatium commode pedibus faciendum sunt.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1151
translate latin end_game2_4c814a29:

    # "I walk alongside the wolf, feeling myself relax again as we're surrounded by the quiet forest."
    "Iuxta lupum ambulo, rursus me relaxari sentiens dum quieta silva circumdamur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1154
translate latin end_game2_fef5c314:

    # m "\"Huh, guess I just assumed it was far since we're always using the carriage.\""
    m "\"Huh, credo me tantum procul esse putavisse, quia semper curru utimur.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1155
translate latin end_game2_257e85d1:

    # a "\"We tend to be lazy. That, and it's expected by the citizens as it's seen as more...dignified, I suppose.\""
    a "\"Pigri esse solemus. Praeterea cives exspectant, quia magis...dignum videtur, credo.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1156
translate latin end_game2_32706b74:

    # m "\"Hmm, what about security? Shouldn't you have some protection as emperor?\""
    m "\"Hmm, quid de securitate? Nonne imperator aliquam protectionem habere debes?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1157
translate latin end_game2_c5351760:

    # "I look around, feeling almost vulnerable out here in the open with Amicus, used to always having the protection of the palace walls around us."
    "Circumspicio, quasi paene vulnerabilis hic in aperto cum Amico, semper muris palatii circa nos protegi adsuetus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1159
translate latin end_game2_4331b431:

    # "Amicus glances up, and I follow his gaze, immediately spotting the blinking lights of drones above us."
    "Amicus suspicit; obtutum eius sequor et statim lumina automatum supra nos micantia video."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1160
translate latin end_game2_ec0ba95d:

    # a "\"Drones are far better than any sapient when it comes to security.\""
    a "\"Automata multo meliora sunt quam quilibet Sapiens ad securitatem.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1161
translate latin end_game2_b55b53cc:

    # "Amicus looks over at me."
    "Amicus ad me spectat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1163
translate latin end_game2_cd2819b7:

    # a "\"I suppose you haven't been outside the palace very often at all, have you?\""
    a "\"Credo te extra palatium non saepissime fuisse, recte?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1164
translate latin end_game2_3a1f371a:

    # m "\"Not really.\""
    m "\"Non sane.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1165
translate latin end_game2_34b22650:

    # "The wolf grimaces."
    "Lupus vultum contrahit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1167
translate latin end_game2_aacf9463:

    # a "\"I apologize for that. I know it seems like you should be more free to travel after what happened, but the people are...\""
    a "\"De ea re veniam peto. Scio videri te post ea quae acciderunt liberius iter facere debere; sed populus...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1168
translate latin end_game2_59409490:

    # "Amicus takes a moment to find his words."
    "Amicus paulisper verba quaerit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1170
translate latin end_game2_daeb0b09:

    # a "\"...very curious about you. It would be difficult to keep them from crowding.\""
    a "\"...valde de te curiosus est. Difficile erit eos a concursu prohibere.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1171
translate latin end_game2_63478cee:

    # "I raise an eyebrow as I see lights in the distance, twinkling through the tree branches."
    "Supercilium tollo cum lumina procul video, per ramos arborum micantia."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1172
translate latin end_game2_59648285:

    # m "\"But we're heading to the city right now, aren't we?\""
    m "\"Sed nunc ad urbem imus, nonne?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1173
translate latin end_game2_21493a8f:

    # "I don't think I can deal with crowds, at least not now when I'm not really prepared for it."
    "Non puto me turbas ferre posse, saltem non nunc, cum non vere paratus sim."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1174
translate latin end_game2_3756d470:

    # a "\"Well, I cleared the district for our arrival, though that was supposed to be...I'd say five hours ago.\""
    a "\"Bene, regionem ad adventum nostrum vacuam feci; sed id fieri debebat...ante quinque horas, dicerem.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1176
translate latin end_game2_0d9d8caf:

    # a "\"But still, it's late enough that the streets should be mostly empty.\""
    a "\"Sed tamen satis sero est ut viae plerumque vacuae esse debeant.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1177
translate latin end_game2_2d6ee573:

    # m "\"Oh.\""
    m "\"O.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1178
translate latin end_game2_757d7f2d:

    # "I draw closer to Amicus."
    "Amico propius accedo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1179
translate latin end_game2_3b69c6f6:

    # m "\"Where are we going?\""
    m "\"Quo imus?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1181
translate latin end_game2_47cd483a:

    # a "\"You'll see.\""
    a "\"Videbis.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1182
translate latin end_game2_3b3a7923:

    # "There's a sly smile on the wolf's face as we trudge along the path, walking in comfortable silence."
    "Callidus arrisus in facie lupi est dum per semitam ambulamus, in commodo silentio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1184
translate latin end_game2_544175c0:

    # "Eventually, we break through the trees and into the small, quaint street that I'd been on before."
    "Tandem ex arboribus in parvam gratamque viam procedimus, in qua antea fueram."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1185
translate latin end_game2_669f89da:

    # "Sure enough, it's completely empty aside from one or two figures moving up the sidewalk or standing in a doorway."
    "Certe omnino vacua est, praeter unam aut duas figuras per crepidinem euntes aut in limine stantes."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1186
translate latin end_game2_4cb8e272:

    # "I notice then that Amicus is becoming more excited, and it shows in his widening strides, and I have to hurry to keep up."
    "Tum animadverto Amicum laetiorem fieri; longiores passus ostendunt, et festinare debeo ut assequar."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1187
translate latin end_game2_03b61350:

    # "I try to think of where he could possibly be taking me."
    "Cogitare conor quo me ducere possit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1188
translate latin end_game2_2e87079d:

    # m "\"Amicus?\""
    m "\"Amice?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1189
translate latin end_game2_7c86d643:

    # "The wolf pauses, waiting for me to catch up, then places his paw against the small of my back, and I'm suddenly thrust forward at his speed, forced along in a stumbling gait."
    "Lupus consistit, exspectans dum eum assequar; tum manum imo tergo meo admovet, et subito celeritate eius propellor, titubans ire coactus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1190
translate latin end_game2_ea49018d:

    # m "\"Whoa!\""
    m "\"Eho!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1192
translate latin end_game2_9dcaf365:

    # a "\"Come on, it's right here.\""
    a "\"Age, hic est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1193
translate latin end_game2_f9788974:

    # "The wolf sweeps me under a dark archway."
    "Lupus me sub obscurum fornicem ducit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1194
translate latin end_game2_b4646299:

    # "There's a door in front of us, the soft glow of light barely showing through the frosted glass framing the door."
    "Ianua ante nos est, leni lumine vix per vitrum obscurum circa eam apparente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1195
translate latin end_game2_7e608399:

    # "It looks like it's closed, and I look up at Amicus in question, but the wolf doesn't seem bothered, and simply knocks on the door."
    "Clausa videtur, et ad Amicum interrogans suspicio; sed lupus turbari non videtur, tantum ianuam pulsat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1198
translate latin end_game2_d803b403:

    # "We wait a few moments, then Amicus leans in toward the crack, talking loudly through it."
    "Paulisper exspectamus; tum Amicus ad rimam inclinat, clare per eam loquens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1200
translate latin end_game2_92008127:

    # a "\"Helooooo, Gaius?\""
    a "\"Salveeee, Gai?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1201
translate latin end_game2_aed55d51:

    # "Something beyond the door blots out the light, and Amicus steps back before suddenly drawing me to his side, as if preparing to introduce me to someone."
    "Aliquid post ianuam lumen tegit; Amicus recedit, deinde subito me lateri suo trahit, quasi me alicui praesentaturus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1202
translate latin end_game2_e84baeda:

    # "I stand there awkwardly, trying to prepare myself for whatever this is."
    "Ibi inepte sto, quidquid hoc est accipere paratus esse conatus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1204
translate latin end_game2_735b217d:

    # "When the door opens, it's not what I expect at all:"
    "Cum ianua aperitur, minime id est quod exspecto:"

# game/end_game2.rpy:1205
translate latin end_game2_b34fc509:

    # "An old she-wolf in an apron and with a cloth tied over the top of her head peers around the door, cracked open just enough so that her muzzle can fit through."
    "Lupa vetula praecinctorio induta et panno supra caput alligato circa ianuam spectat, quae tantum satis aperta est ut rostrum eius transire possit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1206
translate latin end_game2_39b41e13:

    # "I feel Amicus shift next to me, and he forces his smile even bigger."
    "Amicum iuxta me se movere sentio; se etiam latius subridere cogit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1208
translate latin end_game2_59361f3b:

    # a "\"Hello.\""
    a "\"Salve.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1209
translate latin end_game2_d32b8a47:

    # "The old woman squints."
    "Anus oculos contrahit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1210
translate latin end_game2_3218a2bf:

    # "Old She-wolf" "\"Hello?\""
    "Old She-wolf" "\"Heus?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1212
translate latin end_game2_5512288a:

    # "Amicus is quiet for a moment, clearly taken aback by the other wolf's lack of reaction."
    "Amicus paulisper tacet, clare attonitus quod altera lupa nihil reagat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1213
translate latin end_game2_03e8da50:

    # "He clears his throat."
    "Guttur purgat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1215
translate latin end_game2_fdebb96d:

    # a "\"I am Amicus, your emperor, and this is [mc], my...companion.\""
    a "\"Amicus sum, imperator tuus, et hic [mc] est, meus...comes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1216
translate latin end_game2_631756ef:

    # "That's a new title."
    "Novus titulus est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1217
translate latin end_game2_f9e2a1b7:

    # "I look up at the wolf in question, but he goes on staring at the she-wolf who only continues to stare back at him."
    "Ad lupum interrogans suspicio, sed lupam spectare pergit, quae tantum vicissim eum spectat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1219
translate latin end_game2_fbb21ad9:

    # a "\"Maybe you are familiar?\""
    a "\"Fortasse me nosti?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1220
translate latin end_game2_5d94e76f:

    # "Old She-wolf" "\"Hmm...no, no, I don't think so.\""
    "Old She-wolf" "\"Hmm...non, non, non puto.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1223
translate latin end_game2_f00433d3:

    # "Amicus stares, his mouth gaping open while the woman starts to close the door."
    "Amicus intuetur, ore aperto, dum mulier ianuam claudere incipit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1224
translate latin end_game2_58f0f6b0:

    # "Quickly, Amicus lets go of me to reach out, stopping the door from closing just by an inch."
    "Cito Amicus me dimittit et manum porrigit, ianuam ab integra clausura uno tantum pollice prohibens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1226
translate latin end_game2_589fc791:

    # a "\"Uh, excuse me please, but could you summon Gaius? He will know who I am.\""
    a "\"Eh, ignosce quaeso; sed Gaium vocare potes? Ille sciet quis sim.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1227
translate latin end_game2_520b41a5:

    # "The old wolf sticks her muzzle back through the crack, glaring now."
    "Lupa vetula rostrum rursus per rimam porrigit, iam irata spectans."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1228
translate latin end_game2_564443d9:

    # "Old She-wolf" "\"Gaius was relieved of his shift three hours ago. You know it's the second hour?\""
    "Old She-wolf" "\"Gaius ab opere suo ante tres horas dimissus est. Scis horam secundam esse?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1229
translate latin end_game2_836d43cd:

    # a "\"I—I had suspected, though I had hoped he would have waited for me—\""
    a "\"Ego—suspicatus eram, quamquam speraveram eum adhuc me exspectaturum—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1230
translate latin end_game2_df68772d:

    # "Old She-wolf" "\"You thought wrong, dear.\""
    "Old She-wolf" "\"Male putavisti, care.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1231
translate latin end_game2_2fa4382b:

    # "Amicus bristles."
    "Amicus pilos erigit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1233
translate latin end_game2_62c32856:

    # a "\"E—Excuse me, but you realize you are speaking to your emperor, woman?\""
    a "\"I—ignosce, sed intellegis te imperatori tuo loqui, mulier?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1234
translate latin end_game2_713d8312:

    # "Now I bristle."
    "Nunc ego horresco."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1235
translate latin end_game2_9c6d4631:

    # "Even though I don't know what's going on, exactly, I do feel a surge of disappointment at seeing my lover use the \"do you know who I am?\" line."
    "Quamquam nescio quid exacte accidat, repentinam animi deiectionem sentio cum amantem meum verbis \"scis quis sim?\" uti video."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1236
translate latin end_game2_6ae30550:

    # m "\"Amicus...\""
    m "\"Amice...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1237
translate latin end_game2_0d50df5d:

    # "I try to say it under my breath so the other wolf doesn't hear."
    "Sub voce dicere conor, ne altera lupa audiat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1239
translate latin end_game2_e07a6585:

    # a "\"What? I'm just trying—\""
    a "\"Quid? Tantum conor—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1240
translate latin end_game2_f9798fb1:

    # "The door starts to close again, and Amicus quickly reaches out, but this time, the old woman is ready."
    "Ianua rursus claudi incipit; Amicus cito manum porrigit, sed hoc tempore anus parata est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1241
translate latin end_game2_adf1eba1:

    # "She reaches out to smack his paw hard, making Amicus gasp in surprise before the door slams shut."
    "Manum porrigit et eius manum vehementer percutit, Amicum miratum anhelare faciens, antequam ianua fragore clauditur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1243
translate latin end_game2_59ee7e3f:

    # a "\"How dare...\""
    a "\"Quomodo audet...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1245
translate latin end_game2_c9cb7cb4:

    # "Amicus looks at loss for a moment, as if he's never experienced something like this before and doesn't know what to do, then he tries to open the door, but it's locked."
    "Amicus paulisper incertus videtur, quasi tale quid numquam expertus sit et nesciat quid agat; tum ianuam aperire conatur, sed obserata est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1246
translate latin end_game2_0f4537e5:

    # "He then resorts to pounding on the door with a heavy fist, lips drawn back to show his teeth."
    "Tum gravi pugno ianuam pulsare incipit, labris retractis ut dentes ostendat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1248
translate latin end_game2_99397d82:

    # a "\"Open the damned door! I was promised a special banquet in the human's honor! Do you hear me, woman!?\""
    a "\"Ianuam maledictam aperi! Mihi convivium singulare in honorem hominis promissum est! Audisne me, mulier!?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1249
translate latin end_game2_94288fb7:

    # "I reach out, pushing a hand against Amicus's chest."
    "Manum porrigo, pectori Amici premens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1250
translate latin end_game2_ab22b33b:

    # m "\"Holy shit, Amicus, stop!\""
    m "\"Di boni, Amice, desine!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1251
translate latin end_game2_4965e01e:

    # "I hiss at him under my breath, looking around, not having expected to be embarrassed at Amicus's behavior."
    "Sub voce ei sibilo, circumspiciens, non exspectans me moribus Amici pudore affectum iri."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1252
translate latin end_game2_a70a4fdd:

    # "I'm so used to embarrassing myself."
    "Tam adsuetus sum me ipsum pudore afficere."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1255
translate latin end_game2_3c8805f7:

    # a "\"What?\""
    a "\"Quid?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1256
translate latin end_game2_7929d7b1:

    # m "\"Do you hear yourself?\""
    m "\"Te ipsum audis?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1257
translate latin end_game2_a2bdea04:

    # a "\"What do you mean? I paid for their services and had everything planned—\""
    a "\"Quid dicis? Operae eorum pretium solvi et omnia paraveram—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1258
translate latin end_game2_1df6f853:

    # m "\"We're five hours late!\""
    m "\"Quinque horas seri sumus!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1261
translate latin end_game2_696efafc:

    # a "\"But I'm the emperor, and you are my guest, and that woman—\""
    a "\"Sed imperator sum, et tu hospes meus es, et illa mulier—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1263
translate latin end_game2_74e3dfd5:

    # "I step closer, cutting Amicus off even as I lower my voice, surprised at the sudden surge of anger I'm feeling."
    "Propius accedo, verba Amici interrumpens dum vocem demitto, miratus subitum impetum irae quem sentio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1264
translate latin end_game2_fa3da4d8:

    # m "\"Amicus, you're acting like a spoiled brat right now, just like Cassius...and stop calling her woman.\""
    m "\"Amice, nunc quasi puer molliter educatus agis, sicut Cassius...et desine eam mulierem vocare.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1265
translate latin end_game2_810b5b47:

    # "Amicus's indignant demeanor seems to deflate a little bit at that."
    "Indignatio Amici his verbis paulum languescere videtur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1267
translate latin end_game2_78371e4e:

    # a "\"I—I'm not acting like him at all. And what else should I call her? She is a woman.\""
    a "\"Ego—minime sicut ille ago. Et quo alio nomine eam vocem? Mulier est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1268
translate latin end_game2_9f5bb5fe:

    # m "\"It's the {i}way{/i} you're saying it, and I dunno, maybe ma'am could be a good start?\""
    m "\"{i}Modus{/i} quo dicis est; et nescio, fortasse domina bonum initium esset?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1269
translate latin end_game2_d8e9495f:

    # a "\"Well, she's certainly not acting like a madam.\""
    a "\"Bene, certe non quasi domina agit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1270
translate latin end_game2_4e3fb928:

    # m "\"Is this how you act when you don't get your way?\""
    m "\"Sic agis cum quod vis non obtines?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1271
translate latin end_game2_2e930e9c:

    # "Amicus has always had an entitled streak."
    "Amicus semper aliquantum sibi omnia deberi putavit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1272
translate latin end_game2_e505db53:

    # "I mean, it's kind of what got me in this situation in the first place, but I thought he'd have changed a bit after everything we'd been through."
    "Dico, quodam modo id ipsum me ab initio in hanc condicionem adduxit; sed putabam eum post omnia quae passi sumus paulum mutatum esse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1273
translate latin end_game2_d0d096f2:

    # "Especially over something as small as this."
    "Maxime de re tam parva."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1274
translate latin end_game2_ea9fbc5a:

    # "Amicus must see the disappointment in my face, because he deflates further, blowing out a big breath that ruffles back my hair and smells vaguely of lavender."
    "Sine dubio Amicus animi deiectionem in facie mea videt, quia magis languescit, magnum spiritum emittens qui capillos meos retrudit atque paulum lavandula olet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1276
translate latin end_game2_36636428:

    # a "\"No...no, I don't, I promise. It's just that I had something very special planned, and—\""
    a "\"Non...non, ita non ago, promitto. Tantum rem valde singularem paraveram, et—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1277
translate latin end_game2_a58d07c7:

    # "Amicus looks back at the door, trying to see through the frosted glass, as if whoever he's looking for will magically appear."
    "Amicus ad ianuam respicit, per obscurum vitrum videre conatus, quasi is quem quaerit arte magica appariturus sit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1278
translate latin end_game2_53f73b25:

    # m "\"Amicus, you can't expect anyone to wait five hours for you, whether you're emperor, or not.\""
    m "\"Amice, neminem exspectare potes ut te per quinque horas exspectet, sive imperator es sive non.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1279
translate latin end_game2_a5ed7e8b:

    # "I think."
    "Cogito."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1280
translate latin end_game2_68025071:

    # m "\"Except me, of course.\""
    m "\"Praeter me scilicet.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1282
translate latin end_game2_a61ebafe:

    # a "\"Yeah...\""
    a "\"Ita...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1283
translate latin end_game2_ea79be36:

    # "I see the moment Amicus gives up on his grand plan, whatever it was, as his deflation completes in a slouch, and suddenly he looks very, very tired."
    "Momentum video quo Amicus magnum consilium suum, quidquid erat, deserit, languescente toto corpore in incurvationem; subito valde, valde defatigatus videtur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1284
translate latin end_game2_97e2c3a3:

    # m "\"...You okay?\""
    m "\"...Vales?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1286
translate latin end_game2_ec08fe3e:

    # a "\"Yes, I'm fine. Let's...let's just head back to the palace.\""
    a "\"Ita, bene valeo. Tantum...tantum ad palatium redeamus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1287
translate latin end_game2_23c61366:

    # m "\"Maybe we could go someplace else? I wouldn't mind finding a hole-in-the wall that's open late.\""
    m "\"Fortasse alio eamus? Mihi placeat parvam tabernam sero apertam invenire.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1289
translate latin end_game2_764ce9c7:

    # "But Amicus is already walking back up the road toward the forest, shaking his head."
    "Sed Amicus iam per viam ad silvam redit, caput quatiens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1290
translate latin end_game2_14064fb9:

    # a "\"I would rather we reserve the location ahead of time so that I can ensure your safety. It's too late for that tonight.\""
    a "\"Malo locum ante tempus reservare, quo securitatem tuam curare possim. Hac nocte iam nimis sero est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1291
translate latin end_game2_991c429c:

    # "I follow Amicus at a slight distance, feeling generally disappointed and baffled over what had just happened."
    "Amicum paulum remotus sequor, in universum spe frustratus et re modo gesta confusus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1292
translate latin end_game2_cec40b39:

    # "While I'm still feeling somewhat stunned by Amicus's behavior, I also feel bad because it's clear that he'd really wanted to make tonight special, and to see him so defeated..."
    "Quamquam adhuc moribus Amici aliquantum attonitus sum, etiam male me habeo quia clare voluerat hanc noctem singularem facere; eum tam victum videre..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1294
translate latin end_game2_c6a96811:

    # "I catch up to him and walk alongside the wolf just as we pass under the cover of the many branches, our path lit by the firefly-like insects floating around us."
    "Eum assequor et iuxta lupum ambulo dum sub tegmen multorum ramorum transimus, semita ab insectis lampyridibus similibus circa nos volantibus illuminata."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1295
translate latin end_game2_95bb049b:

    # m "\"Well, we could do something at the palace. Maybe have a picnic?\""
    m "\"Bene, aliquid in palatio facere possumus. Fortasse cenam foris?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1296
translate latin end_game2_fa573af8:

    # "Amicus heaves a heavy sigh."
    "Amicus graviter suspirat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1298
translate latin end_game2_48483942:

    # a "\"Honestly, [mc], I'm a bit tired...and it's not even Lover's Day anymore anyway.\""
    a "\"Vere, [mc], aliquantum defatigatus sum...et ne Dies Amantium quidem iam est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1299
translate latin end_game2_3e46b371:

    # "The wolf says the last bit so quietly that I barely catch it."
    "Lupus ultimum tam quiete dicit ut vix percipiam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1300
translate latin end_game2_48ff5cf6:

    # "And just like that, my attempts to keep my own mood light give in and I sour instantly."
    "Sic conatus mei animum levem servandi cedunt, et statim amarus fio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1303
translate latin end_game2_b1fe8fa5:

    # m "\"Well...if your goal is to ruin the rest of the night, you're doing a damn good job of it.\""
    m "\"Bene...si reliquam noctem perdere vis, id optime quidem facis.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1304
translate latin end_game2_e29cdb3e:

    # "Suddenly, we're having one of our old fights again, the way we would feed off of each other's negativity and spiral into a shared mood of sulk."
    "Subito veterem rixam nostram rursus habemus, sicut negativitate alterius alter alebamur et in communem animum morosum cadebamus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1305
translate latin end_game2_11ee6ea9:

    # "Usually, I'd be the one to start it, but this time I feel like Amicus is the clear culprit."
    "Plerumque ego inciperem, sed hoc tempore Amicus clare culpabilis videtur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1306
translate latin end_game2_e7f31b97:

    # "I stare at the ground, frowning even though I feel Amicus's eyes on me."
    "Solum intueor, fronte contracta, quamquam oculos Amici in me sentio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1307
translate latin end_game2_34b79e1c:

    # "Then it takes me a few moments to realize he's stopped walking."
    "Tum aliquot momentis opus est ut intellegam eum ambulare desiisse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1308
translate latin end_game2_f990b9d4:

    # "I stop too, then turn around to look back at him."
    "Ego quoque consisto, deinde me verto ut respiciam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1310
translate latin end_game2_07cd6598:

    # "We regard each other for a moment, then Amicus takes a deep breath."
    "Paulisper alter alterum consideramus; tum Amicus alte spirat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1311
translate latin end_game2_a0613b69:

    # a "\"I...realize that I am acting like a spoiled pup, and I apologize. I do not want this to ruin the rest of the night, even though there is not much left of it.\""
    a "\"Ego...intellego me quasi catulum molliter educatum agere, et veniam peto. Nolo hoc reliquam noctem perdere, quamquam parum eius restat.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1312
translate latin end_game2_acca654e:

    # "I stand there, not saying anything because it looks like Amicus wants to say more."
    "Ibi sto, nihil dicens, quia Amicus plura dicere velle videtur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1313
translate latin end_game2_f00496e7:

    # a "\"I promise you, I do not often act in such a way in front of my subjects.\""
    a "\"Tibi promitto me non saepe ita coram subditis agere.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1315
translate latin end_game2_010c82f5:

    # a "\"I just so desperately wanted for something to go right after everything that happened...\""
    a "\"Tantum tam vehementer volebam aliquid bene evenire post omnia quae acciderunt...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1316
translate latin end_game2_aa616c93:

    # m "\"Not often?\""
    m "\"Non saepe?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1317
translate latin end_game2_aa2b8676:

    # "I raise an eyebrow, but smirk at the same time, wanting to show Amicus that I'm willing to lighten up as well."
    "Supercilium tollo, sed simul callide subrideo, ostendere cupiens me quoque animum levare paratum esse."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1319
translate latin end_game2_35e382bd:

    # a "\"I mean, never, really. I've never used such words to get my way during all of my emperorship, and it was only because it was for {i}you{/i}.\""
    a "\"Dico, numquam vere. Per totum imperium meum numquam talibus verbis usus sum ut quod vellem obtinerem; tantum quia pro {i}te{/i} erat feci.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1320
translate latin end_game2_3f739ce1:

    # "I sigh."
    "Suspiro."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1321
translate latin end_game2_186c5628:

    # m "\"Well...please don't ever feel the need to act that way on my behalf again. Especially when you're yelling at an old lady and calling her {i}woman{/i}.\""
    m "\"Bene...quaeso, noli umquam rursus sentire te pro me ita agere debere. Maxime cum ad anum clamas et eam {i}mulierem{/i} vocas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1323
translate latin end_game2_dd898edc:

    # a "\"I still do not see the problem with that. She {i}is{/i} a woman.\""
    a "\"Adhuc non video quid mali in ea re sit. Mulier {i}est{/i}.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1324
translate latin end_game2_5a613a6f:

    # "Amicus starts walking again, and I walk alongside him."
    "Amicus rursus ambulare incipit, et iuxta eum ambulo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1325
translate latin end_game2_b00236c7:

    # m "\"And like I said, it's the way you were saying it, like it was an insult, somehow.\""
    m "\"Et, ut dixi, modus quo dicebas est, quasi quodam modo contumelia esset.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1326
translate latin end_game2_e8943bf3:

    # a "\"I did not mean it that way.\""
    a "\"Ita non significavi.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1327
translate latin end_game2_3f481890:

    # m "\"I mean, I kind of feel like you did. But I get it, you were raised in this society of—\""
    m "\"Dico, quodam modo sentio te ita significavisse. Sed intellego; in hac societate educatus es, quae—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1328
translate latin end_game2_eb6d22ec:

    # "Amicus huffs out a sigh."
    "Amicus suspiratum emittit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1329
translate latin end_game2_7384a961:

    # a "\"Yes, I know. But I've been doing a lot to progress the rights of women in this society.\""
    a "\"Ita, scio. Sed multa feci ut iura mulierum in hac societate promoveam.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1330
translate latin end_game2_321851e1:

    # a "\"Just yesterday I put into motion legislation that will allow females to request a divorce before a court.\""
    a "\"Heri tantum legem faciendam institui qua feminis liceat divortium coram iudicio petere.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1331
translate latin end_game2_55cc15e7:

    # m "\"And they couldn't before?\""
    m "\"Et antea non poterant?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1333
translate latin end_game2_85cc914b:

    # a "\"Well, no, the husband had to.\""
    a "\"Bene, non; maritus petere debebat.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1334
translate latin end_game2_93bd3770:

    # m "\"Wow...\""
    m "\"Vah...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1336
translate latin end_game2_baa7287f:

    # a "\"Gods, are you humans going to be like the Khemians? Shocked and disgusted by every aspect of our society?\""
    a "\"Di, vos hominesne sicut Khemiani eritis? Omni parte societatis nostrae attoniti et fastidientes?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1337
translate latin end_game2_8619f2c6_1:

    # "I shrug."
    "Umeros tollo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1338
translate latin end_game2_7c79f747:

    # m "\"I mean, some definitely will be.\""
    m "\"Dico, nonnulli certe erunt.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1339
translate latin end_game2_7f83ae76:

    # a "\"Do you not have your own problems?\""
    a "\"Non habetis mala vestra?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1340
translate latin end_game2_e33f02ef:

    # "I laugh."
    "Rideo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1341
translate latin end_game2_f1e8ef67:

    # m "\"Oh yeah, we do, we {i}definitely{/i} do. I'm sure you'll be beyond shocked by some of the things we've done to ourselves.\""
    m "\"O ita, habemus, {i}certe{/i} habemus. Certus sum te extreme attonitum fore quibusdam rebus quas nobismet ipsis fecimus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1342
translate latin end_game2_7929dd14:

    # a "\"Like?\""
    a "\"Qualibus?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1343
translate latin end_game2_2c5a22b3:

    # "I close my eyes, shaking my head."
    "Oculos claudo, caput quatiens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1344
translate latin end_game2_d81c6c67:

    # m "\"I'll let the diplomats reveal that to you, but yeah, most places on Earth still have problems when it comes to equality, a lot of problems.\""
    m "\"Legatos sinam tibi id patefacere; sed ita, pleraque loca in Terra adhuc mala de aequalitate habent, multa mala.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1346
translate latin end_game2_9eaa2441:

    # a "\"Then why do you judge me so harshly?\""
    a "\"Cur igitur tam dure me iudicas?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1347
translate latin end_game2_dcf666eb:

    # m "\"Because I know you can do better, and I know you have the power to create immediate change.\""
    m "\"Quia scio te melius facere posse, et scio te potestatem statim res mutandi habere.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1349
translate latin end_game2_e1239223:

    # a "\"Technically, but realistically—\""
    a "\"Revera, sed in usu—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1350
translate latin end_game2_c436e109:

    # m "\"I know, it's a slow process.\""
    m "\"Scio, lenta ratio est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1351
translate latin end_game2_a6721f33:

    # m "\"But you know, where you found me, Italy, it's doing alright with equality, and a lot of Europe is doing great, so I know Adastra can be better.\""
    m "\"Sed scis, ubi me invenisti, Italia, satis bene de aequalitate se habet, et multa Europae pars optime; itaque scio Adastram meliorem esse posse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1352
translate latin end_game2_cb7e8690:

    # "Things go quiet for a moment, that tangent feeling a little strange, like there's more to it than just gender equality."
    "Paulisper res silent, illo sermone laterali paulum miro, quasi plus quam tantum aequalitas sexuum in eo sit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1353
translate latin end_game2_eda81ff3:

    # "Amicus senses it too, of course:"
    "Amicus quoque scilicet sentit:"

# game/end_game2.rpy:1355
translate latin end_game2_226c9be0:

    # a "\"While I know that the parents, through whatever space wizardry they possess, brought us together due to perfect compatibility—\""
    a "\"Quamquam scio Parentes, quacumque magia siderali utuntur, nos propter perfectam congruentiam coniunxisse—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1357
translate latin end_game2_e8b8ff0f:

    # a "\"—sometimes I wonder about their measurements, because in some instances, we do feel worlds apart.\""
    a "\"—interdum de mensuris eorum dubito, quia quibusdam in rebus vere mundis separati videmur.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1358
translate latin end_game2_0e65f65d:

    # "I look at Amicus, the statement making me feel a little sad."
    "Amicum intueor, verbis eius me paulum tristem facientibus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1359
translate latin end_game2_9a59bc78:

    # m "\"Well, I guess we really are.\""
    m "\"Bene, credo nos vere esse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1360
translate latin end_game2_bcf07b7b:

    # a "\"But...I love it, I love that about you. You open my eyes, you surprise me, and I've accepted the fact that you come from a better functioning society.\""
    a "\"Sed...id amo, hoc in te amo. Oculos meos aperis, me admiratione afficis, et accepi te ex societate melius constituta venire.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1361
translate latin end_game2_1f13d0f9:

    # a "\"I'm willing to learn.\""
    a "\"Discere paratus sum.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1362
translate latin end_game2_39d9857f:

    # "I look down, feeling a little embarrassed."
    "Oculos demitto, paulum pudens."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1363
translate latin end_game2_28b1048c:

    # m "\"Well, humans have a {i}lot{/i} to learn too. We're kind of a disaster, too.\""
    m "\"Bene, homines quoque {i}multa{/i} discere debent. Nos quoque aliquantum calamitosi sumus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1364
translate latin end_game2_7f62752d:

    # a "\"Then let us learn together.\""
    a "\"Una igitur discamus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1366
translate latin end_game2_084220c4:

    # a "\"But back to what I was saying previously: [mc], we're...we're running out of time, and I {i}need{/i} to do something with you. I feel like I missed that tonight.\""
    a "\"Sed ad ea quae ante dicebam redeamus: [mc], tempus nobis...tempus deficit, atque mihi {i}opus{/i} est aliquid tecum facere. Hoc hac nocte praetermisisse me sentio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1367
translate latin end_game2_104e5611:

    # "I feel my chest twinge a bit at that."
    "His verbis paulum in pectore doleo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1368
translate latin end_game2_80ea9d91:

    # m "\"We still have time.\""
    m "\"Tempus adhuc habemus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1370
translate latin end_game2_d93452b8:

    # a "\"I suppose.\""
    a "\"Puto posse.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1371
translate latin end_game2_77f498ce:

    # "It's quiet again, and though things aren't fully relaxed again, most of the tension has left the air."
    "Rursus tacemus; quamquam nondum prorsus relaxati sumus, maxima pars contenti animi iam abiit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1372
translate latin end_game2_2dc4ace5:

    # "After a few more minutes of walking, simply enjoying the cool, night air, I clear my throat."
    "Post pauca adhuc minuta ambulandi, frigido nocturno aere tantum fruentes, guttur purgo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1373
translate latin end_game2_6edfbf00:

    # m "\"So, uh, what was that whole restaurant thing about?\""
    m "\"Igitur, hem, quid tota illa res popinae erat?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1375
translate latin end_game2_f62564dd:

    # "Amicus chuckles, kicking a rock with a big foot paw, sending it tumbling up the path to clack loudly against the roots of a tree."
    "Amicus subridet atque magno pede lapidem calce impellit; per semitam volvitur et clare contra arboris radices sonat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1376
translate latin end_game2_87da4fb6:

    # a "\"I had, uh, decided to get a head start on human integration into the {i}Galaxias{/i}, even though the citizens won't know it.\""
    a "\"Statueram, hem, initium hominum in {i}Galaxias{/i} introducendorum antecapere, quamquam cives id nescient.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1377
translate latin end_game2_707d2a10:

    # m "\"How so?\""
    m "\"Quomodo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1378
translate latin end_game2_18e4babd:

    # a "\"Well, a cultural staple for all species is often times their food.\""
    a "\"Cibus saepe praecipua cultus pars apud omnes species est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1379
translate latin end_game2_9b78ca0f:

    # m "\"Yeah?\""
    m "\"Quid?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1380
translate latin end_game2_20e5cd12:

    # "I have an idea of where this is going, but I don't know how it's possible."
    "Suspicor quo sermo tendat, sed quomodo fieri possit nescio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1381
translate latin end_game2_27ef6f27:

    # a "\"So, I've established a human cuisine restaurant.\""
    a "\"Ita popinam ciborum humanorum condidi.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1382
translate latin end_game2_6c6c25c1:

    # m "\"Oh really?\""
    m "\"Itane vero?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1384
translate latin end_game2_bcc81977:

    # a "\"Yes.\""
    a "\"Ita.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1385
translate latin end_game2_cced5b15:

    # m "\"But, uh, how?\""
    m "\"Sed, hem, quomodo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1386
translate latin end_game2_2435df10:

    # a "\"Com analyzed and stored a fragment of the data from your Nexus back on Earth.\""
    a "\"Com particulam datorum e Nexu vestro in Terra examinavit atque servavit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1387
translate latin end_game2_d87dd849:

    # a "\"Though not all ingredients are the same, we substituted as best we could and developed food that is, in my opinion, rather authentic.\""
    a "\"Quamquam non omnia ingredientia eadem sunt, quantum potuimus substituimus cibosque paravimus qui, ut mihi videtur, satis veri sunt.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1388
translate latin end_game2_fefe1069:

    # m "\"Huh...you know there's a lot of food from different cultures on Earth, so a lot of different types of food.\""
    m "\"Huh...scis multos cibos e variis Terrae cultibus esse, itaque multa diversa ciborum genera.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1390
translate latin end_game2_93eb0ea7:

    # a "\"Oh, I kept it all in Italy, at least for now. In fact, our first item was {i}Nea-poli-tan pi-zza{/i}.\""
    a "\"Oh, omnia intra Italiam tenui, saltem nunc. Immo, primus cibus noster erat {i}Pi-zza Ne-a-po-li-ta-na{/i}.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1391
translate latin end_game2_317e26bd:

    # "Amicus's suddenly heavily accented voice startles me a bit, as it always does, the wolf chewing around the words like he's actually eating it."
    "Vox Amici subito tam alieno sono pronuntiantis paulum me percellit, ut semper: lupus verba quasi vere cibum edat ore volvit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1392
translate latin end_game2_8c4e5c77:

    # m "\"Wow.\""
    m "\"O.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1394
translate latin end_game2_e05b3600:

    # a "\"So, as you would expect, I wanted you to try all of the items to let us know how we did.\""
    a "\"Ita, ut exspectes, omnes cibos gustare te volui, ut sciremus quam bene egissemus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1395
translate latin end_game2_1b161588:

    # "Amicus is talking about all of this like the restaurant was his own project, something he's been working on for a long time."
    "Amicus de his omnibus loquitur quasi popina opus ipsius sit, quod iam diu parat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1397
translate latin end_game2_33e91dac:

    # a "\"I thought it would be a fun distraction for you, but as you know, things did not go as planned.\""
    a "\"Putavi id tibi iucundam animi distractionem praebiturum esse; sed, ut scis, res non ex consilio cesserunt.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1398
translate latin end_game2_c289b373:

    # "It would have been fun, and I am disappointed that we didn't get to do it together, but the thought alone of what Amicus had planned for me is enough to warm my chest, and I lean against him."
    "Iucundum fuisset, et me paenitet quod una facere non potuimus; sed sola cogitatio eorum quae Amicus mihi paraverat pectus meum calefacit, atque ei innitor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1399
translate latin end_game2_bbc62048:

    # m "\"Well, thank you anyway, and I mean it.\""
    m "\"Tamen gratias tibi ago, et vere dico.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1400
translate latin end_game2_bf1d179e:

    # "Amicus huffs and slides his arm around my side, rubbing my shoulder vigorously."
    "Amicus anhelat, brachium circa latus meum ponit atque umerum diligenter fricat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1402
translate latin end_game2_4c84e59d:

    # a "\"Well, we'll do it some time soon. Can't open it without you giving your approval first.\""
    a "\"Mox aliquando faciemus. Aperire non possumus nisi tu prius approbaveris.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1403
translate latin end_game2_29ed04c5:

    # m "\"Oh, I didn't know it would all depend on me.\""
    m "\"Oh, nesciebam omnia a me pendere.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1405
translate latin end_game2_65bd2d52:

    # a "\"Of course! The restaurant is named in your honor, after all.\""
    a "\"Certe! Popina enim in honorem tuum nominatur.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1406
translate latin end_game2_816fbc29:

    # m "\"Oh god, really?\""
    m "\"Di boni, re vera?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1408
translate latin end_game2_daf6e5de:

    # a "\"Really.\""
    a "\"Re vera.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1409
translate latin end_game2_f8bb492a:

    # "I feel myself blushing at the thought of my name on a restaurant."
    "Erubesco cogitans nomen meum popinae impositum iri."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1410
translate latin end_game2_b12d9d21:

    # "It's embarrassing for some reason, but also incredibly sweet."
    "Nescio cur pudendum est, sed etiam incredibiliter blandum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1412
translate latin end_game2_82331c67:

    # a "\"And I think we should have that picnic. Nothing like a third hour dinner in the moonlight."
    a "\"Et puto nos illud prandium foris habere debere. Nihil cena hora tertia sub lunae luce melius est."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1413
translate latin end_game2_1d745154:

    # m "\"You sure? You look pretty tired.\""
    m "\"Certus es? Satis fessus videris.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1414
translate latin end_game2_6ebf043a:

    # a "\"I'll live.\""
    a "\"Superero.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1416
translate latin end_game2_e28827af:

    # "Amicus lets me go after a moment, and as he does, I slide my hand down against his paw, taking hold of it."
    "Amicus post paulum me dimittit; interim manum ad manum eius demitto eamque teneo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1417
translate latin end_game2_9ea9469d:

    # "We don't hold hands often, mainly because it's something the wolves just don't really do."
    "Manus raro coniungimus, maxime quia Lupi id facere non solent."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1418
translate latin end_game2_efe0dfbc:

    # "But nothing about it feels strange or out of place as we walk down the path, hand-in-paw, with only the glow of the moon and the firebugs to guide us."
    "Nihil tamen mirum aut alienum sentitur, dum per semitam manibus coniunctis ambulamus, lunae tantum lumine atque igniferis insectis ducti."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1419
translate latin end_game2_42fa939b:

    # "There's an eerie edge to it all, and while I might have been a little nervous if I were alone, I don't feel any of that with Amicus."
    "Est in omnibus aliquid arcanum; quamquam solus paulum anxius essem, cum Amico nihil tale sentio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1420
translate latin end_game2_01ca3ed7:

    # "It does make me think back though, of what happened in the university."
    "Tamen quae in universitate acciderunt in memoriam redeunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1421
translate latin end_game2_2e87079d_1:

    # m "\"Amicus?\""
    m "\"Amice?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1423
translate latin end_game2_3a0221e6:

    # a "\"Hmm?\""
    a "\"Hmm?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1424
translate latin end_game2_003a724f:

    # m "\"What do you know about the Other?\""
    m "\"Quid de Altero scis?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1426
translate latin end_game2_3c8391b0:

    # a "\"Why do you ask about that?\""
    a "\"Cur de illo quaeris?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1427
translate latin end_game2_8619f2c6_2:

    # "I shrug."
    "Umeros tollo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1428
translate latin end_game2_7e1ce96b:

    # m "\"I dunno. I've had it explained to me a few times, but I still don't really understand it.\""
    m "\"Nescio. Aliquotiens mihi explicatum est, sed adhuc non vere intellego.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1429
translate latin end_game2_75aadd1c:

    # a "\"You don't need to worry about it.\""
    a "\"De illo sollicitus esse non debes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1430
translate latin end_game2_60187d91:

    # "I look up at Amicus, glaring."
    "Ad Amicum suspicio, truculenter."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1431
translate latin end_game2_f2e06b22:

    # m "\"Are you seriou—\""
    m "\"Serione di—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1433
translate latin end_game2_b103b352:

    # a "\"I'm not saying that to exclude you—\""
    a "\"Non id dico ut te excludam—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1435
translate latin end_game2_53633d06:

    # a "\"It is honestly something you do not need to fret over. It's thousands of years away, something you will never see.\""
    a "\"Vere res est de qua anxius esse non debes. Milibus annorum abest; numquam videbis.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1436
translate latin end_game2_527ed176:

    # "I look back down at the ground, frowning."
    "Rursus terram aspicio, fronte contracta."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1438
translate latin end_game2_012c0fd7_1:

    # a "\"Are you alright?\""
    a "\"Bene vales?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1439
translate latin end_game2_642df38a:

    # m "\"I don't know...doesn't it already sort of have a presence around us?\""
    m "\"Nescio...nonne iam quodam modo circa nos adest?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1441
translate latin end_game2_602fbe3c:

    # a "\"How much has that jackal been telling you? I swear—\""
    a "\"Quantum ille chacalus tibi narravit? Iuro—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1442
translate latin end_game2_916a36bd:

    # m "\"Hey, he's the only one that's been telling me anything about it. What else do I have to go on?\""
    m "\"Heus, ille solus mihi quidquam de eo narravit. Quid aliud sequar?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1444
translate latin end_game2_6b39c7dc:

    # a "\"Listen, [mc], all that is known for certain is that it exists and that it is a threat. The rest are stories and pseudoscience.\""
    a "\"Audi, [mc]: hoc tantum certe scitur, illud exstare atque periculum esse. Cetera fabulae et falsa scientia sunt.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1445
translate latin end_game2_b460865a:

    # m "\"Amicus, when I was in the university, I heard voices, telling me what might happen to us...\""
    m "\"Amice, cum in universitate eram, voces audivi quae quid nobis accidere posset dicebant...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1447
translate latin end_game2_3c8805f7_1:

    # a "\"What?\""
    a "\"Quid?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1448
translate latin end_game2_2cb45f02:

    # "I take a deep breath, deciding that I trust Amicus enough to tell him this, no matter how crazy it is."
    "Alte spiro, satis Amico confidere me statuens ut haec narrem, quantumvis insana sint."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1449
translate latin end_game2_34f977c8:

    # "When I finish, Amicus is quiet for a moment."
    "Cum finio, Amicus paulisper tacet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1451
translate latin end_game2_a67d2c17:

    # m "\"So...am I just crazy?\""
    m "\"Ergo...insanio tantum?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1452
translate latin end_game2_1412d42e:

    # a "\"No, and I don't doubt you at all. Would you be offended if I offer the idea that it could very well have been a dream?\""
    a "\"Non, nec de te omnino dubito. Moleste ferres si proponerem fieri posse ut somnium tantum fuerit?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1453
translate latin end_game2_d56e3228:

    # m "\"No, it probably was. It just worried me.\""
    m "\"Non, fortasse fuit. Tantum me sollicitavit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1455
translate latin end_game2_d70253ea:

    # a "\"As it should have. It sounds frightening.\""
    a "\"Ut debuit. Terribile sonat.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1456
translate latin end_game2_be87cbf2:

    # "Amicus pulls me against his side again."
    "Amicus rursus me ad latus suum trahit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1457
translate latin end_game2_a1c64716:

    # a "\"But I'm very happy you told me, and I hope you'll tell me if you experience anything else. After what we have been through, I think we should be open to all possibilities.\""
    a "\"Sed valde gaudeo te narravisse; spero te mihi dicturum si aliud quidquam experieris. Post ea quae passi sumus, omnibus possibilitatibus apertos esse debemus.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1458
translate latin end_game2_bf023949:

    # m "\"Yeah...\""
    m "\"Ita...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1459
translate latin end_game2_e2da8d3c:

    # "Just being able to talk to Amicus about it has made me feel better, that Amicus is taking this seriously even though it very likely was a dream."
    "Sola facultas de hac re cum Amico loquendi me refecit: serio eam tractat, quamquam somnium verisimillime fuit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1461
translate latin end_game2_b5044dd6:

    # a "\"But, in the very, very unlikely event that it was the Other, then the stories would indicate that it doesn't think on its own and simply works with what it has in your mind.\""
    a "\"Sed si, quod minime verisimile est, Alterum erat, fabulae ostendunt illud per se non cogitare, sed tantum iis quae in mente tua sunt uti.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1463
translate latin end_game2_4a1fba19:

    # a "\"It projects your own worries into your reality. But even then, it can't hurt you in such a weak state...and that's assuming that its remnants really do exist in the first place.\""
    a "\"Tuos timores in res tibi veras proicit. Tamen ne sic quidem tam debile te laedere potest...si reliquiae eius omnino exstant.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1464
translate latin end_game2_50e6278d:

    # m "\"Hmm, well, I'm glad the palace isn't haunted.\""
    m "\"Hmm, gaudeo igitur palatium non infestari.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1465
translate latin end_game2_62e89a4b:

    # a "\"Heh, well, having lived there all my life, I can guarantee you that is the case. I've never seen anything unexplainable there. This forest on the other hand...\""
    a "\"Haha, cum ibi totam vitam habitaverim, hoc tibi confirmare possum. Nihil ibi inexplicabile vidi. Haec autem silva...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1466
translate latin end_game2_df8ec4bc_1:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"Quid?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1467
translate latin end_game2_0e0f2ec4:

    # a "\"Well, some say a creature called the {i}Simiarbor{/i} lives within the forests surrounding the city.\""
    a "\"Quidam aiunt creaturam nomine {i}Simiarbor{/i} in silvis urbem cingentibus habitare.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1468
translate latin end_game2_73453da0:

    # m "\"Oh yeah?\""
    m "\"O, ita?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1470
translate latin end_game2_e1e9ed40:

    # "Amicus sees my smile."
    "Amicus risum meum videt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1471
translate latin end_game2_b27eeec6:

    # a "\"Oh yes, it's actually thought to be a primate of some sort, and climbs and jumps from tree to tree.\""
    a "\"Ita, simia quaedam esse putatur, quae ascendit atque ex arbore in arborem salit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1472
translate latin end_game2_33ffb7ed:

    # a "\"It's completely black, and its face is on the opposite side of its head so that its red, glowing eyes can stare at you while it clings to the branches.\""
    a "\"Omnino nigra est, vultu in adversa capitis parte posito, ut rubri lucentesque oculi te intueantur dum ramis haeret.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1473
translate latin end_game2_c46aa755:

    # "I can tell Amicus is trying to scare me, and even though I feel a little creeped out, his own presence makes it almost impossible to feel scared."
    "Amicum me terrere conari intellego; quamquam paulum horreo, praesentia eius timere paene impossibile facit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1474
translate latin end_game2_d9dd9b20:

    # m "\"Yeah? And you've seen it?\""
    m "\"Ita? Et vidisti?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1476
translate latin end_game2_c2464ee1:

    # a "\"I've heard strange noises and maybe movement in the trees while out hunting before.\""
    a "\"Miros sonos atque fortasse motus in arboribus antea venans audivi.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1477
translate latin end_game2_15c5dfb2:

    # m "\"Yeah, alright.\""
    m "\"Ita, bene.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1478
translate latin end_game2_f22f1d8b:

    # "Amicus smirks at me as we continue walking, and even though I know he's teasing me, I still feel that prickle of paranoia on the back of my neck."
    "Amicus mihi subridet dum ambulare pergimus; quamquam scio eum iocari, sollicitudinis stimulum in cervice adhuc sentio."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1480
translate latin end_game2_f6d35083:

    # "I distract myself by telling Amicus about our own primate cryptids back on Earth."
    "Me distraho, Amico de nostris in Terra simiis occultis narrans."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1481
translate latin end_game2_972ba884:

    # "Despite the bad start to our Lover's Day, I find myself happy, just being able to have this strange conversation with my wolf."
    "Quamquam Dies Amantium male coepit, laetus sum quod hunc mirum sermonem cum lupo meo habere possum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1485
translate latin end_game2_209eb206:

    # "Com sends our food, mostly leftovers from the dinner that we'd missed, out to us in a floating basket as Amicus prepares the sightseer."
    "Com cibos, maxima ex parte reliquias cenae quam praetermisimus, in cista volante nobis mittit, dum Amicus Spectatricem parat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1486
translate latin end_game2_ce0df67f:

    # "We board and soon enough we're heading out toward the island, the one that I haven't been to since I followed Alex there with Neferu."
    "Ascendimus; mox ad insulam contendimus, ubi non fui ex quo Alex cum Neferu secutus sum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1487
translate latin end_game2_76c33344:

    # "Being so late at night, or rather early in the morning, was refreshing compared to the humid mornings and afternoons."
    "Tam sero noctu, vel potius tam primo mane, reficimur, contra quam humidis matutinis pomeridianisque horis."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1488
translate latin end_game2_70fca207:

    # "Amicus is clearly enjoying it, his elbows on the railing of our craft, leaning back, head tilted up toward the sky, a slight smile on his face."
    "Amicus clare gaudet: cubitis margini navis innixis reclinat se, capite ad caelum tollendo, levi risu in vultu."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1489
translate latin end_game2_34e8d1d5:

    # "His fur whips around gently on his face and torso, and that single fang that always pokes out under his lip glints softly under the light of the celestial bodies above us."
    "Pili vultus corporisque leniter moventur; unus ille dens qui semper sub labro prominet in caelestium corporum luce leniter scintillat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1490
translate latin end_game2_7e202672:

    # "He looks so peaceful, something he deserves more than anything."
    "Tam tranquillus videtur, quod maxime omnium meretur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1491
translate latin end_game2_f24922b1:

    # "So I savor the moment, trying to capture this image perfectly in my mind, knowing that not so long from now, I'll want to be able to look back on this when I'm out on my own."
    "Ita momento fruor atque hanc imaginem perfecte animo imprimere conor, sciens me non multo post eam memoriam repetere velle cum solus ero."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1492
translate latin end_game2_49a262c7:

    # "I bite my lip and blink back the small threat of tears just in time before Amicus's eyes open again."
    "Labrum mordeo et lacrimas imminentes oculis reprimo, modo antequam Amicus eos rursus aperit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1494
translate latin end_game2_cb31ac03:

    # a "\"Despite everything seemingly getting in our way, we WILL have to travel for a few weeks together before you might leave.\""
    a "\"Quamquam omnia nobis obstare videntur, CERTE aliquot hebdomades una iter faciemus antequam abeas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1495
translate latin end_game2_78d2b33b:

    # m "\"Oh, for what?\""
    m "\"Qua causa?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1496
translate latin end_game2_e5c6895a:

    # a "\"For you to tour the moon, and also for us to pick up Cassius from the final city in his destination. It will give you an opportunity to see most of Adastra so that you better understand the moon.\""
    a "\"Ut lunam circumeas atque Cassium ex ultima itineris eius urbe recipiamus. Facultatem maximam Adastrae partem videndi habebis, ut lunam melius intellegas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1497
translate latin end_game2_a990038f:

    # "Amicus winks."
    "Amicus connivet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1499
translate latin end_game2_891d24be:

    # a "\"And it has been decreed by the parents, so there's no getting out of it.\""
    a "\"Et Parentes id decreverunt; itaque vitari non potest.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1500
translate latin end_game2_40f89502:

    # m "\"Don't I know it.\""
    m "\"Id quidem scio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1501
translate latin end_game2_34d286aa:

    # "I feel both happiness at the idea of having some guaranteed time with Amicus, while also feeling that pang of resentment at the thought of the parents making it happen."
    "Laetor quidem quod tempus certum cum Amico mihi erit; simul tamen indignationem sentio cum cogito Parentes hoc facere."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1504
translate latin end_game2_80b5aec8:

    # "Our craft pushes up onto the beach, and Amicus hops out before reaching out a paw to help me down onto the sand, even though he doesn't have to."
    "Navis nostra in litus fertur; Amicus exsilit, deinde manum porrigit ut me in arenam descendentem adiuvet, quamquam non debet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1505
translate latin end_game2_2a3f8d1c:

    # "I bring the blanket while Amicus carries the basket, and we set things out in roughly the same spot we did all those months ago in my first weeks here."
    "Stragulam fero dum Amicus cistam portat; omnia eodem fere loco ponimus quo ante tot menses, primis meis hic hebdomadibus, posuimus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1506
translate latin end_game2_8617fae0:

    # "Only months..."
    "Menses tantum..."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1507
translate latin end_game2_c26635c9:

    # "It feels like years."
    "Anni videntur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1509
translate latin end_game2_476eccad:

    # "As we set out the food, I do kind of wish we had Neapolitan pizza as I see the usual bread, cheese, olives, and poultry, along with various vegetables I've never been able to identify."
    "Cibos ponentes paulum opto pizzam Neapolitanam habere, cum solitum panem, caseum, olivas atque aves coctas video, cum variis holeribus quae numquam agnoscere potui."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1510
translate latin end_game2_baee54f7:

    # "Still, it's good enough, and I'm just happy to lounge next to Amicus while we eat."
    "Tamen satis bonum est; laetor tantum quod iuxta Amicum reclinare possum dum edimus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1511
translate latin end_game2_2ea7b961:

    # "Again, it's in that comfortable silence that I always enjoy with my wolf."
    "Rursus in illo commodo silentio sumus quo cum lupo meo semper gaudeo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1512
translate latin end_game2_8261cb74:

    # "Silence that doesn't have to be filled with anything except the sounds of chewing, which mostly come from Amicus."
    "Silentium quod nulla re praeter masticationis sonos, maxime Amici, impleri debet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1513
translate latin end_game2_21a09370:

    # "After a while though, he breaks the silence with something that almost makes me choke on my {i}virdi{/i}."
    "Post paulum tamen silentium ea re rumpit qua {i}virdi{/i} meo paene strangulor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1515
translate latin end_game2_e657b7aa:

    # a "\"So...how do humans get married? You present a ring, correct?\""
    a "\"Igitur...quomodo homines matrimonium ineunt? Anulum praebetis, nonne?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1516
translate latin end_game2_9f19e41d:

    # "I cough loudly for a second while Amicus stares."
    "Clare paulisper tussio, Amico me intuente."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1518
translate latin end_game2_012c0fd7_2:

    # a "\"Are you alright?\""
    a "\"Bene vales?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1519
translate latin end_game2_23096c79:

    # m "\"What do you mean by that?\""
    m "\"Quid hoc dicere vis?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1520
translate latin end_game2_35bf4bbb:

    # "I stare at Amicus, then look around, trying to spot something that might tell me what the wolf is up to."
    "Amicum intueor, deinde circumspicio, aliquid quaerens quod ostendat quid lupus agat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1521
translate latin end_game2_78905d47:

    # a "\"I am just curious.\""
    a "\"Scire tantum cupio.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1522
translate latin end_game2_a0a343ae:

    # m "\"That's what you said when you asked about dating.\""
    m "\"Id dixisti cum de intima consuetudine quaereres.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1524
translate latin end_game2_d6acf0dd:

    # a "\"Oh yes...\""
    a "\"Ah, ita...\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1526
translate latin end_game2_9c5ad23a:

    # a "\"Are you suspecting that I might ask for your paw in marriage?\""
    a "\"Putasne me manum tuam in matrimonium petiturum esse?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1527
translate latin end_game2_c1fda584:

    # "Even though Amicus is grinning teasingly, I can tell that he's blushing even under the moonlight."
    "Quamquam Amicus iocose arridet, eum etiam sub lunae luce erubescere intellego."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1528
translate latin end_game2_5ec998ca:

    # m "\"You didn't think asking something like that would make me suspicious?\""
    m "\"Non putabas talem quaestionem me suspiciosum facere?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1530
translate latin end_game2_6f5698ee:

    # a "\"Well, I don't know. It's an interesting topic that has never been brought up. Two males cannot be married anyway, let alone ones from different species.\""
    a "\"Nescio. Res curiosa est quae numquam tractata est. Ceterum, duo mares matrimonium inire non possunt, nedum diversarum specierum.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1531
translate latin end_game2_c7bbc0d8:

    # "I feel myself calm down a little, not sure how I would have reacted if Amicus had just whipped out a ring then and there."
    "Paulum tranquillus fio, nesciens quomodo respondissem si Amicus statim anulum protulisset."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1532
translate latin end_game2_49920ada:

    # "Amicus is still looking at me, expecting an answer."
    "Amicus adhuc me aspicit, responsum exspectans."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1533
translate latin end_game2_75a82a59:

    # "I swallow, then think."
    "Deglutio, deinde cogito."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1534
translate latin end_game2_79c386fa:

    # m "\"I guess you just propose to the person you wanna marry, then you go to the courthouse and sign some papers and it's official...I think. I don't know, I've never been married.\""
    m "\"Puto te eum quem matrimonio coniungere vis rogare, deinde ad curiam ire atque documentis subscribere; tum publice ratum est...ut puto. Nescio, numquam matrimonium inii.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1536
translate latin end_game2_bf925b1c:

    # a "\"And in some places, males can marry other males, right?\""
    a "\"Et quibusdam locis mares aliis maribus matrimonio coniungi possunt, nonne?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1537
translate latin end_game2_0cd535bd:

    # "I narrow my eyes."
    "Oculos contraho."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1538
translate latin end_game2_db2aa9d8:

    # m "\"How would you know that?\""
    m "\"Quomodo id scis?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1539
translate latin end_game2_18a18f5f:

    # a "\"Again, I've spent some time with your Nexus. It's only fair I do, considering you've been spending so much of your own time learning about Adastra.\""
    a "\"Rursus, aliquantum temporis in Nexu vestro egi. Aequum est, cum tu tam multum temporis Adastram cognoscens consumas.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1540
translate latin end_game2_1f0acfbe:

    # "I'm starting to see why Amicus might have been so busy these past months, starting up his own restaurant and learning human culture."
    "Intellegere incipio cur Amicus his ultimis mensibus tam occupatus fuerit, popinam suam condendo atque cultum humanum discendo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1541
translate latin end_game2_0193b426:

    # m "\"Well you're right, there are a lot of places on Earth where you can marry the same sex.\""
    m "\"Recte dicis: multis Terrae locis personam eiusdem sexus matrimonio coniungere potes.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1542
translate latin end_game2_f7870847:

    # "Amicus looks off into the lake."
    "Amicus ad lacum aspicit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1544
translate latin end_game2_d15f5134:

    # a "\"That does sound rather nice...What about Italy?\""
    a "\"Satis iucundum sonat...quid de Italia?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1545
translate latin end_game2_7ef092de:

    # "I glance at Amicus, noticing the interest he's been taking in the country he abducted me from."
    "Amicum aspicio, animadvertens eum patriam ex qua me rapuit diligenter considerare."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1546
translate latin end_game2_cce3ffd3:

    # "I suppose it's a place for him to look to for inspiration, a vision of what Adastra {i}could{/i} be, which makes sense."
    "Puto eum ibi exemplum quaerere, imaginem eius quod Adastra {i}esse possit{/i}; id rationem habet."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1547
translate latin end_game2_97813f07:

    # "It's the location of the uplift, of course, but it also has a turbulent history, and politics that have always been raucous and unpredictable."
    "Locus Progressionis est, sane; sed turbulentam quoque historiam habet atque res publicas semper tumultuosas atque incertas."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1548
translate latin end_game2_83421d9b:

    # "But considering where the country started, and where it is now, Amicus wouldn't be wrong to find inspiration there."
    "Tamen, patriae initio atque praesenti condicione consideratis, Amicus ibi exemplum quaerens non erraret."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1549
translate latin end_game2_e5c292b5:

    # "Again, Amicus is waiting for his answer, and I have to think back to what little I researched about the topic."
    "Rursus responsum meum Amicus exspectat; pauca quae de hac re investigavi memoria repetere debeo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1550
translate latin end_game2_4e892e3c:

    # m "\"Soooort of, I think civil unions are a thing, which is pretty close to marriage, but not really. I think if you marry someone from an EU country, you can—\""
    m "\"Aliquantummm: coniunctiones civiles exstant, ut puto, satis matrimonio similes sed non prorsus. Puto, si aliquem e patria Unionis Europaeae matrimonio coniungas, posse—\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1551
translate latin end_game2_05117008:

    # "I realize how Amicus might have no idea what I'm talking about, even though he seems to be listening intently."
    "Intellego Amicum fortasse nescire de quo loquar, quamquam attente auscultare videtur."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1552
translate latin end_game2_08d8a66f:

    # m "\"Anyway, yeah, sort of, civil unions. Mostly marriage, but not really marriage. I think it'll happen there soon, though.\""
    m "\"Ceterum, ita, quodam modo: coniunctiones civiles. Maxime matrimonium, sed non verum matrimonium. Puto tamen id ibi mox futurum.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1554
translate latin end_game2_192cd3df:

    # a "\"Hmm, sounds complicated.\""
    a "\"Hmm, intricatum videtur.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1555
translate latin end_game2_62f54373:

    # m "\"Yeah, it gets really complicated.\""
    m "\"Ita, valde intricatum fit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1556
translate latin end_game2_7cbc33a7:

    # "Amicus is still looking out at the lake."
    "Amicus adhuc lacum aspicit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1558
translate latin end_game2_986c1cb7:

    # a "\"You want to swim?\""
    a "\"Natare vis?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1559
translate latin end_game2_2cc7b95a:

    # "I blink."
    "Palpebras moveo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1560
translate latin end_game2_0efff087:

    # m "\"No, the water will be freezing.\""
    m "\"Nolo; aqua gelida erit.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1561
translate latin end_game2_88fdf521:

    # a "\"So?\""
    a "\"Igitur?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1562
translate latin end_game2_13713d12:

    # m "\"So I don't want to die of hypothermia?\""
    m "\"Ergo, quod nimio frigore mori nolo?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1563
translate latin end_game2_82aabc2c:

    # "Amicus guffaws."
    "Amicus cachinnat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1564
translate latin end_game2_37b639f9:

    # a "\"You really are a pup. It's not {i}that{/i} cold.\""
    a "\"Vere catulus es. Non {i}tam{/i} frigida est.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1565
translate latin end_game2_cec1cbb6:

    # "I roll my eyes, feeling a little whiplash from the sudden change in conversation."
    "Oculos in caelum verto, subita sermonis mutatione paulum percussus."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1567
translate latin end_game2_5d1b2f3a:

    # "Then I yelp in surprise as I feel myself get swooped up from the ground, easily held up in Amicus's strong paws."
    "Deinde admiratus exclamo, cum me ab humo tolli sentio, manibus Amici fortibus facile sustentatum."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1568
translate latin end_game2_ef84a8b4:

    # m "\"Hey!\""
    m "\"Heus!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1569
translate latin end_game2_30b2bb74:

    # a "\"I'll show you.\""
    a "\"Ostendam tibi.\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1570
translate latin end_game2_486a0250:

    # m "\"What!?\""
    m "\"Quid!?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1571
translate latin end_game2_ba8d6a2a:

    # "I struggle in the wolf's grasp, very much not in the mood to be dunked in freezing cold water."
    "In lupi manibus luctor, minime cupiens in gelidam aquam mergi."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1572
translate latin end_game2_4225ed6a:

    # "Amicus's strength can't be matched by me though, and the waves get louder as the wolf walks closer to the water's edge."
    "Viribus tamen Amico pares esse nequeo; undae clarius audiuntur dum lupus propius ad aquae marginem ambulat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1574
translate latin end_game2_9ccec687:

    # m "\"Amicus, my robe!\""
    m "\"Amice, vestis mea!\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1575
translate latin end_game2_a5fab8cf:

    # "Realizing that a dip in the lake is inevitable, I start to try and struggle out of my garments, but at that moment, I'm suddenly set back down on my feet."
    "Cum intellego in lacum mergi me vitare non posse, e vestibus me expedire conor; sed tum subito pedibus rursus in solo ponor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1576
translate latin end_game2_e95410ed:

    # "Dazed, I stumble."
    "Stupefactus titubo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1577
translate latin end_game2_d3f9a3b5:

    # "We're right at the water's edge where the waves are crawling up the sand just a few inches from my feet."
    "In ipso aquae margine sumus, ubi undae per arenam paucis tantum unciis a pedibus meis procedunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1578
translate latin end_game2_07a8f48a:

    # "The lake stretches out to my right, dark and expansive, the blackness broken by the shimmers of silver light reflecting off the rippling water."
    "Lacus ad dextram meam patet, obscurus amplusque; nigredinem argenteae lucis fulgores in aqua fluctuante rumpunt."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1579
translate latin end_game2_4e137279:

    # "It takes me a while to finally focus on Amicus."
    "Aliquantisper mihi opus est ut tandem Amico animum intendam."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1580
translate latin end_game2_bf16cc91:

    # "That's because he's kneeling on the beach, reaching up toward me with both paws, and I see what is definitely a ring held between the pads of his fingers."
    "Ille enim in litore genibus nititur, utraque manu ad me porrecta; anulum certe inter digitorum pulvinulos teneri video."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1581
translate latin end_game2_61f958ee:

    # "I stare."
    "Eum fixis oculis intueor."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1583
translate latin end_game2_0e8b0adb:

    # "Amicus clears his throat, his bravado from just a minute ago having quickly faded, replaced by a look he'd once worn when he offered me a bouquet of flowers in the gardens."
    "Amicus guttur purgat; audacia quam paulo ante ostenderat celeriter evanuit et vultus ille rediit quem olim flores mihi in hortis offerens gerebat."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1586
translate latin end_game2_968b7b82:

    # a "\"Will you...be my husband?\""
    a "\"Visne...vir meus esse?\""

# game/end_game2.rpy:1587
translate latin end_game2_d087309d:

    # "I continue to stare."
    "Intueri pergo."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1589
translate latin end_game2_0a3e6b05:

    # "Amicus stares back, clearly trying to keep a confident look on his face, but after a few more seconds, it fails."
    "Amicus me respicit, manifesto confidentem vultum servare conatus; sed post pauca secunda id deficit."

# game/end_game2.rpy:1591
translate latin end_game2_ca41d15d:

    # a "\"I—I know what I'm doing this time. I was sure to research it. I know what this means.\""
